    "text": "```markdown\n  [Step 7](<[[/Aperas-apeironngn-design.md/# ApeironNgn: Embedded Substrate Design/4. Rollout sequence/Step 7: `ArtifactNode extends BlockNode`, the root block retired outright, `text` a copied abstract for both — implemented, verified]]>)\n  ```",
