            "key": "position",
            "value": "400"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "Shipped the explicit-start service redesign",
    "text": "Shipped the explicit-start service redesign: `ensureServiceRunning()` errors instead of auto-spawning; `aperas service start`/`restart` (`kgService.ts`) are now the only places that read `process.cwd()` to resolve+bind the graph; the lock/socket moved to a fixed `$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR`-based location, independent of both cwd and code install path. Verified live in both dev and built-bundle modes — see [discussion](../discussion/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDXFWK3R001).",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
