    "title": "`kg:show <ref>` — relocated, not implemented",
    "text": "`kg:show <ref>` — relocated, not implemented: on reflection this is a TreeView/node-rendering gap, not a packaging one, so it moved to `AperasKG/artifacts/archive/Aperas-treeview-design.md` §16, to be picked up when that document itself gets migrated into the graph — see [discussion](../discussion/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDWB1Y6R001) for the original write-up of the gap.",
