    "text": "**What's the proper structure for `Aperas-design.md` (the pre-ApeironNgn roadmap)?** It doesn't map cleanly onto one subsystem's design/issues/planning/history/discussion shape like every other doc migrated so far — needs a dedicated brainstorm before that sub-task starts. (`Aperas-dev-status.md` no longer belongs here — see [Settled](../discussion/archive-migration.md#id/BlockNode:00CE0HD0HG002): it's TDB-era in origin and follows that era's already-settled approach.)",
