    "title": "`TreeView.unfolds` staleness",
    "text": "`TreeView.unfolds` staleness: Done. `pruneStaleUnfolds` (`node.ts`) sweeps every `TreeView`'s `unfolds` list at the same explicit-sweep points as `pruneUnreachableTombstones`, stripping any entry with no quads at all; `TreeView.unfold(ref)` refuses (no-op) a nonexistent ref at write time too. The corpus's live `.state/TreeView.jsonld` was already clean of stale ids by the time the sweep landed — no manual cleanup needed — see [Issues](../issues/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW638004).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1GW7CG003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
