    ],
    "title": "All three of [Task Breakdown](../planning/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CEA5M6S8005)'s batches have now shipped",
    "text": "All three of [Task Breakdown](../planning/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CEA5M6S8005)'s batches have now shipped: Batch 1 (the v1 restructure itself) as v1 through v1.3, Batch 2 (the read-side and code-side rules) as v1.4, and Batch 3 (the multi-agent split) as v3 and v3.1. v2 and its v2.1–v2.11 deltas landed in between, from user reads rather than from planned batch work.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CEA5MHD8002",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
