    "title": "00CEA68QVG003",
    "text": "[Issues](../issues/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CEA5KW4G002) — the open defects in the skill and its drift checker, among them the checker's truncated output and the unwritten rule on who moves the `Status:` lines.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE8XWZK0000",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
