    "text": "Confirmed only in the disposable eval sandbox (`skills/aperas-workspace/graph-sandbox.sh`); nothing on the live corpus was touched. Status: identified, not yet fixed.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CEF7TB2G000",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
