    "title": "**Planning**",
    "text": "**Planning**: [Core — Planning](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF23FB1G001) — the [Implementation Plan](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF23FB1G002) and the [Task Breakdown](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF23FB1G003) hold Batches 12 to 14 and 16, which build the engine of the design in the checkout `Aperas.dev/` on branch `js-apeironngn`; the [Verification Plan](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF23FB1G009) holds its tests; the [Archive](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XP4XK0001) holds the done Batches 1 to 11 and 15.",
