    "title": "## Task Breakdown",
    "text": "Batches 12 to 14, in the order the plan gives them, [Batch 15](#id/BlockNode:00D4NBFKAG001), which came first, and [Batch 3](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VG001), [Batch 4](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR006), [Batch 5](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR00H), [Batch 6](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR00V), [Batch 7](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR014), [Batch 8](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR01D), [Batch 9](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR01M), [Batch 10](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W0004) and [Batch 11](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C) being done. Each batch lists its steps, the design it implements, the filed issues it closes, the open points that gate a step, and when it is done. The tests of each batch are described in the [Verification Plan](#id/BlockNode:00CF23FB1G009).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CF23FB1G001",
