    "title": "## Pending Tasks",
    "text": "See [Task Breakdown](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF23FB1G003) for the plan of the engine of the design, and the [Archive](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XP4XK0001) there for the reconcile fixes that are done.",
