    "title": "**Scope**",
    "text": "**Scope**: `cli` is the thin dispatcher/verb layer over the shared `core` engine — see [discussion/core.md](../discussion/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF1WZE18001) for the engine itself and its sub-parts (`treeview`, `linking`, `list-consumption`, and `crud` once migrated). `cli`'s own sub-part is `packaging` (build/distribution/dispatcher). The third thin wrapper over that same `core` is [`webapp`](../discussion/webapp.md#id/BlockNode:00CJ2TCV40001), opened 2026-09-17.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CF2AEMER006",
    "type": "listItem",
