        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00CF4763DR001:links:Link:00CF4764TG000:props:StringProp:00CN3ZSXWR000",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "148"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "**v1 was snapshotted into the graph, by copy rather than by projection**",
    "text": "**v1 was snapshotted into the graph, by copy rather than by projection**: [v1 SKILL.md (verbatim, 2026-09-13)](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CF46W4Q8001) now sits beside v0's dump, split so every item is individually addressable. Copy, not a live projection, was the deliberate choice: a projection holds only the current version, so what a restructure *drops* would survive nowhere but git archaeology — and that loss is not hypothetical, since v0's presence in the graph is the only reason item 18's third trigger was found missing from v1. Successive snapshots make the skill's evolution the object of study rather than just its latest state. This milestone's link points *down* the gradient, which the citation-direction rule permits for a pointer that is the block's whole referent rather than one of many possible mentions.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CEA5MHD8004",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CF4D9XT0001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "## Vertical thread (v1) — which principles are realized below",
    "text": "Each of v1's Philosophy and Orientation principles was walked deliberately, in order, and matched against every Discipline and Mechanics item that operationalizes it. An entry below records a principle that has at least one realizer. A principle with **no entry, and therefore no backlinks, is unrealized** — that absence is a measurement, not an oversight, since the whole set was walked. The edges live here as mediating nodes rather than in the snapshot itself, because the snapshot has to stay verbatim to remain comparable across versions.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE8XWZJR001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
