    "title": "00CF4D9XT0002",
    "text": "**[The graph's substance is nodes *and* the links between them](#id/BlockNode:00CF46W4QG00D)** is realized by [Move a node; don't remove and recreate it](#id/BlockNode:00CF46W4QR009) — preserving the id is what preserves the links — and by [Citation direction](#id/BlockNode:00CF46W4QR00B), whose parent-pointer reasoning is the same principle applied to which way a reference may run.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CF4D9XT0001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CF4D9XT0003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
