    "title": "00CF4D9XT0003",
    "text": "**[The Apeiron is the source; the `.md` files are shadows](#id/BlockNode:00CF46W4QG00B)** is realized by [the edit loop](#id/BlockNode:00CF46W4QG013), whose step 3 (edit graph-first) and step 6 (project, then stage) are the principle turned into an order of operations.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CF4D9XT0001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
