    ],
    "title": "00CF4D9XT0006",
    "text": "**[Dense linking is the precondition for both](#id/BlockNode:00CF46W4QG00S)** is realized by exactly one item, [Promotion links at the origin](#id/BlockNode:00CF46W4QR00D), and only for the single case of a finding crystallizing up out of discussion. Note what that means: a principle asserted as the precondition for *both* deep read and deep write has one narrow realizer, added 2026-09-13 — before that edit it had none at all. This is the gap that prompted the experiment, surfacing as thinness rather than absence only because it was partially patched a day earlier.",
