    "title": "Record and verify",
    "text": "Record and verify: a v1.4 delta entry per changed unit carrying a `Supersedes:` pointer and nothing else in its text, `scripts/skill_drift.py` clean in both directions, and each of the five Open Issues moved to Resolved with the actual mechanism named rather than \"fixed\".",
