  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CFANC9KR001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "### Status by batch",
    "text": "The method above applies to every batch; what differs is how far each has actually been run. A batch is not closed by having a criterion, only by having run it.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CEA5M6S800D",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
