    "text": "**Tier 5 — not a graph-edit concern**: every open `treeview` item is read/view-state ([stale `unfolds` refs](../issues/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW638004), [a bare `unfold` mutating the default view](../issues/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW638005), [no raw single-node inspection command](../issues/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW638006), [`unfold` not marking tombstoned children](../issues/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE8T6W7G001)); both open `archive-migration` items are process/decision, not code.",
