    "title": "Order",
    "text": "Order: 2 first (highest leverage, 3-for-1 plus corrects the standing wrong note), then 1 (proven danger), then 3 (cheap, and every fix after it becomes easier to verify), then 4 (contained, same shape as this session's `findLeadInColonOffset` fix), then 5 and 6 (larger, independent). Each verified by an isolated script against the live source before any live-graph write, given this session's own near-miss on item 1's very bug class.",
