    "title": "00CGMVKC88001",
    "text": "[x] Investigated and fixed. Confirmed narrower in scope than first filed: `matchLeftoverByAbstract` is used only by `artifacts.ts`/`folders.ts` for artifact/folder rename detection, never reached by list-item matching (that path already goes through the Batch-1-fixed `matchKeyed`+`leafKey`). Both remaining call sites (`trackAllArtifacts`, folder rename detection) reproduced the position-sensitivity live — a scrambled 4-item removed/added pair, order-reversed, matched only correctly once the algorithm itself was replaced. Fixed by rewriting `matchLeftoverByAbstract` itself to exact-key matching with no positional requirement at all — the same shape `trackArtifactsScoped`'s own `matchByExactKey` already used for the scoped-rename path, now consolidated into the one shared function instead of two near-duplicate implementations — [issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF1WZ4JG005).",
