    "title": "00CJ3C27D0001",
    "text": "**A second casualty of the non-heading title re-derivation fix above: `issues/linking.md`'s own `ArtifactNode` title was corrupted to a bare block-id string, breaking its own path resolution** — the fix in [the item above](#id/BlockNode:00CGFE4SV0002) never excluded `ArtifactNode` targets, so a push to this artifact's own leading-summary text (found while auditing every `ArtifactNode.title` corpus-wide for a basename mismatch) silently overwrote its title. Full root cause, the `kgUpdate.ts` fix, and a second sibling case (`issues/core.md`) are recorded in [issues/core.md's Resolved section](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CGM54FX0001); manually corrected back to `\"linking.md\"` here, its own `.text` summary was already accurate.",
