    "title": "### Mechanics — inspecting raw node state now leads with `aperas show`",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v2's own raw-node-state section](#id/BlockNode:00CGF613WG00K), [its refs line](#id/BlockNode:00CGF613WG00M), [its on-disk-mirror caveat](#id/BlockNode:00CGF613WG00N), [its staging-area framing](#id/BlockNode:00CGF613WG00V)",
