    "title": "## v2.4 additions — delta on the v2 snapshot",
    "text": "Threaded onto [the v2 snapshot](#id/BlockNode:00CGF613VR001). This round is a correctness/completeness pass, not new discipline: a user-requested review of the GC-persistence and link-integrity-check fixes found both incomplete on first landing, fixed for real here, plus the frontmatter reformat (`>-` block scalar) that had never been re-recorded since it landed.",
