    ],
    "title": "## v2.6 additions — delta on the v2 snapshot",
    "text": "Threaded onto [the v2 snapshot](#id/BlockNode:00CGF613VR001). `aperas tree` gained a usable path reference, on a second attempt — the first put it on every line and was wrong, caught on review before it shipped further than this same session; the corrected design (issues/treeview.md) prints it exactly twice: once for the render's own apex, once wherever a `--view` render's viewcone zooms to a new relative root.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE8XWZJR001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CJ02JJM0000",
      "BlockNode:00CJ02QEF8001"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ02JJM0000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ02JJM0000:links:Link:00CJ02MQHR000",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00CHYJDBR8000",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
