    "title": "**TreeView**",
    "text": "**TreeView**: [Rendering](../design/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW4Y800G) and [Viewcone Zoom](../design/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW4YG008) are the semantics this UI renders — it re-derives none of them.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ2TCV40002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ2TVGC0001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
