    "title": "**Design**",
    "text": "**Design**: [the settled architecture, topology and workflows](../design/webapp.md#id/BlockNode:00CJ6TGSX8001) — normative current state, with the reasoning for each decision left here.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ2TCV40002",
