        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00CDGPTZ7G000",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ5FATY8002:links:Link:00CJ5FAXG8002:props:StringProp:00CJ5FAXG8003",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "176"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "00CJ5FATY8002",
    "text": "The Vite/Solid scaffold's eventual fate, and the workspace root's own directory name — both explicitly flagged as judgment calls, not the assistant's to make unilaterally. See [Freeflow: proposed package boundaries](#id/BlockNode:00CDGPTZ7G000) below.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ5ET5Z8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ5FATY8003",
