    ],
    "title": "**Slice 1 — `buildRenderTree` in core**",
    "text": "**Slice 1 — `buildRenderTree` in core**: promote `discoverCone`'s plan to a returned render tree, redefine `renderTreeWithView` as `toText(buildRenderTree(...))`, and add a `format` discriminator to the `tree` service op.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH0006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8000:props:StringProp:00CNSWA2EG000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "checked",
        "value": "true"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Slice 2 — per-run auth token**",
    "text": "**Slice 2 — per-run auth token**: generate at service start, store in the run directory at mode 0600, expose for the dev server.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH0006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8001:props:StringProp:00CNSWA35R000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "checked",
        "value": "true"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Slice 3 — HTTP listener**",
    "text": "**Slice 3 — HTTP listener**: loopback bind, op allowlist, the four auth checks, restrictive CORS preflight.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH0006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8002:props:StringProp:00CJ6V6CJ0005",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "checked",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Slice 4 — tick channel**",
    "text": "**Slice 4 — tick channel**: streaming NDJSON endpoint, `fetch()` + `ReadableStream` client with reconnect, unconditional refetch on reconnect, hidden-tab pause, and a distinct 401 state.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH0006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8003:props:StringProp:00CJ8F4RKG000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "checked",
        "value": "true"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Slice 5 — `FolderDiv` as a Solid component**",
    "text": "**Slice 5 — `FolderDiv` as a Solid component**: three slots onto three render tiers, fold and unfold via the arrow handle.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH0006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8004:props:StringProp:00CJ6V6CJ8001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "checked",
        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Slice 6 — links at two sites**",
    "text": "**Slice 6 — links at two sites**: link text as `cite-ref`, endnote list as `cite-note`, click-through both ways, one back-reference per position, hover popover that can promote a link into `unfolds`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH0006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8005:props:StringProp:00CJ8F4RX0000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "checked",
        "value": "true"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Slice 7 — zoom**",
    "text": "**Slice 7 — zoom**: ctrl-click to set an apex, breadcrumbs to zoom out.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH0006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8006:props:StringProp:00CJ6V6CJG001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
