    "title": "Published to npm",
    "text": "Published to npm: `aperas` shipped for real on the public npm registry (`0.1.2` through `0.2.6`), closing the gap between \"builds to a real `bin`\" and \"an end user can actually get it\" — see [Distribution](../design/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDW3R42G001).",
