        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**2026-09-25: markdown rendering merged from AnDT1211's `feat/web-markdown-rendering`**",
    "text": "**2026-09-25: markdown rendering merged from AnDT1211's `feat/web-markdown-rendering`**: four new renderer components — `CodeBlock.tsx`, `MarkdownTable.tsx`, `MarkdownQuote.tsx`, `MermaidDiagram.tsx` — so a node's own prose renders fenced code, tables, blockquotes, and Mermaid diagrams instead of literal markdown syntax, wired into `FolderDiv.tsx`'s content rendering. Same PR also added `fetchTree`'s own response-dedup cache (skip re-parsing/re-returning an identical `/api/tree` body across polls), `fetchGraphInfo`/`/api/graph` (the graph's display name, consumed by `App.tsx`'s `document.title` effect), and root-level `npm run dev`/`build:web` convenience scripts delegating to `packages/web`'s own. Merged via a rebase of this branch onto `main`; the conflicts (`RenderLinkItem`'s `id`-vs-`linkId` rename against this PR's added `text` field, and `fetchTree`'s caching against this branch's `apiFetch`/`fetchGraphInfo` additions) were both genuinely independent, non-competing changes — resolved by keeping both sides at every site, not by picking one.",
