            "key": "position",
            "value": "188"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Threads**",
    "text": "**Threads**: `artifacts/.threads/<agent>.md`, each subagent's own linear working record, the least mature tier. Gitignored and persisted to `.state/`, and cited by nothing outside itself ([threads](../design/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR3X3N08004)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDD68E80007",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
