    "title": "**First live run of the v3 loop (2026-09-27) surfaced skill defects before any code was written**",
    "text": "**First live run of the v3 loop (2026-09-27) surfaced skill defects before any code was written**: the run was [the `tree --format` task](../discussion/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CR6BEFQG001), reset afterwards as a failed try. It tested [v3 — the skill split across three agents](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR3XZ220001).",
