    "title": "**Settled**",
    "text": "**Settled**: whether `long` shows the truncated preview the view render uses today, or full text — full text, and there is no longer any other kind to choose between. [The cap-removal change](../discussion/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CR9ZBSB0001) removed length caps from every `aperas tree`/`aperas unfold` preview path ([now stated in design](../design/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CRA8JPFR001)), so `--detail long`, whenever it's built, has only full text available to show.",
