    ],
    "title": "**`aperas tree --view` doubles a link's `#id/` fragment when the stored href already carries one**",
    "text": "**`aperas tree --view` doubles a link's `#id/` fragment when the stored href already carries one**: `bakeResolvedLinkIds` in `packages/core/src/apeironNgn/node.ts` appends `#id/<target>` to every relative href it has a resolved `Link` for, whether or not the href already has a fragment. The base skill tells agents to write `[title](../x.md#id/BlockNode:<ID>)`, which is exactly that case. This belongs to the preview text of [Rendering](../design/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW4Y800G). Found 2026-09-27. Promoted to [issues/treeview.md](../issues/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CRCGRGJR006).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1DDF58003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CR81SWZR002"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR81SWZR002",
