    "title": "**The insert-transactionality fix covers a missing anchor but not a misplaced one**",
    "text": "**The insert-transactionality fix covers a missing anchor but not a misplaced one**: [A single `kg:insert` call isn't transactional](../issues/cli.md#id/BlockNode:00CF2AEAX0003) is marked Resolved, having moved anchor *resolution* ahead of hydration, verified only with a nonexistent anchor id. An anchor that resolves but isn't a child of the given parent is still rejected late, in `insertOrderedChild`, after the piped nodes are hydrated. Found 2026-09-27. Promoted to [issues/cli.md](../issues/cli.md#id/BlockNode:00CRCGZDT0001).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR81TAV8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CR81W4RG002",
      "BlockNode:00CR81W4RG003"
