    "title": "**Skill v3.1 — decisions from the first-run findings (2026-09-27)**",
    "text": "**Skill v3.1 — decisions from the first-run findings (2026-09-27)**: the orchestrator writes the skill change as code and hands it to the grapher to record. The three tool issues found in the run are held back as the test tasks for v3.1: [the `.state` tombstone leak](../discussion/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CR81SDX8001), [the doubled `#id/` fragment in `tree --view`](../discussion/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CR81SWZR001) and [the partial insert-transactionality fix](../discussion/cli.md#id/BlockNode:00CR81W4RG001).",
