    "title": "**Grapher survey.** The graph for the task",
    "text": "**Grapher survey.** The graph for the task: the governing design, open issues, planned items, prior history, and any drift between them. Source code is touched only to pinpoint an entry into the graph (*Entering the corpus*), never to map how the code behaves.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8004",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Coder survey.** No code changes",
    "text": "**Coder survey.** No code changes: map where the behavior lives, starting from the grapher's survey, and report where the code disagrees with it.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8004",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CR874TC8007",
    "text": "**Grapher files** the coder's survey, so the change starts from a recorded picture rather than one in the coder's context.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8004",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR874TCG000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CR874TCG000",
    "text": "**Coder change**, starting from the filed survey.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8004",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR874TCG001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CR874TCG001",
    "text": "**Orchestrator verifies** the diff and the tests itself.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8004",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR874TCG002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CR874TCG002",
    "text": "**Grapher files** the result.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8004",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR874TCG003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CR874TCG003",
    "text": "**Repeat 4–6** as the task needs, then the **grapher's finishing turn**.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8004",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR874TCG004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CR874TCG004",
    "text": "An Ask asks only for its receiver's kind of work. A grapher Ask that says \"find the source\" or \"map the behavior\" has folded the coder's survey into the grapher's turn, and the coder then starts its change from a code map nobody filed.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8004",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
