    "title": "**Recorded and promoted**",
    "text": "**Recorded and promoted**: the skill edit implementing these four decisions is recorded as [v3.1 additions — delta on the v3 snapshot](#id/BlockNode:00CR874TC8001), and promoted to design's [Orchestrator](../design/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR3X3N00003) (missing `## Freeflow`, staging, read-and-record), [The loop](../design/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR3X3N08001) (the full turn sequence, each survey on its own side, Asks citing their decisions) and [Skill packaging](../design/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR3X3N08007) (the loop lives in the base skill).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR81Y470001",
    "type": "listItem",
