    "title": "**`aperas check-links` still prints the old `[ApeironNgn check-links]` prefix**",
    "text": "**`aperas check-links` still prints the old `[ApeironNgn check-links]` prefix**: the [v2.11 delta](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CQYGPR50001) records runtime prefixes rewritten from `[ApeironNgn kg:X]` to `[aperas X]`, but `packages/cli/src/kgCheckLinks.ts` prints `[ApeironNgn check-links]` at all five sites (lines 44, 58, 61, 65, 79). The prefix had no `kg:` in it, which likely let it escape the rename. Found by the grapher, reproduced by the orchestrator, 2026-09-27. Filed as [an Open Issue in issues/cli.md](../issues/cli.md#id/BlockNode:00CR8XN9VG002).",
