    "title": "**v2.2 — Mechanics caught up to the toolset v2.1 itself relied on**",
    "text": "**v2.2 — Mechanics caught up to the toolset v2.1 itself relied on**: `aperas show`, tombstone hiding, bare-`unfold` peek, `pruneStaleUnfolds` and the run-leader fix had all landed without being folded back into the file's own Mechanics section, leaving it describing tools by their pre-fix state right next to a Discipline item already written in the post-fix one. Recorded as [the v2.2 delta](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CGN8W9M8001).",
