    "text": "**v2.9 — a layout repair, not a new rule**: two Orientation items written when the section had no subsections of its own were silently re-scoped the moment v2.8's new subsection landed between them and the pronoun (\"both\") one of them was written to supply. Each bold lead-in became the `###` heading it had already been acting as; nothing was reworded. Recorded as [the v2.9 delta](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CN8K8JCR001).",
