    "title": "**Evidence for the open question — agents need full text of a subtree**",
    "text": "**Evidence for the open question — agents need full text of a subtree**: no command returns a subtree's exact text. `tree`/`unfold` truncate, `show --text` covers one node, and projected files are off limits. Both the grapher (a `dump.sh` script) and the orchestrator (loops over `show --text`) built the same workaround on 2026-09-27. That argues for `--detail long` showing full text, or for a separate recursive read.",
