    "text": "**Decided — the skill asks for detailed records**: user, 2026-09-27. Subturns record friction as well as results: every workaround built, every call that failed, hung or was stopped, and every retry with what changed. The Report lists them as tool gaps for the grapher to file. The orchestrator edits the skill; the grapher records it.",
