          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "### aperas-grapher — Every invocation, Report step lists tool gaps too",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v3's grapher Report step](#id/BlockNode:00CR5GCSGG008)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CR9D8210002"
