    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR9D8210002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CR9D8210002",
    "text": "**Report.** A Report node citing what you found or changed, any open question, and every tool gap the turn hit (base: *Threads*); zoom `<p>-grapher-orchestrator` onto it; one or two lines of chat naming the view and anything the orchestrator has to decide.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR9D8210001",
