    "title": "### aperas — Mechanics — Updating an existing list item, the misleading \"if you include them\" clause fixed",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v3's text-change bullet in Updating an existing list item](#id/BlockNode:00CR5GCSG0001), [v3's text-clears bullet in Updating an existing list item](#id/BlockNode:00CR5GCSG0007)",
