    "text": "**Orchestrator verified the coder's Turn 2 change**: read the diff directly (`node.ts`'s `toText()`, `kgUnfold.ts`'s `previewChildren`), confirmed `tsc --noEmit` clean on both packages, and independently re-ran the coder's own checks against a fresh view — `aperas unfold`/`aperas tree` on `BlockNode:00CN1PKAQG001` (3509 chars) now print full text with no truncation hint, in both the node-row and link-row paths; `aperas backlinks --text` on `BlockNode:00CEA5Y5JG00C` still truncates, confirming `kgBacklinks.ts` was correctly left out of scope.",
