    "title": "**Decided — promote five tool gaps from discussion to issues**",
    "text": "**Decided — promote five tool gaps from discussion to issues**: User, 2026-09-27. to `issues/treeview.md` — [the `.state` tombstone leak](../discussion/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CR81SDX8001), [the doubled `#id/` fragment in `tree --view`](../discussion/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CR81SWZR001), [a tombstoned node staying in its parent's `children` array](../discussion/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CR9MCPXG001). To `issues/cli.md` — [the insert-transactionality fix covering only a missing anchor, not a misplaced one](../discussion/cli.md#id/BlockNode:00CR81W4RG001), [`update --text-only`'s misleading \"overflow prepended\" message](../discussion/cli.md#id/BlockNode:00CRBW8248001). Excluded: the stdin-less insert hang whose cause is unconfirmed — not promoted while the diagnosis itself is still open.",
