    "title": "**Repro**",
    "text": "**Repro**: `cat item.md | aperas insert BlockNode:00CGJHDK68001 --after BlockNode:00CGJHDK68001` (the item passed as its own parent) failed with \"insertOrderedChild: anchor … is not a child of …\" and left the live parentless orphan `BlockNode:00CR6BD1X0001` (since tombstoned).",
