    "text": "Dumped verbatim from the four v4 skill files, matching the snapshot convention used for prior major releases. Comprehensive rewrite across all four skills to eliminate verbose prose in favor of crisp operational clarity, committed as `fd574be` ([Skill v4 — comprehensive rewrite to clear form across all roles](#id/BlockNode:00CS0YM5H8001)).",
