  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593MG00S",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "##### Mandatory Initial Gate",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593MG00R",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CS1593MR000"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593MR000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593MR000",
    "text": "> [!CRITICAL]\n> **NEVER START WITH** file-reading tools (`view_file`, `cat`, `head`, `grep_search`) on any path under `artifacts/` before inspecting the graph via `aperas`.\n> An `artifacts/**.md` path in your hand is a **node reference**, not a file path.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593MG00S",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593MR001",
