    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593MR00P",
    "text": "Climb upward via its forward links until you reach `design`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593MR00H",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593MR00Q",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Finding Drift**",
    "text": "**Finding Drift**: Drift is the discrepancy where top-down design and bottom-up code/findings meet. Run both directions to confirm alignment.",
