    "type": "thematicBreak",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "#### 3. Recording User Exchanges",
    "text": "Record every exchange in the topic's discussion `## Freeflow` before acting on it:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N001Q",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N002K",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N002M",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N002N",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N002P",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N002Q",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N002R",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N002S"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002K",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002K:props:StringProp:00CS159820000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002K:props:StringProp:00CS159820001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00CS1593N002K",
    "text": "What was asked, what was decided, what was corrected, and why.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002J",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002M",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593N002M",
    "text": "Freeflow is raw material; the Grapher organizes and promotes it later.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002J",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002N",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593N002N",
    "text": "If the topic's discussion doc has no `## Freeflow` yet, create it.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002J",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002P",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593N002P",
    "text": "Record any friction you encounter yourself into Freeflow as well.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002J",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002Q",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593N002Q",
    "text": "> **Rule**: Every `**Ask**` must cite the Freeflow nodes for the decisions it relies on. A decision that exists only in chat cannot be cited and must be recorded first.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002J",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002R",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593N002R",
    "text": "The user's view is `<p>-<topic>`, zoomed onto `discussion/<topic>.md` `## Dashboard`. Point the user to it when graphical hierarchy is clearer than conversational text.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002J",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002S",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593N002S",
    "text": "---",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N002J",
    "type": "thematicBreak",
    "children": []
