    "title": "**Cite, don't retype**",
    "text": "**Cite, don't retype**: Point to the Report, filed entry, or design block via wikilink; do not duplicate prose in the Ask or chat.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N800G",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N800M",
