  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N800P",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "#### 6. Verification Protocol (Reading for Yourself)",
    "text": "In Step 7, verifying the Coder's work is the Orchestrator's responsibility:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N001Q",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N800Q",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N800S",
