    "title": "Stage changes in `AperasKG/`",
    "text": "Stage changes in `AperasKG/`:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG01Q",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG01S"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG01S",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG01S",
    "text": "```bash\n     git -C AperasKG add -u\n     ```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG01R",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG01T",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG01T",
    "text": "> **Rule**: A turn is not complete until Step 4 (Report and view zoom) is done.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG015",
