        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Promote**",
    "text": "**Promote**: Move recurring patterns to `concepts.md` and settled outcomes to formal docs with provenance at the origin.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR000",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Dashboard**",
    "text": "**Dashboard**: Update the topic's `## Dashboard` in `discussion/<topic>.md`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR000",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Check Links**",
    "text": "**Check Links**: Run `aperas check-links` over the whole corpus.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR000",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Project & Stage**",
    "text": "**Project & Stage**: Project modified docs (`aperas project <path> --flush`) and stage `AperasKG/`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR000",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Prune**",
    "text": "**Prune**: If the thread warned of reaching its size cap, tombstone finished tasks with `aperas remove` (never prune the current task).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR000",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NR006",
    "text": "---",
