  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR01C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "##### Skill Drift Verification",
    "text": "When modifying skill files, verify consistency with the graph record:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR01B",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NR01D"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR01D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NR01D",
    "text": "```bash\npython3 skills/aperas/scripts/skill_drift.py              # Check both added and dropped\npython3 skills/aperas/scripts/skill_drift.py --added      # Units in file not in graph\npython3 skills/aperas/scripts/skill_drift.py --dropped    # Units in graph not in file\n```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR01C",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR01E",
