    "title": "**Coder Survey — concrete line mappings and verification for the 4 skill refinements (2026-10-01)**",
    "text": "**Coder Survey — concrete line mappings and verification for the 4 skill refinements (2026-10-01)**: Mapped exact file lines and confirmed git tracking for the v4.1 refinements. (1) Dual memory/rules: `skills/aperas/SKILL.md` frontmatter description (lines 3-5), retiring legacy `.agents/aperas_memory.json` into `.agents/rules/aperas.md` (git-ignored via `.gitignore` line 9). (2) Native harness artifact demarcation: `skills/aperas/SKILL.md` Section 1 (lines 24-28) and `skills/aperas-orchestrator/SKILL.md` Section 1 (lines 24-28) strictly restrict harness artifacts to user communication. (3) Meta-task ownership: Coder exclusively owns git-tracked `.agents/` customizations, verified that `.agents/skills` is a symlink to repo-root `skills/`. (4) Positive behavioral bridge: `skills/aperas/SKILL.md` Section 2 (lines 44-96) reorders `View Triage & Management` ahead of traversal and gates, replacing passive paper warnings with an imperative view triage command. Promoted to [Architecture](../design/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CEA5Y5JG003), [Roles and write scope](../design/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR3X3N00003), [The loop](../design/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR3X3N08001), and sideways to [Freeflow Decision](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CTT270YR001).",
