    "title": "00CTTFFW0G00C",
    "text": "> [!CRITICAL]\n> **Codebase-Tracked Skill Check (Meta-Tasks)**:\n> When a task involves modifying skills, agent definitions, or `.agents/` customizations, check if they are tracked by git or symlinked to codebase paths (`skills/`). If tracked or symlinked, they are code work owned exclusively by the Coder role. The Orchestrator must NEVER edit them directly.",
