    "title": "**Resolution — subagent tool gap resolved and Orientation subsections reordered (2026-10-01)**",
    "text": "**Resolution — subagent tool gap resolved and Orientation subsections reordered (2026-10-01)**: Implemented and verified the decision recorded in [BlockNode:00CTVWQ9G0001](#id/BlockNode:00CTVWQ9G0001). Subagents are equipped with file-writing and CLI execution tools via runtime `define_subagent` (`enable_write_tools: true`) in active sessions and persistent frontmatter in `.agents/agents/aperas-coder.md` and `.agents/agents/aperas-grapher.md` across sessions. `aperas-coder` autonomously completed the real task of reordering `## 2. Orientation` in `skills/aperas/SKILL.md` (Mandatory Initial Gate first with positive bridge pointing to View Triage, followed by View Triage & Management, Entering the Corpus, and Three Traversal Directions). Verified cleanly via `skill_drift.py` (0 added, 0 dropped) and `check-links` (0 discrepancies).",
