    "title": "### aperas — Mechanics — Multi-Node Tree Piping, Anchors, List Updates, and Verification Scope",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v4 Anchor child constraint](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593MR030) [v4 Tree structure check](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593MR031) [v4 Ordinary text change](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593MR03C) [v4 Text and children replacement](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593MR03E) [v4 Symmetry rule](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N0002)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CTTFFW08001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78004",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78005",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78006"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX78004",
    "text": "| Operation | Command Pattern | Key Rule / Note |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Peek Node** | `aperas unfold <ref>` | Read-only peek; does not mutate view |\n| **Unfold into View** | `aperas unfold <ref> --view <name> --flush` | Adds `<ref>` to view's unfolds set |\n| **Inspect Backlinks** | `aperas backlinks <id> --text` | Inspects dependents and provenance |\n| **Render View Tree** | `aperas tree --view <name>` | Renders structured lens of the view |\n| **Raw Stored Text** | `aperas show <ref> --text` | Exact stored text undecorated (safe for editing) |\n| **Full Node State** | `aperas show <ref>` | Inspects props, tombstonedAt, links, parent, children |\n| **Insert Turn Node** | `cat turn.md \\| aperas insert <turn-id> --after <ask-id> --flush` | Pipes markdown subtree; appends or positions `--after` anchor |\n| **Zoom View** | `aperas zoom <node-id> --view <name> --flush` | Re-roots view onto current Ask or Report |\n| **Retitle Heading** | `echo \"## Title\" \\| aperas update <id> --text-only --flush` | **Must use `--text-only`** to preserve child blocks |\n| **Update List Item** | `echo \"text\" \\| aperas update <id> --text-only --flush` | Bare text updates text/title while **preserving children** |\n| **Replace List Item** | `echo \"text\" \\| aperas update <id> --flush` | Bare text replaces text and **tombstones unstated children** |\n| **Clear Checkbox** | `echo \"- text\" \\| aperas update <id> --flush` | Bare bullet `- ` removes checkbox entirely |\n| **Insert List Item** | `echo \"- text\" \\| aperas insert <parent> --after <sibling> --flush` | Unordered items **must include bullet `- `** |\n| **Reposition Node** | `aperas insert <node-id> --after <anchor-id> --flush` | **No stdin piped** moves node without reminting ID |\n| **Retype Block** | `aperas retype <ref> --to <type>` | In-place kind change (`h1`..`h6`, `listItem`, etc.) |\n| **Sweep Links** | `aperas check-links` (or `--repair`) | Verifies internal wikilink integrity |\n| **Restart Service** | `aperas service restart` | Flushes and restarts daemon from disk |\n| **Reload Disk State** | `aperas reload -- --discard` | Clears memory orphans after failed insert |",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78003",
    "type": "table",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX78005",
    "text": "```bash\n# 2. Turns & Hand-Off Zooming\ncat turn.md | aperas insert <turn-id> --after <ask-id> --flush # Insert Work + Report tree after Ask\naperas zoom <node-id> --view <name> --flush   # Re-root view onto node\n\n# 3. Safe Edits\necho \"## New Title\" | aperas update <heading-id> --text-only --flush   # Heading update (preserves children)\necho \"Updated text\" | aperas update <item-id> --text-only --flush      # List item update (preserves children)\necho \"Replaced item\" | aperas update <item-id> --flush                 # Replaces text AND tombstones children\necho \"- New child\" | aperas insert <parent-id> --after <sibling-id> --flush # List item insert\n```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78003",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX78006",
    "text": "Markdown piped into `aperas insert <parent-id> [--after <anchor-id>]` parses into an AST and inserts the entire subtree:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78003",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78007",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78008",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78009",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800A",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800B",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800E",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800H",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800J",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800K"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78007:props:StringProp:00CV2CG2G8000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78007:props:StringProp:00CV2CG2G8001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Multi-node piping**",
    "text": "**Multi-node piping**: You can pipe multiple top-level list items or paragraphs in a single command (e.g. piping `- **Work**: ...` and `- **Report**: ...` together). All piped root items are inserted as direct children under `<parent-id>`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Hierarchical nesting**",
    "text": "**Hierarchical nesting**: Nested sub-bullets beneath piped items parse into child BlockNodes cleanly attached to their parent items.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Anchor positioning**",
    "text": "**Anchor positioning**: The `--after <anchor-id>` flag positions the inserted batch directly after the specified anchor child (e.g. inserting Work and Report after the turn's `**Ask**` node).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Anchor constraint**",
    "text": "**Anchor constraint**: The anchor node must be a **direct child** of `<parent-id>`, not a descendant. Check tree structure first via `aperas tree` or `aperas show <parent-id>`. If an anchor is invalid, the insert fails after hydrating nodes into memory, leaving live orphans. Recover by running `aperas reload -- --discard`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Preserving Children with `--text-only`**",
    "text": "**Preserving Children with `--text-only`**:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800C",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800D"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX7800C",
    "text": "```bash\n  echo \"updated text\" | aperas update <item-id> --text-only --flush\n  ```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800B",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX7800D",
    "text": "`--text-only` updates the item's `.text` (and `.title` if a lead-in exists) while leaving all existing child blocks completely untouched.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800B",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Ordinary text change without `--text-only`**",
    "text": "**Ordinary text change without `--text-only`**:\n  Pipe bare text with **no bullet marker**:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800F",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800G"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX7800F",
    "text": "```bash\n  echo \"updated text\" | aperas update <item-id> --flush\n  ```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800E",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "*Note*",
    "text": "*Note*: Without `--text-only`, this replaces the item's text **and reconciles its children** (tombstoning any unstated child blocks).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800E",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Symmetry Rule**",
    "text": "**Symmetry Rule**: Whichever piece you do not restate without `--text-only` is wiped. If you pipe only text with no children and no `--text-only`, existing children are tombstoned. Restate whichever side you are not modifying, or use `--text-only`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Code/Engine changes**",
    "text": "**Code/Engine changes**: Run `npm run verify` (from `monorepo/`) to execute build, lint, and engine tests.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800K",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Skill-only changes**",
    "text": "**Skill-only changes**: Strictly **NEVER** run `npm run verify`! Running full test suites on skill edits causes unnecessary hangs, compute waste, and test timeouts. For skill-only changes, verify using:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800M"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800M",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX7800M",
    "text": "```bash\n  python3 skills/aperas/scripts/skill_drift.py\n  npm run aperas -- check-links\n  ```",
