    "title": "### aperas-orchestrator — Stateless Subagent Dispatch and Verification Scope",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v4 Run and Validate Tests](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N800S) [v4 Repo test command](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N800T) [v4 Verification documentation](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N800W)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CTTFFW08001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800P",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800Q",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800R",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800S",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800T",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800V",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800W",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78011"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800P",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800P:props:StringProp:00CV2CG2GG000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800P:props:StringProp:00CV2CG2GR000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00CV2CFX7800P",
    "text": "Ensure `## <topic>` and `### <task>` exist in both `.threads/grapher.md` and `.threads/coder.md` using graph CLI insert commands (see base skill *Step 1 Thread Initialization CLI Recipes*). Never access `.threads/` with filesystem tools.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800N",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800Q",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX7800Q",
    "text": "> [!CRITICAL]\n> **Universal Dispatch Discipline**:\n> Subagents in Aperas are **stateless workers**. Always dispatch a fresh subagent instance for every turn.\n> **NEVER carry conversation history across turns.**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800N",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800R",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800R:props:StringProp:00CV2CG2GR001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800R:props:StringProp:00CV2CG2GR002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Aperas Memory Model**",
    "text": "**Aperas Memory Model**: The Apeiron graph and `.threads/{role}.md` are the working memory, not the LLM's conversation history. Context is recovered cleanly at the start of each turn through the view (`npm run aperas -- tree --view <p>-orchestrator-<role>`) and the thread.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800N",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800S",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Preventing Transcript Bloat**",
    "text": "**Preventing Transcript Bloat**: Reusing subagent conversation sessions (e.g. via `send_message` in Antigravity) appends turns together, resulting in bloated transcripts (200+ steps, 250+ KB) dragging stale logs, failed tool attempts, and degraded reasoning into subsequent turns.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800N",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800T",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Antigravity**",
    "text": "**Antigravity**: Call `invoke_subagent` for every turn. **NEVER** use `send_message` across distinct turns.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800N",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800V",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Claude Code**",
    "text": "**Claude Code**: Call `Task` for every turn (inherently ephemeral and stateless).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800N",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800W",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Run and Validate Tests (Strict Scope Separation)**",
    "text": "**Run and Validate Tests (Strict Scope Separation)**:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800N",
    "type": "listItem",
