    ],
    "title": "**For Code/Engine changes**",
    "text": "**For Code/Engine changes**: Execute the repo test command (`npm run verify` from `monorepo/`).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800W",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800Y",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**For Skill-only changes**",
    "text": "**For Skill-only changes**: Strictly **DO NOT** run `npm run verify`. Instead, run:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800W",
