      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78016"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78016",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX78016",
    "text": "```bash\n     npm run aperas -- tree --view <p>-orchestrator-coder\n     ```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78015",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78017",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX78017",
    "text": "Review any specific nodes named in the dispatch message or Ask.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78014",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78018",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX78018",
    "text": "Start from the Grapher's survey cited in the Ask; do not duplicate graph exploration.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78014",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78019",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX78019",
    "text": "Recover context from earlier turns in `.threads/coder.md` if continuing an active task.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78014",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Execute Work**",
    "text": "**Execute Work**:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78013",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801B",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801C",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801D"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
