      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801B:props:StringProp:00CV2CG2HG003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00CV2CFX7801B",
    "text": "Perform code inspection or edits according to the turn's scope (survey vs implementation).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801A",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX7801C",
    "text": "Run tests or verification commands.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801A",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX7801D",
    "text": "Keep detailed notes for subturns (files inspected/modified, command outputs, line numbers, test results).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801A",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Record Work and Report in a Single Insert**",
    "text": "**Record Work and Report in a Single Insert**:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78013",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801F",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801H"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801F:props:StringProp:00CV2CG2J0000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801F:props:StringProp:00CV2CG2J0001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "Pipe both `- **Work**` and `- **Report**` in a single `insert` command positioned `--after <ask-id>`",
    "text": "Pipe both `- **Work**` and `- **Report**` in a single `insert` command positioned `--after <ask-id>`:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801E",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801G"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX7801G",
    "text": "```bash\n     cat << 'EOF' | npm run aperas -- insert <turn-id> --after <ask-id> --flush\n     - **Work**: <approach in a sentence>\n       - Subturn 1 (<focus>): <exact details, files inspected/changed, commands run, failure lines, results>\n       - Subturn 2 (<focus>): <details>\n     - **Report**: <outcome in a sentence>\n       - [<node or file ref>](...) — <what changed, or what it shows>\n       - **Question**: <whatever the Ask left unsettled or unexpected code behaviors>\n       - **Tool gap — <what>**: <workaround built, call that failed or hung>\n     EOF\n     ```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801F",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "*Note*",
    "text": "*Note*: Writing Work and Report in a single piped AST insertion guarantees atomic recording and avoids orphan nodes.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801E",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
