    "title": "### aperas — Section 4 Mechanics Cheatsheet & Two-Repo Pathing",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v4 Command Reference Table](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593MR02C) [v4 Traversal Commands](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593MR02E) [v4.1 Symlink Warning](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX70009) [v4.1 Two-Repo Workspace](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7000H) [v4.1 Code Repo](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7000J) [v4.1 KG Repo](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7000K) [v4.1 Tracked Symlink](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7000M) [v4.1 Resolution Rule](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7000P) [v4.1 Artifact Path Correct](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CV6K8007) [v4.1 Artifact Path Incorrect](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CV6K8008) [v4.1 Thread Path Correct](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CV6K800A) [v4.1 Thread Path Incorrect](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CV6K800B) [v4.1 Cheatsheet Table](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX78004) [v4.1 Command Recipes](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX78005) [v4.1 Piped Markdown AST Parsing](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX78006) [v4.1 Multi-Node Piping](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX78007) [v4.1 Hierarchical Nesting](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX78008) [v4.1 Anchor Positioning](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX78009) [v4.1 Anchor Constraint](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800A) [v4.1 Preserving Children](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800B) [v4.1 Text-Only Command](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800C) [v4.1 Text-Only Note](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800D) [v4.1 Ordinary Text Change](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800E) [v4.1 Bare Text Command](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800F) [v4.1 Restating Children Note](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800G) [v4.1 Symmetry Rule](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800H) [v4.1 Code Engine Changes](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800J)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV3K19NR001",
