    "title": "### aperas-coder & aperas-grapher — Dual CLI Reference Pointers",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v4.1 Coder Reference Pointer](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801Y) [v4.1 Grapher Reference Pointer](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7802T)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV3K19NR001",
