    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV3K19P000C",
    "text": "For everyday CLI commands, consult the **Section 4 (Mechanics)** cheatsheet in the base skill (`skills/aperas/SKILL.md`). For comprehensive syntax rules, anchor constraints, AST tree piping, list mutation subtleties, recovery, and troubleshooting, refer to [`skills/aperas/references/mechanics.md`](../aperas/references/mechanics.md).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P000B",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
