    "title": "**Finding — 100% reproduction of initial package.json ENOENT failure (Antigravity)**",
    "text": "**Finding — 100% reproduction of initial package.json ENOENT failure (Antigravity)**: In every Antigravity subagent trace across all roles (Grapher Turn 1, Coder Turn 1, Grapher Turn 2), the subagent's very first tool call failed with Exit Code 254 (`npm ERR! code ENOENT: open /home/will/source/Aperas/package.json`). Antigravity subagents inherit the workspace root (`/home/will/source/Aperas`), whereas `package.json` and the CLI package live in `monorepo/`. They waste 1–2 turns discovering `monorepo/` and switching working directories.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV3WG2C0001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
