    "title": "**Finding — skill bodies use `npm run aperas`**",
    "text": "**Finding — skill bodies use `npm run aperas`**: Subagent skills (and some other skills) still write `npm run aperas -- <verb>` in their bodies instead of the standard `aperas <verb>`. The user raised this after the Antigravity/Claude working-directory comparison. Resolved: the four `SKILL.md` bodies, the `aperas_gate.py` deny message and `kg-doc-ingest` now use the bare `aperas <verb>` form, and the v4.3 delta in this document records the change (`grep -rn 'npm run aperas' skills/` finds nothing).",
