    "text": "**Open — how to instruct insiders on working directory**: (resolved by the global `aperas` shim decision below) Options were A (callout clauses), B (A plus an orchestrator dispatch `Cwd` note) and C (a global dev `aperas` that runs live source from anywhere). The user chose C.",
