    "title": "**Finding — the global `aperas` shim works in every environment used here**",
    "text": "**Finding — the global `aperas` shim works in every environment used here**: The user installed a shim at `~/.local/bin/aperas` that runs `cd /home/will/source/Aperas/monorepo && exec env -u LD_LIBRARY_PATH node_modules/.bin/tsx packages/cli/src/aperas.ts \"$@\"`, so bare `aperas <verb>` runs live source from any directory.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVH7KCP8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CVHQ92ZG002",
