    "title": "Claude Code in Opcode",
    "text": "Claude Code in Opcode: bare `aperas profile list claude` run from `/tmp` returned the profile's views. `~/.local/bin` is on `PATH`, and the shim's `env -u LD_LIBRARY_PATH` removes Opcode's bundled-library `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` that breaks node.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVHQ92ZG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVHQ92ZG003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Antigravity",
    "text": "Antigravity: its running processes (language servers and the IDE terminal bash) have `~/.local/bin` on `PATH`, and the user had an Antigravity agent confirm that the global `aperas` command works everywhere as expected.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVHQ92ZG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVHQ92ZG004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CVHQ92ZG004",
    "text": "A clean environment with `PATH` limited to `/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin` does not find it. Neither environment used here is stripped like that.",
