    "title": "**Finding — `check-links` and the insert link summary miss an id link whose target does not exist**",
    "text": "**Finding — `check-links` and the insert link summary miss an id link whose target does not exist**: An orchestrator Ask (`BlockNode:00CVJV0S7G002`) carried the link `[...](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CVJPV978002)`, and no such node existed (`aperas show BlockNode:00CVJPV978002` failed with \"Node ... not found\"). The link record's `target` held that id. The insert reported \"Links: 3 resolved, 0 dangling, 3 changed\", and a later `aperas check-links` reported a clean pass (3586 live blocks, 0 discrepancies) while the link was still in place. The text was corrected by hand afterwards, so the broken state is gone and a repro is still needed.",
