    "title": "**Observation — a spurious \"not running\" while the service was up, again**",
    "text": "**Observation — a spurious \"not running\" while the service was up, again**: In the `check-links` issue turn, the grapher's `aperas insert` and `aperas project` each failed twice with \"No ApeironNgn service running\" while the service was running, and an unchanged retry worked both times. This matches the earlier observation that the process stayed alive during a drop, and points at the client's discovery or connection step, not the service dying.",
