  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVKY8V6R003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Finding — the `Status:` lines and the grapher's drift section**",
    "text": "**Finding — the `Status:` lines and the grapher's drift section**: (coder survey) Four `Status:` lines, each directly under its H1 and all matching `^Status:\\s+\\*\\*v(\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)*)\\*\\*`: `skills/aperas/SKILL.md:10`, `skills/aperas-coder/SKILL.md:11`, `skills/aperas-orchestrator/SKILL.md:12`, `skills/aperas-grapher/SKILL.md:11`, each reading v4.2. A fifth, `skills/kg-doc-ingest/SKILL.md:14` (`Status: **v0** — ...`), is a long prose line outside the shared graph record. The grapher's drift section is `skills/aperas-grapher/SKILL.md:152` (`## 6. Grapher Tool Mechanics`), `:154` (`### Skill Drift Verification`), `:155` (\"When modifying skill files, verify consistency with the graph record:\"), the code fence `:156-160` (bare, `--added`, `--dropped` at `:157-159`), then `:162` (`### Full Link Integrity Sweep`); a new Status-line sentence fits between `:155` and the fence or directly after `:160`. The skill-only verify chain `python3 skills/aperas/scripts/skill_drift.py && aperas check-links` is at `skills/aperas-orchestrator/SKILL.md:150` and quoted at `skills/aperas/SKILL.md:133` and `:277`.",
