    "title": "**Decision — the Status entries are four, one per skill**",
    "text": "**Decision — the Status entries are four, one per skill**: (the guard decision's \"one Status entry per skill\", as the v4.2 delta did) The v4.3 delta carries four `Status` entries, each superseding its v4.2 Status unit.",
