    "title": "**Resolved — the design states the decisions the edit settled**",
    "text": "**Resolved — the design states the decisions the edit settled**: [Threads](../design/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR3X3N08004) now says friction is any trouble (an own mistake, a tool-use problem or a tool gap), that each friction and each open question takes its own `Friction — <topic>` or `Question — <topic>` lead-in, and that the grapher files a real tool gap under the tool's issue while the rest stays in freeflow. [Roles](../design/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR3X3N00003) now lets the orchestrator read code, diffs and tests to check, assess or review a result or a claim after the gated first read. [Versioning](../design/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CF5N6B88002) now names the `Status:` check and the nonzero exit and says the check is gated, and [its new paragraph](../design/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CVM39ANG001) states how the `Status:` lines tie to the newest delta. This closes [Finding — the design calls the drift check mechanical, but nothing gates on it](#id/BlockNode:00CVKY8V6R007) and [Finding — the design is silent on the `Status:` lines, and the record disagreed with them](#id/BlockNode:00CVKY8V6R008).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVKQDJ2G001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
