    "title": "**Resolved — what the Grapher skill says about the version bump, in part**",
    "text": "**Resolved — what the Grapher skill says about the version bump, in part**: [Decision — bump the skills to v4.3 in this update](#id/BlockNode:00CVKQEDTG002) settles who bumps `Status:` and when: the edit that changes the skill moves the four `Status:` lines, and the delta carries a `Status` entry per skill. [Decision — the Status guard is a checker plus one line](#id/BlockNode:00CVKQEDTG001) put that into the Grapher skill's drift section as one sentence, and [`skill_drift.py` now fails](#id/BlockNode:00CVKV9DPG002) when the newest delta's version differs from the `Status:` lines. Still open: the delta's required shape (one `Supersedes:` line per replaced block, `Supersedes:`-only entries for removals) and the `---` folding gotcha, neither of which the Grapher skill states.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVK447WR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVM4B4KG001",
