    "title": "**Verification — the v4.3 delta and design filing confirmed**",
    "text": "**Verification — the v4.3 delta and design filing confirmed**: The orchestrator re-ran `skill_drift.py` from `Aperas/` bare, with `--added` and with `--dropped`: all exit 0, with 0 Status findings, 0 ADDED unrecorded, 0 DROPPED unaccounted and 183 superseded and accounted for. `aperas check-links` is a clean pass. The two staged files outside this task's edits, `artifacts/design/packaging.md` and `artifacts/issues/linking.md`, are the earlier shim-setup and `check-links` issue work, not projection drift.",
