    "title": "**Decision — file the History milestones for v4.2 and v4.3**",
    "text": "**Decision — file the History milestones for v4.2 and v4.3**: (user: \"Let's update History milestones\") `history/aperas-skill.md` gains v4.2 and v4.3 milestones, which now stops at v4.1. Done by the grapher, after the v4.3 edit is final so the v4.3 milestone describes what shipped.",
