    "title": "**Verification — the orchestrator sentence fixed and the v4.3 edit complete**",
    "text": "**Verification — the orchestrator sentence fixed and the v4.3 edit complete**: The orchestrator read the reworded section 7, item 3 (it now says the results match expectations, naming drift on exactly the edited units and a clean `check-links`). `skill_drift.py` exits 1 as expected: 0 Status, 19 ADDED unrecorded, 10 DROPPED unaccounted, 183 accounted for. `aperas check-links` is a clean pass. The coder's friction: piping `aperas tree` into `head` or `grep` throws an unhandled EPIPE at `kgTree.ts:114`, harmless but noisy.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVKQDJ2G001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
