    "title": "**v4.2 — progressive disclosure: the deep mechanics moved to an on-demand reference, and the core skill became a cheatsheet**",
    "text": "**v4.2 — progressive disclosure: the deep mechanics moved to an on-demand reference, and the core skill became a cheatsheet**: recorded as [the v4.2 delta](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CV3K19NR001). The exhaustive Mechanics material (AST piping, `--after` anchor rules, list and heading edits, retyping, renames, shell quoting, service recovery, link sweeps) left `skills/aperas/SKILL.md` for the new `skills/aperas/references/mechanics.md`, which each role skill points to. The base skill shrank to a cheatsheet under 300 lines, and all four skills moved to v4.2.",
