    "title": "**Resolved — the design and History carry the promotion timing and the two milestones**",
    "text": "**Resolved — the design and History carry the promotion timing and the two milestones**: [Multi-agent working, The loop](../design/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR3X3N08001) now says a defect or a gap is promoted to an `issues/` entry in the Filing Turn that records it, while recurring patterns and settled outcomes are promoted in the finishing step, as [Decision — issue promotion belongs to the Filing Turn, other promotions to the Finishing Turn](#id/BlockNode:00CVMH0MB0001) decided. [History](../history/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CEA5MHD8004) gains the v4.2 and v4.3 milestones, as [Decision — file the History milestones for v4.2 and v4.3](#id/BlockNode:00CVM9MMM8001) asked, written after the v4.3 edit was final.",
