  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVN94G68007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Resolved**",
    "text": "**Resolved**: the `npm run aperas` bodies and the `kg-doc-ingest` reference (the bare-`aperas` edit), the friction and Question lead-ins, the widened source-reading gate, the missing delta protocol and the `---` gotcha (the Grapher subsection and the checker's separator rule), the exit status and the `Status:` guard and the design's silence on both, the drift-expectation items and the verification chain, and the promotion timing.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVN94G68003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVN94G68008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Not an issue**",
    "text": "**Not an issue**: hand-back length following the harness (decided, no skill change); projections read for answers and the orchestrator's other misses (practice, none a tool gap); the repeated `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` workaround (an Opcode environment fact that the shim covers for bare `aperas`); the \"do not stage\" Ask (practice, the skill is unambiguous); the shim missing from a stripped `PATH` (documented setup in `design/packaging.md`); skills being symlinked and never parsed (a fact); unfold truncation (does not reproduce); raw-store scripts missing thread nodes (by design); units of 40 characters or fewer slipping past the added pass (the documented limit).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVN94G68003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
