    "title": "**Default — narrow the Status-lines issue, do not close it**",
    "text": "**Default — narrow the Status-lines issue, do not close it**: (orchestrator, not yet confirmed by the user) The issue \"No skill states who moves the `Status:` lines\" is partly met: the Grapher skill now says a delta titled vN needs one `Status` entry per skill and that a mismatch is a Question to the orchestrator, and `skill_drift.py` fails on a mismatch. What no skill says is who moves the `Status:` lines and at which step; in this version the coder moved all four in the same edit as the wording. The next grapher turn narrows the issue to that.",
