    "title": "**Preventing Transcript Bloat**",
    "text": "**Preventing Transcript Bloat**: Reusing subagent conversation sessions (e.g. via `send_message` in Antigravity or `SendMessage` in Claude Code) appends turns together, resulting in bloated transcripts (200+ steps, 250+ KB) dragging stale logs, failed tool attempts, and degraded reasoning into subsequent turns.",
