    "title": "**Claude Code**",
    "text": "**Claude Code**: Call `Agent` (the tool formerly named `Task`) for every turn. **NEVER** use `SendMessage` across distinct turns: it resumes a finished subagent with its whole conversation, which is what Antigravity's `send_message` does. A note to a running subagent within the same turn is fine and reaches it between its tool calls.",
