      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG002",
    "text": "`waitForReady` in `serviceClient.ts` polls `ping()` every 100 ms for 5 s (read), and `stopIfRunning` in `kgService.ts` gives the process only 10 s from the `kill`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG003",
    "text": "About 1 s of rehydrate and about 3.5 s of startup collection, plus the `tsx` compile, sit close to the 5 s ready wait.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG004",
    "text": "A service that misses the ready wait keeps starting detached while `aperas service start` reports \"did not become ready in time\", and the lock stays `starting` for a 10 s grace (read).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG005",
    "text": "The 5 s ready wait and the 10 s stop wait are therefore both shorter than the work they wait for on a dirty or just-started service.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG006:links:Link:00D0X1J4QR000",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00CVNX6A3R000",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG006:links:Link:00D0X1J4QR000:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4QR001",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "63"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG006",
    "text": "The shutdown limit fits \"didn't stop within 10s of SIGTERM\" in [the removal-stall issue](#id/BlockNode:00CVNX6A3R000).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG007",
    "text": "**Root cause**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVQHCEW8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG008"
    ]
  },
  {
