        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG008",
    "text": "**Boot and shutdown do their sweeps and flushes synchronously, and the cost grows with the tombstones** (read from `service.ts`, `serviceClient.ts` and `kgService.ts`; the figures are under Measurements)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG007",
    "type": "listItem",
