        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG009",
    "text": "**Boot** (read from `service.ts`) runs entirely synchronously before the socket exists, in this order:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG008",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00A",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00B",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00C",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00D"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00A:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4P0003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00A:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4P0004",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00A",
    "text": "The code fingerprint, the token, `rehydrateStore` and `stampAll` of both mirrors.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "The startup garbage collection",
    "text": "The startup garbage collection: `tombstoneVacuousContainers`, `pruneUnreachableTombstones`, `pruneStaleUnfolds`, then both flushes if anything changed.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00C",
    "text": "The creation of the 10 s and 3 s flush timers and the 30 minute idle timer, then `listen`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00D",
    "text": "Only in the `listen` callback does `markReady` flip the lock to ready, and the startup link sweep runs after that.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Shutdown** (read)",
    "text": "**Shutdown** (read): the SIGTERM handler runs in JavaScript, so it cannot run while an operation is in progress, and its body queues behind everything already waiting.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG008",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00F",
    "text": "Shutdown re-runs the three sweeps and both flushes.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG008",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00G:links:Link:00D0X1J4R0000",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00CVNX6A3R000",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00G:links:Link:00D0X1J4R0000:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4R0001",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "154"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "**The cost grows with the tombstones**",
    "text": "**The cost grows with the tombstones**: the next reload, startup or shutdown prunes each unreachable tombstoned block with the same full-store scan as in [the removal-stall issue](#id/BlockNode:00CVNX6A3R000), about 140 ms a node (measured per scan).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG008",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00H"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00H:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4P8000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00H:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4P8001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00H",
    "text": "Removing a 42-block task therefore adds about 6 s to a later start or stop (derived, 42 times 140 ms, not measured end to end), on top of the fixed 2.3 s and 1.2 s.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00G",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00J",
    "text": "**A reload** (any operation carrying `--reload`) runs all of this plus `rehydrateStore()` into a new `Store`, two `stampAll`s and a corpus link sweep in one synchronous run.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG008",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00K"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00K",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00K:links:Link:00D0X1J4R0002",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00CVQ4Z968001",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00K:links:Link:00D0X1J4R0002:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4R0003",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "116"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00K:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4PG000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00K:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4PG001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00K",
    "text": "The old store is left to the garbage collector while Oxigraph's WASM linear memory never shrinks (read; relevant to [the memory issue](#id/BlockNode:00CVQ4Z968001), untested there).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00J",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00M",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00M",
    "text": "**Measurements**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVQHCEW8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00N",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00P",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00Q",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00T",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00V",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00X",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00Y",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR000",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR001",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR002",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR006",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR007"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00N",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00N:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4PG002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00N:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4PG003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Boot phases on a scratch copy** (measured)",
    "text": "**Boot phases on a scratch copy** (measured): rehydrate about 1.06 s, `tombstoneVacuousContainers` about 1.2 s and `pruneUnreachableTombstones` about 2.3 s even with nothing to prune.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00P",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00P",
    "text": "**Shutdown on an idle copy took about 3.5 s** (measured) for the three sweeps and both flushes, before any per-node hard-delete work.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00Q",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00Q",
    "text": "**The startup link sweep takes 2 to 18 s, not 0.6 s** (measured; corrected 2026-10-10)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00R",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00S"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00R",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00R:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4PG004",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00R:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4PG005",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00R",
    "text": "The earlier figure was about 0.6 s, measured on a scratch copy.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00Q",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00S",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00S",
    "text": "On a scratch service the link sweep took 2.06 s after an event-loop turn and 17.7 s run straight after the boot sweeps, so 2 to 18 s (phases below).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00Q",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00T",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00T",
    "text": "**Conditions of the measurements below** (by the Coder in the store-size investigation, 2026-10-10): a scratch service with its own run directory and port, copies of the data under `/tmp`, single runs unless a count is given, machine load average 2 to 3.5; the live service not touched.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00V",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00V",
    "text": "**Start: the lock turned ready at 5.28 to 5.77 s in 6 of 6 cold starts** (measured 2026-10-10)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00W"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00W",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00W:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4PR000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00W:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4PR001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00W",
    "text": "It is made of about 1 s of node and `tsx` start, 1.1 s of `rehydrateStore` and 3.2 s of boot sweeps (`Rehydrated` is logged about 3.3 s before the lock turns ready).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00V",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00X",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00X",
    "text": "**The CLI printed \"did not become ready in time\" at 5.42 to 5.76 s in all 6, although the service was up 0 to 60 ms later** (measured 2026-10-10)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00Y",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00Y",
    "text": "**After ready, every command was refused with \"No ApeironNgn service running\" for 19.5 to 23.0 s** (measured 2026-10-10)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00Z"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00Z",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00Z:links:Link:00D0X1J4R0004",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00D0W05P08001",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00Z:links:Link:00D0X1J4R0004:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4R0005",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "93"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00Z:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4PR002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00Z:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4PR003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFG00Z",
    "text": "The cause is that the startup link sweep holds the event loop and the 300 ms ping times out ([the start entry](#id/BlockNode:00D0W05P08001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00Y",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR000:links:Link:00D0X1J4R0006",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00D0W02KPG001",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR000:links:Link:00D0X1J4R0006:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4R0007",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "176"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFR000",
    "text": "**The synchronous boot takes 5.3 to 5.8 s to ready and the link sweep a further 2 to 18 s, depending on whether an event-loop turn separates the phases** (measured 2026-10-10, [the scan entry](#id/BlockNode:00D0W02KPG001))",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFR001",
    "text": "**Stop: 0.6 s after SIGTERM when the service is settled and clean** (measured 2026-10-10; 1.96 s wall with CLI start)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFR002",
    "text": "**Stop: 12.5 s (2 of 2) after any `unfold`, `fold` or `zoom --view` has marked the service dirty** (measured 2026-10-10)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR003",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR004",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR005"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR003:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4Q0000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR003:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4Q0001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFR003",
    "text": "The shutdown sweeps are about 1.6 s and the two flushes the rest.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFR004",
    "text": "The same flushes ran 1.1 s and 1.5 s when the store had had an event-loop turn since the sweeps and 8 to 17 s each when it had not.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR005:links:Link:00D0X1J4R0008",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00D0W044DG001",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR005:links:Link:00D0X1J4R0008:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4R8000",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "80"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFR005",
    "text": "The client waits 10 s, so `restart` then errors out at 10 s and starts nothing ([the restart entry](#id/BlockNode:00D0W044DG001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFR006",
    "text": "**Stop: 18 to 21 s when SIGTERM arrives during the 17 to 20 s startup link sweep** (measured 2026-10-10)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR007:links:Link:00D0X1J4R8001",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00D0W00YCR001",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR007:links:Link:00D0X1J4R8001:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4R8002",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "119"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFR007",
    "text": "**A `reload` after a mutation took 74 s and 119 s on two scratch services, against 4.4 s clean** (measured 2026-10-10, [the reload entry](#id/BlockNode:00D0W00YCR001))",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFG00M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR008"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR008:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4Q0002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR008:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4Q0003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFR008",
    "text": "The old store left to the garbage collector, which Root cause gives as read, is measured there.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR007",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1HTFR009",
    "text": "**Not proven**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVQHCEW8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR00A",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR00B"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR00A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR00A:links:Link:00D0X1J4R8003",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00CVNX6A3R000",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR00A:links:Link:00D0X1J4R8003:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4R8004",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "83"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR00A:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4Q8000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR00A:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4Q8001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFR00A",
    "text": "That the shutdown limit is the cause of the \"didn't stop within 10s of SIGTERM\" in [the removal-stall issue](#id/BlockNode:00CVNX6A3R000): consistent with it, not shown to be the cause (shown 2026-10-10 for a service marked dirty by a view op: the stop took 12.5 s).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR00B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "The cost of `unfold`, `fold` and `zoom` is read and not measured",
    "text": "The cost of `unfold`, `fold` and `zoom` is read and not measured: each sets both dirty flags, so each causes a full content dehydrate within 10 s and a state dehydrate within 3 s.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR00C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Fix directions**",
    "text": "**Fix directions**: none decided.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVQHCEW8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR00D",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR00E"
