        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFR00D",
    "text": "The investigation's first steps are the ones that make the figures visible: one timestamped line per boot phase with its duration, the client logging its poll count and elapsed time when the wait fails, and sweep cost measured against tombstone count and dehydrate time at current node counts (measurements 6, 7 and 8 of the first measurements).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR00C",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR00E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR00E:links:Link:00D0X1J4RR000",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00D0W07DRR000",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR00E:links:Link:00D0X1J4RR000:props:StringProp:00D0X1J4RR001",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "179"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1HTFR00E",
    "text": "Whether the sweeps can run after the socket exists, or the waits can grow with the work, is a design question not yet raised; `design/` has no document for the service lifecycle ([the design-gap entry](#id/BlockNode:00D0W07DRR000)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1HTFR00C",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
