      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R002:props:StringProp:00D0X1T83R003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1SZ3R002",
    "text": "The old service (pid 220722, up from 16:16) reached 4.74 GB at 19:20 and 5.76 GB at 19:42, a rise of roughly 40 to 50 MB a minute over its last hour, with two threads at 100 percent CPU and almost no disk writes.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1SZ3R003",
    "text": "Its V8 heap limit is 2.1 GB, far below its resident size, so most of the memory sat outside the V8 heap.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1SZ3R004",
    "text": "A fresh service idles at 1.05 to 1.5 GB (median 1.34 GB, maximum 2.18 GB) over 379 samples and 63 minutes.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1SZ3R005",
    "text": "The whole graph on disk is 3.66 MB of JSON-LD, about 37,000 quads, so the idle service is roughly 350 times the data size at rest.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R006"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R006:props:StringProp:00D0X1T83R004",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R006:props:StringProp:00D0X1T840000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "Corrected 2026-10-10",
    "text": "Corrected 2026-10-10: the quad count is 41,752 by `store.size` and the 37,000 had no recorded method; the engine costs about 0.5 KB per quad, so the store itself is not 350 times the data (see Measurements).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1SZ3R007",
    "text": "The fresh service did not grow over that hour under light use, so the climb to 5 GB needs heavier work (thread-task removals) or a long uptime that the sampler has not seen.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1SZ3R008",
    "text": "**Root cause**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVQ4Z968001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R009",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R00D"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R009:props:StringProp:00D0X1T840001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R009:props:StringProp:00D0X1T840002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1SZ3R009",
    "text": "**Established mechanism** (measured by the Coder in the store-size investigation, 2026-10-10)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R008",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R00A",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R00B",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R00C"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R00A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R00A:links:Link:00D0X1T85R000",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00D0W02KPG001",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R00A:links:Link:00D0X1T85R000:props:StringProp:00D0X1T85R001",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "76"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R00A:props:StringProp:00D0X1T848000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R00A:props:StringProp:00D0X1T848001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1SZ3R00A",
    "text": "Memory is allocated per JavaScript wrapper and per full scan, not per quad ([the scan entry](#id/BlockNode:00D0W02KPG001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R00B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R00B:links:Link:00D0X1T860000",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00D0W00YCR001",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R00B:links:Link:00D0X1T860000:props:StringProp:00D0X1T860001",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "129"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X1SZ3R00B",
    "text": "A reload leaves the old store alive until an event-loop turn, each synchronous rehydrate adding a store of about 75 MB external ([the reload entry](#id/BlockNode:00D0W00YCR001)), which measures the reload hypothesis below.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R00C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X1SZ3R00C",
    "text": "The engine is not the cost, and the hypothesis that the store itself is that large is overturned (figures under Measurements).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R00D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Suspected causes**",
    "text": "**Suspected causes**: hypotheses written 2026-10-02 as untested (the reload part is measured, see above); no scratch run has reproduced the climb to 5.8 GB under heavy use.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R008",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R00E",
      "BlockNode:00D0X1SZ3R00G"
