    ],
    "title": "[The thread-task `aperas remove` entry](#id/BlockNode:00CVNX6A3R000)",
    "text": "[The thread-task `aperas remove` entry](#id/BlockNode:00CVNX6A3R000): the stall there was recorded at 3.4 to 4.6 GB resident, and it charges the full-store scan per embedded node.",
