  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X65RB000C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X65RB000C",
    "text": "After `gc()` and an event-loop turn the V8 heap fell to about 54 MB while external stayed at 282 and rss at 572.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X65RB0006",
