  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X65RB000D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X65RB000D",
    "text": "**The link sweep took 17,681 ms run straight after the boot sweeps and 2,060 ms after an event-loop turn** (measured 2026-10-10)",
