  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X65RB8003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X65RB8003",
    "text": "The same flushes ran 1.1 s and 1.5 s when the store had had an event-loop turn since the sweeps, and 8 to 17 s each when it had not.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X65RB000E",
    "type": "listItem",
