  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X65RB8004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X65RB8004",
    "text": "**The cost is superlinear in the number of live wasm-bound objects and not in the quad count** (measured 2026-10-10)",
