        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X65RB8005",
    "text": "On the bare engine with per-quad `store.add(quad(...))` (what Aperas does), 50k quads had 19 Mark-Compacts totalling 585 ms and 100k had 128 totalling 4,684 ms, with the add cost per quad 3 to 4 times higher.",
