    ],
    "title": "[The removal-stall issue](#id/BlockNode:00CVNX6A3R000)",
    "text": "[The removal-stall issue](#id/BlockNode:00CVNX6A3R000): this is the measured form of \"didn't stop within 10s of SIGTERM\" recorded there.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8VQZR00P",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8VQZR00R",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8VQZR00R:links:Link:00D0X8W1S0000",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00CVQHCEW8001",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8VQZR00R:links:Link:00D0X8W1S0000:props:StringProp:00D0X8W1S0001",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "0"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "[The boot and shutdown issue](#id/BlockNode:00CVQHCEW8001)",
    "text": "[The boot and shutdown issue](#id/BlockNode:00CVQHCEW8001): there it was read as \"consistent with it, not shown to be the cause\"; here it is a separate defect (a stop wait shorter than the flushes), so it is filed here and those two link to it.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8VQZR00P",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90001:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2NR000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90001:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2NR001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X8XR90001",
    "text": "**Symptom**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0W00YCR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90002",
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90003",
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90004"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90002:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2NR002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90002:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2NR003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X8XR90002",
    "text": "`aperas reload` after a dirty `unfold` took 119.05 s and 74.43 s wall on two fresh scratch services (rss afterwards 1.26 GB, VmHWM 1.04 GB).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR90003",
    "text": "A clean `aperas reload` took 4.41 s and 4.61 s on a warm scratch service.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR90004",
    "text": "A third read right after a clean reload exited 1 at 0.76 s with \"No ApeironNgn service running\" and its message was not captured.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR90005",
    "text": "**Root cause**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0W00YCR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90006"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90006:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2P0000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90006:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2P0001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X8XR90006",
    "text": "The old store is dropped by assignment, as `service.ts` line 379 does, and stays alive until an event-loop turn runs (read from the source; the effect is measured below).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90007",
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90008"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90007:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2P0002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90007:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2P0003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X8XR90007",
    "text": "Every term of every added quad is a wasm-bindgen wrapper registered in a `FinalizationRegistry` (`oxigraph/node.js` from line 1212, `vocab.ts` lines 58, 74 and 93).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR90008",
    "text": "Its callbacks run only on a macro-task turn, so a synchronous run never lets the old store go.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR90009",
    "text": "**Measurements**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0W00YCR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9000A",
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9000B",
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R002",
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R006",
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R009",
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00C"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9000A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9000A:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2P0004",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9000A:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2P0005",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Conditions** (by the Coder in the store-size investigation, 2026-10-10)",
    "text": "**Conditions** (by the Coder in the store-size investigation, 2026-10-10): scratch node processes and scratch services with their own run directory and port, on copies of the store under `/tmp`; single runs unless a count is given, at a machine load average of 2 to 3.5, the live service untouched.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9000B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR9000B",
    "text": "**Repeated `rehydrateStore` with the old store dropped by assignment, as `service.ts` line 379 does**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9000C",
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9000D",
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R000",
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R001"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9000C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9000C:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2P8000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9000C:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2P8001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X8XR9000C",
    "text": "With no event-loop turn between runs, external memory grew 81, 157, 232, 307, 382, 457 MB over six runs (one whole store, about 75 MB, per run), rss 275 to 812 MB, and run time rose 1.2, 8.0, 11.2, 20.0, 20.5, 23.2 s.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9000B",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9000D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR9000D",
    "text": "A forced `global.gc()` after each run freed none of it (identical external, heapUsed only 12 to 23 MB lower).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9000B",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R000",
    "text": "With a 200 ms event-loop turn around two `gc()` calls external was 81 MB and then flat at 104 MB, rss about 300 MB and a run about 1 s.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9000B",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R001",
    "text": "Calling `store.free()` on the old store changed nothing beyond that.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9000B",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R002",
    "text": "**The whole reload-style cycle (rehydrate, three sweeps, link sweep)**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R003",
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R004",
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R005"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R003:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2P8002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R003:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2P8003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R003",
    "text": "With no turns between runs it took 26.0, 64.5, 97.7 and 225.1 s with rss 566, 971, 1,372 and 1,731 MB and external 282, 560, 837 and 1,115 MB.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R004",
    "text": "Run 5 was killed with `kill -9` after 647 s, because a tight synchronous loop ignores `kill`, so it has no figures.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R005",
    "text": "With an event-loop turn and a `gc()` between runs it took 22.7, 14.5, 18.8, 4.0 and 4.0 s with external 282, 297, 312, 312 and 312 MB.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R006",
    "text": "**The dirty reload replicated in one process as one synchronous request after a settled boot (`m5.ts`)**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R007",
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R008"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R007:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2PG000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R007:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2PG001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R007",
    "text": "Shutdown sweeps 1,570 ms, content flush 8,323 ms, state flush 10,472 ms, `rehydrateStore` with the old store still referenced 29,630 ms, link sweep 38,506 ms.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R008",
    "text": "Total 88,504 ms, end rss 999 MB, external 576 MB.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R009",
    "text": "**The same phases with a 300 ms event-loop turn between them (`m5b.ts`)**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00A",
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00B"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00A:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2PG002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00A:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2PG003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R00A",
    "text": "1,471, 1,145, 1,484, 903 and 1,752 ms, total 8,080 ms including the four turns, end rss 808 MB, external 278 MB.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R00B",
    "text": "The same code costs 8 s as separate event-loop turns and 88 s as one synchronous request.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R00C",
    "text": "**The live service's high-water mark** is 1.66 GB (VmHWM, read from `/proc` by the Coder).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR90009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R00D",
    "text": "**Not proven**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0W00YCR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00E",
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00F"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00E:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2PR000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00E:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2PR001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "Not measured",
    "text": "Not measured: a reload on the live service (it would need the user's approval to stop it).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00D",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R00F",
    "text": "The same cycle after the scans are changed (not measured).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00D",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R00G",
    "text": "**Fix directions**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0W00YCR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00H",
      "BlockNode:00D0Y9NHJ0001"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00H:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2PR002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00H:props:StringProp:00D0X8Y2PR003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D0X8XR9R00H",
    "text": "No fix has been tried.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00G",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D0X8XR9R00J",
