    "title": "00D0XAM000001",
    "text": "**Verification — batch 3 read, the cluster restructuring complete, and answers to the Grapher's two questions** (2026-10-10, orchestrator): `aperas check-links` is clean over 5,232 live blocks. The reload, thread-flush, whole-artifact re-parse and `service restart` issues keep their ids and carry the shape; the thread-flush issue's confirmed fix (\"agreed 2026-10-02\", three parts) sits under **Fix directions** with its old wording and nothing added. All ten issues of the cluster are now subtrees: 45,897 bytes in ten blocks became 53,686 bytes in 436 blocks, none over 400 characters; the growth is repeated link text and status labels.",
