    "text": "**Replaces**: repeated reads of a node's fields through `wrap` and `readField`, each of which crosses into wasm. One plain JavaScript record per node (strings and numbers, no wasm handle), filled by a single subject-bound match with the quads freed at once and invalidated by the write helpers; a set of tombstoned ids is the smallest form.",
