    "text": "**Verification — the layers recorded in the full-store-scans issue, read, with answers to the Grapher's two questions** (2026-10-10, orchestrator): `aperas check-links` is clean. Under **Fix directions** of the scans issue, \"No fix has been tried.\" stays and four items follow (Layer 1, Layer 2, Layer 3, and the things beside the layers), each labelled \"not decided, not tried\", with the twelve-fold saving marked an estimate and `free()`, the bulk load and the type-quad equivalence marked untested or unchecked. Pointers to it were added to the removal-stall and memory issues (under Related) and to the reload issue (under Fix directions).",
