    "text": "**Finding — layer 1's premise was wrong: the store has no type quad, so `allIdsOfKind` cannot be bound on one; `removeDanglingUnfolds` can** (2026-10-11, orchestrator, from the Coder's Step 1, which stopped as asked; the orchestrator confirmed in `store.ts` line 86 that `encodeDoc` skips `@type`): the note of the layers said \"ask for a kind's type quads\" and listed as the thing to check first that \"every node has a type quad\"; the check failed at once. The type quad came from the Grapher's derived quad model, taken from the archived design's field table, which the code does not follow. The Coder's equivalence run on a fresh copy of the real store (47,836 quads):",
