    "title": "00D0YDSSCR002",
    "text": "`urn:aperas:pred:type` is `BlockNode.type` (paragraph, heading, listItem), not an RDF type. A match bound on a predicate that every instance of a kind carries gives identical id sets for `ArtifactNode` (54 on `path`), `FolderNode` (17 on `path`), `TreeView` (17 on `name`) and `Profile` (9 on `handle`).",
