    "title": "**Garbage collection never collects an unreachable block that was never tombstoned**",
    "text": "**Garbage collection never collects an unreachable block that was never tombstoned**: it has only a link, nothing refers to it, and neither sweep marks or prunes it. Filed 2026-10-11.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CF1WZ4JG002",
