      }
    ],
    "title": "00D1A2AY68003",
    "text": "`BlockNode:00CJ2TCV40000` has no `type`, no title, no parent, `children: []` and one `Link` (position 114) to `BlockNode:00CJ6TGSX8001`, which exists (read with `aperas show`, 2026-10-11).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Nothing refers to it",
    "text": "Nothing refers to it: `aperas backlinks` finds no link to it (read, 2026-10-11).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D1A2AY68005",
    "text": "It is still in the store after restarts (the user's question, 2026-10-11).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D1A2AY68006",
    "text": "**Root cause**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68007",
      "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68008",
      "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68009"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68007:props:StringProp:00D1A2BAE8004",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68007:props:StringProp:00D1A2BAE8005",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D1A2AY68007",
    "text": "`tombstoneVacuousContainers` marks only a `list`, or a `listItem` with no text, as vacuous, so a block with no `type` never qualifies (read, `node.ts` lines 2231 to 2252).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D1A2AY68008",
    "text": "`pruneUnreachableTombstones` skips any block that is not tombstoned, with the comment \"never tombstoned — not a GC candidate regardless of reachability\" (read, `node.ts` line 2208).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D1A2AY68009",
    "text": "So an unreachable block that was never tombstoned is collected by neither sweep, by design (read; not yet checked by the Coder).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY6800A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D1A2AY6800A",
    "text": "**Not proven**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY68001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D1A2AY6800B",
      "BlockNode:00D1A2AY6800C"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY6800B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D1A2AY6800B:props:StringProp:00D1A2BAEG000",
