  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1A2FPSG006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Candidate fixes, each tried on a patched copy**",
    "text": "**Candidate fixes, each tried on a patched copy**: (A) the renderer skips hrefs that already contain `#`: removes the source, leaves the five stored targets, newly pasted doubled links and the throw; (B1) the parser rejects a repeated `#id/`: silent (0 resolved, 0 dangling, no warning), text stays doubled with no Link; (B2) the parser keeps the first id: target correct, throw gone, stored text stays doubled and grows one id per copy-back; (B3) the direct-id path verifies the id exists: covers `[[…]]` and `aperas://id/` too, may break forward references; (C) the writer refuses a repeated `#id/`: the only loud option, previews still produce the text; (D) `check-links` flags a Link whose target does not exist: detection only. Combinations: A+C stops the source and makes any paste loud; A+B2 is the most forgiving and never flags; A+C+D also lists what is already stored.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1A2FPSG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
