    "text": "**A, C and D, as the orchestrator reads them**: A, the renderer `bakeResolvedLinkIds` skips an href that already carries a fragment; C, the writer refuses a repeated `#id/` in one href, and, by the user's rule on forward references, refuses a link in a direct-id spelling (`[[BlockNode:X]]`, `aperas://id/BlockNode:X`, `…#id/BlockNode:X`) whose id does not exist; D, `aperas check-links` flags a `Link` whose target names no node. The three-id write that threw an uncaught `URIError` becomes a clear error under C.",
