    "text": "**Start**: `aperas service start` reported \"did not become ready in time\" at 5.4 s and commands answered about 40 s later, as measured. On the new code (A, C, D, the object-bound `removeDanglingUnfolds`): `aperas check-links` scanned 5,674 live blocks (1,306 with internal link text) and reports a clean pass with no unresolved targets; `aperas show BlockNode:00CJ2TCV40000` says the node is not found; the stored text of `BlockNode:00D0VY04SG00F` now carries single anchors.",
