    "title": "00D1BAT6Q8003",
    "text": "The emergency is on when it does not finish within the minute. The trial is stopped, the change is verified by the required tests only (its own tests, `tsc`, targeted passes), and nobody runs verify, not even the trial, while the emergency is on.",
