    "text": "The user's design for the command: it accepts arguments for which test cases to run, a toggle for emergency mode, and an option to force the full suite despite emergency mode; in emergency mode it refuses to run the full suite; a built-in timer warns the user when a run passes one minute. Not built. [The settled design](../design/testing.md#id/BlockNode:00D1D5F63R001) keeps the case selection (`--suite`, `--group`, `--case`, `--list`) and the one-minute warning and drops the emergency toggle and the force option.",
