    "title": "[The doubled-anchor issue](#id/BlockNode:00D1A28XNG001)",
    "text": "[The doubled-anchor issue](#id/BlockNode:00D1A28XNG001): the sweep that found them also shifted two later link positions in a block it edited (139 to 112 and 235 to 181), after the repeated anchors were removed from the text.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1BAWJ5800D",
