      }
    ],
    "title": "**Resolved**",
    "text": "**Resolved**: fixed on 2026-10-11 by the changes C and D of [the doubled-anchor issue](../issues/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00D1A28XNG001); the code is carried by commit `0a7a226` on branch `oxigraph`, and the full `npm run verify` was not run.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVKFWNB8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
