    ],
    "title": "**Check `node --test`**",
    "text": "**Check `node --test`**: a Coder survey with small scratch experiments, no repository change: the Node version and how test files in TypeScript run under it (`tsx`), isolation per file, concurrency and its limit, name filters, per-test timing, timeouts, reporters, and how tier metadata can be read.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1CDABSR001",
