  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1CDABSR003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**The emergency's end**",
    "text": "**The emergency's end**: it lasts as long as the monolith does and is not given a separate command or its own life. The gate on the old suite may be as small as the runner refusing to run the legacy suite except on demand; the flag file `monorepo/verify-emergency.json` that the user approved earlier is therefore no longer a given and is the survey's to justify or drop. The graph's \"Verify emergency\" issue stays open as the flag until the monolith is gone, and is resolved then.",
