    "title": "**Issues**",
    "text": "**Issues**: [Verify emergency](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D1BAT6Q0001) — the issue this design answers, resolved by the suites it describes: the earlier full `npm run verify` took about 24 minutes. [The earlier slowdown entry](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CJ0202MG001) and [its resolved \"why\" entry](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CJ0HX2Y0000) record the same cost at about 5 minutes.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1D5F63R002",
