    "text": "The value of the per-file timeout.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1D5F64800P",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1D5F64800T",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "tombstonedAt": "2026-10-11T10:27:27.748Z",
    "title": "00D1D5F64800T",
    "text": "Whether an `all` suite exists, so that a test file on disk that no suite lists is found by comparison and reported as a warning.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1D5F64800P",
