    "title": "**When the emergency ends**",
    "text": "**When the emergency ends**: when the legacy suite is retired and the `commit` tier runs under a minute, by the rule above. The design's [Workflows](../design/testing.md#id/BlockNode:00D1D5F64800F) hold the same condition.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1D5PV78001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1D5PV78003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**The flag is this issue**",
    "text": "**The flag is this issue**: no flag file exists or will exist (`monorepo/verify-emergency.json` was never created and nothing reads it). The issue stays open until the condition above holds.",
