    "title": "## v4.4 additions — delta on the v4 snapshot",
    "text": "Records the v4.4 edits to the four skills: the verification text that follows the new test structure, requested in [the user's request for the threshold rule](#id/BlockNode:00D1B662PR001), settled in [the settled design](#id/BlockNode:00D1D2MKVR001) and checked in [the skill verification and what drift shows](#id/BlockNode:00D1D8WCV0001). A code task runs the `commit` suite through `npm run verify`, the tests of a change through `--group` and `--suite essential`, and never the legacy suite unless the user asks; the base skill states it in Step 7 and in Verification Scope, the Orchestrator and Coder skills restate it, the Coder skill adds the rule for new tests, and the four `Status:` lines move to v4.4 with one `Status` entry per skill. Each entry that rewrites recorded text carries a `Supersedes:` line naming the block it replaces; the two Coder bullets that state new rules replace nothing.",
