    "title": "00D1DA0Q1800F",
    "text": "After an edit, run the tests of what you changed with `npm run verify -- --group <area>` and `npm run verify -- --suite essential` (seconds).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1DA0Q1800E",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1DA0Q1800G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D1DA0Q1800G",
    "text": "Before handing a code change back, and at Step 7, run `npm run verify`, which runs the `commit` suite and is expected to finish in under a minute; the reporter prints a warning once the run is past a minute.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1DA0Q1800E",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1DA0Q1800H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D1DA0Q1800H",
    "text": "If the `commit` suite passes a minute, stop and report to the user: the suite has outgrown its budget and needs a split. Do not keep waiting.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1DA0Q1800E",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1DA0Q1800J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Never run `npm run verify:legacy` or `verify:legacy:slow` unless the user asks for it",
    "text": "Never run `npm run verify:legacy` or `verify:legacy:slow` unless the user asks for it: it runs the old one-function suite against a real-size store in one process and takes about 24 minutes.",
