    "title": "**For Code/Engine changes**",
    "text": "**For Code/Engine changes**: Execute `npm run verify` from `monorepo/`, which runs the `commit` suite and is expected to finish in under a minute; the reporter prints a warning once the run is past a minute.\n  If the `commit` suite passes a minute, stop and report to the user: the suite has outgrown its budget and needs a split. Do not keep waiting.\n  Never run `npm run verify:legacy` or `verify:legacy:slow` unless the user asks for it: it takes about 24 minutes.",
