    "title": "**Verify before handing back, never the legacy suite**",
    "text": "**Verify before handing back, never the legacy suite**: Run `npm run verify` (from `monorepo/`) before handing a code change back; it runs the `commit` suite and is expected to finish in under a minute, and the reporter prints a warning once the run is past a minute. If the `commit` suite passes a minute, stop and report to the user with a `**Question — <topic>**`: the suite has outgrown its budget and needs a split. Never run `npm run verify:legacy` or `verify:legacy:slow` unless the user asks for it; it takes about 24 minutes.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1DA0Q1800R",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1DA0Q1800T",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**New tests**",
    "text": "**New tests**: A new test is a standalone `<name>.test.ts` file in a group directory under `monorepo/packages/cli/src/tests/`, named in a suite under `suites/`, never added to the legacy files.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1DA0Q1800R",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
