    "title": "**The skills' v4.4 text is done**",
    "text": "**The skills' v4.4 text is done**: the four skills now say to run `npm run verify` (the `commit` suite) before handing a change back and at Step 7, `--group <area>` and `--suite essential` after an edit, and never the legacy suite unless the user asks, as [the v4.4 milestone](../history/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D1DCS9YG001) records. The issue stays open.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1BAT6Q8005",
