  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1DDSWYG001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D1DDSWYG001",
    "text": "**Verification — the v4.4 delta and wrap-up read and run by the orchestrator; answers to the Graphers' questions** (2026-10-11, orchestrator): `python3 skills/aperas/scripts/skill_drift.py` exits 0 bare, with `--added` and with `--dropped` (run as three separate commands by the orchestrator, exit codes read): STATUS vs the newest recorded v4.4 0, ADDED 0, DROPPED 0, 201 superseded and accounted for; `aperas check-links` is clean. The delta `## v4.4 additions` (`BlockNode:00D1DA0Q18001`) has nine entries (four `Status`, the base Step 7, the base Verification Scope bullet, the orchestrator's section 7 bullet, the Coder's step 2 line, the Coder's two new Operational Invariants); the History has a v4.4 milestone and \"revised through v4.4\"; the \"Verify emergency\" issue has the lines for phase 1 and for the skills; the Step 7 unit was matched to `00CVJXQWNG005` (the drift checker compares only the first 120 characters, which is why it never showed as dropped). The service was busy, not down, during the first Grapher's turn, and nothing was restarted.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0V83SF8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D1DDSWYG002",
      "BlockNode:00D1DDSWYR000",
      "BlockNode:00D1DDSWYR001"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1DDSWYG002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
