    "title": "**Measured**",
    "text": "**Measured**: ten full-store scans in one tick, baseline external memory 90.7 MB. Left to the finalizer: 223 ms a scan and 253.9 MB external. `q.free()` on each quad: 162 ms a scan and 115.8 MB external. `q.free()` plus the subject term freed: 109 ms a scan and 101.3 MB external, with no growth after the first scan. Resident set size across the three variants: 499, 351 and 289 MB. What had no effect was a forced `gc()` without a turn, not `free()`.",
