    "text": "**Q1 — decision: run the rehydrate of the round trip in a child process** (orchestrator): the file tests fidelity and the in-process 34 s is the defect, not part of the fidelity; the quad-set comparison stays. The reload cost is recorded in its own issue and is not made into a test with a time in it.",
