    "title": "**Q3 — decision: `store/fixture.test.ts` joins `essential`** (orchestrator)",
    "text": "**Q3 — decision: `store/fixture.test.ts` joins `essential`** (orchestrator): 13 ms, and it proves the fixture refuses the real roots.",
