    "title": "**Q4 — the stale skills and design**",
    "text": "**Q4 — the stale skills and design**: a v4.5 edit of the skills (the legacy mentions come out; the `demand` tier is described as the corpus checks on a copy) and the Grapher's update of `design/testing.md` and the resolution of the \"Verify emergency\" issue follow the Coder's small changes above.",
