  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1E7VPB0001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D1E7VPB0001",
    "text": "**Verification — the four adjustments read and run by the orchestrator; the round trip points at the root cause again; decisions** (2026-10-11, orchestrator; `demand` not run): run by the orchestrator, `tsc --noEmit` clean on cli; `npm run verify -- --suite essential` passes 27 cases in 3.0 s and `npm run verify` passes 48 cases in 17.0 s wall (the Coder 14.4 s; the earlier 8.3 s was before the runner's new budget tests, and the machine was busier), with no warning line; the Coder reports `defineSuite(url, members, budgetSeconds?)` with `essential` 5 s, `commit` 60 s and `demand` none, `NT_BUDGET_S` replacing `NT_WARN_MS`, `fixture.test.ts` in `essential`, the per-file timeout 900 s for a suite with no budget and 120 s for one with a budget, and a runner test for the budget behaviour.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0V83SF8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
