    "title": "## v4.5 additions — delta on the v4 snapshot",
    "text": "Records the v4.5 edits to the four skills: the verification text that follows the built suites, requested in [the verification and the end of the emergency](#id/BlockNode:00D1EC4X6R001), with the built facts and measured times in [the batch 3 verification](#id/BlockNode:00D1E46B40000), [the adjustments](#id/BlockNode:00D1E7VPB0001) and [the round trip split](#id/BlockNode:00D1EAZSRG001). A code task runs the `commit` suite through `npm run verify` (a budget of 60 seconds), the tests of a change through `--group` and `--suite essential` (a budget of 5 seconds), and the `demand` suite only when the user asks; the legacy suite is gone from the text. The base skill states it in Verification Scope, the Orchestrator and Coder skills restate it, and the four `Status:` lines move to v4.5 with one `Status` entry per skill. Each entry that rewrites text recorded in [the v4.4 delta](#id/BlockNode:00D1DA0Q18001) carries a `Supersedes:` line naming the blocks it replaces.",
