    "title": "**For Code/Engine changes**",
    "text": "**For Code/Engine changes**: Execute `npm run verify` from `monorepo/`, which runs the `commit` suite (a budget of 60 seconds); the reporter prints a warning once a run is past its suite's budget.\n    If the `commit` suite passes its budget, stop and report to the user: the suite has outgrown its budget and needs a split. Do not keep waiting.\n    `npm run verify -- --suite demand` runs the corpus checks on a copy of the real mirror and takes more than a minute, with no budget and no warning; run it only when the user asks for it.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1EDH18R007",
