    "title": "**Verify before handing back**",
    "text": "**Verify before handing back**: Run `npm run verify` (from `monorepo/`) before handing a code change back; it runs the `commit` suite (a budget of 60 seconds), and the reporter prints a warning once a run is past its suite's budget. If the `commit` suite passes its budget, stop and report to the user with a `**Question — <topic>**`: the suite has outgrown its budget and needs a split. `npm run verify -- --suite demand` runs the corpus checks on a copy of the real mirror and takes more than a minute, with no budget and no warning; run it only when the user asks for it.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D1EDH18R00B",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1EDH18R00D",
