    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D1ERQFRR001",
    "text": "**Decision — finish the remaining v4.5 work so that the user can commit** (2026-10-11, user, after the orchestrator reported the `demand` run (\"A ~75s run is nice, esp. from 24 minute! I just ran it myself: SUMMARY suite=demand ran=56 passed=56 failed=0 cancelled=0 skipped=0; 74015 ms. Let's do the remaining work so that i can commit this v4.5.\"): the orchestrator measured `demand` at 73,016 ms (56 cases, 19 files, exit 0) and the user at 74,015 ms, two runs on two occasions, both on a machine in normal use.",
