    "title": "00D1ET3G88002",
    "text": "**Decision — reword `essential`'s first comment sentence** (orchestrator, answering the Coder's question): its first sentence is 169 characters, so its `--help` line is cut mid-clause at \"...the cheapest and...\"; the earlier instruction not to change the suite comments was given to avoid a hidden edit, and a short first sentence is the right fix after all: \"The few-seconds suite to run after every change.\" followed by the existing detail as further comment lines, with `commit` and `demand` read for the same fault. A tiny Coder turn.",
