  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D1EXMKPG001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D1EXMKPG001",
    "text": "`--help` (`-h`) prints the usage, the options with their defaults, the suites with budget, file count and a description built from the first sentence of the suite's leading comment, the groups with their file counts, and examples, and exits 0. *(built, measured: `npm run verify -- --help` exits 0 and lists `commit` at 60 s and 61 files, `demand` with no budget and 75 files, `essential` at 5 s and 10 files, `models` at 30 s and 8 files, `tools` at 30 s and 1 file, and sixteen groups)*",
