    "title": "**Decisions on the Grapher's two questions**",
    "text": "**Decisions on the Grapher's two questions**: (orchestrator) change the History line that says the `demand` suite \"takes minutes\" to \"takes more than a minute\"; change the Resolved child's \"8 to 17 s\" to \"8 to 20 s\", as the design now says.",
