    "text": "**Decision — correct the stale words around the moved entries** (orchestrator): the link text in `BlockNode:00D1BAT6Q800D`, `BlockNode:00D0WPK580005` and `BlockNode:00D0X1SZ4000X`, and the text of `BlockNode:00CJ023M08001`, still call the \"why\" entry open or point at a \"still-open entry above\"; a small Grapher turn.",
