    "title": "00D1GCR1XR001",
    "text": "**Map of the store reads for the change** (the Coder's survey of 2026-10-11; read, not edited; line numbers are in `monorepo/packages`; \"bound\" means the subject, predicate or object is given; \"args\" are the `nodeIri`/`predIri`/`encodeLiteral` objects made fresh by every call and never freed)",
