    "title": "00D21DGK7R001",
    "text": "**The user: write `history/core.md`, update the stale statements, update `Apeiron/README.md`** (2026-10-12, user): \"Yes, write `history/core.md` and update the staled ones, and update the README.md.\" That answers the Grapher's two questions ([the Grapher's report and the performance check](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D21A7P0R001)): the Grapher creates `history/core.md` with milestones for `0a7a226` and `d794060` and corrects the four statements that predate the landing (`00D0X1SZ3R00E`, `00D1EZSCH8001`, `00D0Y9HG3000B`, `00D1GCR1Y0003`); the Coder rewrites `Apeiron/README.md`, a plain file outside the graph, from what the code and the files actually are. Orchestrator's addition, open to the user's correction: a third History milestone for the branch split, which the user decided (Oxigraph patching paused at branch `oxigraph`, the JS ApeironNgn started on `js-apeironngn`). The two turns run in parallel, since they touch different things; no service restart is involved.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0V83SF8001",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
