  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D21FP4Z0002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "## Current Status",
    "text": "As of 2026-10-12 two commits of store performance work have landed on branch `oxigraph`, and both branches (`oxigraph` and `js-apeironngn`) point at the second one, `d794060`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D21FP4Z0001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D21FP4Z8000",
