    "title": "**The doubled anchor**",
    "text": "**The doubled anchor**: the same commit carries the repair of the doubled `#id/` anchor that the preview of `aperas tree --view` wrote into new text when a reader copied a link from it. The preview renderer skips an href that already contains `#id/`; the writer refuses a repeated `#id/` and a direct-id link whose id names no node, before its first mutation; `aperas check-links` lists a `Link` whose target names no node; an offline sweep of the mirror repaired the five stored targets. It rests on [the doubled-anchor issue](../issues/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00D1A28XNG001) and [its preview-renderer entry](../issues/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00D1BB9VE8001). On the new code `aperas check-links` was clean over 5,674 live blocks at the repair and over 6,687 live blocks in the restarted service.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D21FP4Z8006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
