    "title": "2026-10-12, commit `d794060`, \"Fix core performance 2\"",
    "text": "2026-10-12, commit `d794060`, \"Fix core performance 2\": `free()` on the Oxigraph objects, at the root. [The `free()` item of the scans issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D1DP5GG0001) holds the survey map the change followed and [its Landed entry](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D216W8Z0001) the details below.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D21FP4Z8005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
