          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D22Z1HJR00B:links:Link:00D22Z1XW0001",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00D0W05P08001",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D22Z1HJR00B:links:Link:00D22Z1XW0001:props:StringProp:00D22Z1XW0002",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "105"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D22Z1HJR00B:props:StringProp:00D22Z1XV8000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D22Z1HJR00B:props:StringProp:00D22Z1XV8001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D22Z1HJR00B",
    "text": "[The full-store-scans issue](#id/BlockNode:00D0W02KPG001), whose `free()` landing this profile measures; [the start issue](#id/BlockNode:00D0W05P08001), whose startup link sweep costs 3.0 s wall and 4.4 s CPU once per start (3,057, 3,102 and 2,924 ms in three starts).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D22Z1HJR00A",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D22Z1HJR00C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D22Z1HJR00C",
    "text": "The Coder's question whether the per-field probes should be cheap (a table per predicate) or whether \"all fields of one subject\" is the unit to optimise, which the census counts support (7,274 of 7,276 `holder` probes and 5,769 of 7,276 `links` probes at a flush found nothing), belongs to the design of the store and is not decided here.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D22Z1HJR00A",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D22Z4RF0001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
