    "title": "**Since measured (2026-10-12)**",
    "text": "**Since measured (2026-10-12)**: the two sweeps cost 831 ms before and 780 ms after one insert into the 5,200-line `discussion/aperas-skill.md` (a copy of the mirror; medians of 6 inserts in 3 fresh processes), and 24 and 18 ms for a 37-line artifact. The remark parse of every block's text (`collectLinkCodesFromText`) is 1,070 ms of the 1,574 ms the profile attributes to them. The measurement and the other cost centres of one write (a path index over all live blocks, the timed dehydrate) are in [the cost-of-a-write issue](#id/BlockNode:00D22Z1HJ8001).",
