    "text": "**The tree view lists a block's links newest first, not in the order of their `position` in the text, so the displayed order is the store's match order**: found 2026-10-12 by the orchestrator while checking which reads depend on the engine's order; confirmed by the user's reading of the output. Filed 2026-10-12.",
