    "title": "00D22ZK7C8003",
    "text": "Tested on `BlockNode:00CDBZ7698002`, whose text names its three link targets in the order `00CDBYV4T8002`, `00CDBYV4T8007`, `00CDBYV5A8002`. `aperas unfold` lists the three `Link` nodes in the reverse order of the text (the newest link first); the stored mirror (`BlockNode.jsonld`) lists them oldest first.",
