  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8006:props:StringProp:00D22ZKJX0000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8006:props:StringProp:00D22ZKJX0001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "Read from the code",
    "text": "Read from the code: `links` is read with `readField`, which returns the quads in the store's match order, and the tree and unfold rendering print them in that order (`node.ts` near lines 1745 and 1882, `kgUnfold.ts` near lines 109 to 115). Every wikilink carries a `position` prop, the offset of its occurrence in the text, which would give the text order; the renderer does not read it.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D22ZK7C8007",
    "text": "The same match order is what other readers get, and where it shows (the Coder's census, item 7): the rendering of `links` (above), `toReconcileShape` (`node.ts:527`), `kgLink.ts:54` (which writes the list back in the order it read it), the order of `view.unfolds` in `buildRenderTree` and in `kgProfile.ts:115`, the printed `backlinks` (`kgBacklinks.ts:32`, `kgProfile.ts:69`), and the comparison of a `Link`'s `position` props with the freshly computed list (`positionsEqual`), where a different order only causes a rewrite of the props and never a wrong value. The census counted four `Link`s in the mirror with two positions.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D22ZK7C8008",
    "text": "The order of the printed `backlinks` carries no meaning (nothing reads it); only the display of a block's own links has an order the text defines.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D22ZK7C8009",
    "text": "**Not proven**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D22ZK7C800A",
      "BlockNode:00D22ZK7C800B",
      "BlockNode:00D3F741JR001"
    ]
  },
