  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D22ZMTKG001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**`findByExactPath` takes the first node found at a path, and a path can be held by a tombstoned and a live node, so it returns the live one only because the store lists the newest first**",
    "text": "**`findByExactPath` takes the first node found at a path, and a path can be held by a tombstoned and a live node, so it returns the live one only because the store lists the newest first**: a latent defect, found 2026-10-12 by the orchestrator in the check of order-sensitive reads (the Coder's census, item 7) and called a bug by the user if it would return the removed one. Filed 2026-10-12.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CF1WZ4JG00J",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D22ZMTKG002",
      "BlockNode:00D22ZMTKR001",
      "BlockNode:00D22ZMTKR004",
      "BlockNode:00D22ZMTKR006",
