    "text": "[The title-ambiguity issue](#id/BlockNode:00CVQ0PVS0001), where `aperas resolve` does not filter tombstoned candidates and a dead holder makes a live path read as ambiguous: the same shape, in the title check of the resolver instead of the path lookup.",
