    "title": "**`apeironNgnSmokeTest.ts` is referenced by no script, suite or import, and asks for a predicate that no longer exists**",
    "text": "**`apeironNgnSmokeTest.ts` is referenced by no script, suite or import, and asks for a predicate that no longer exists**: found 2026-10-12 by the Coder in the census of the store's predicates and access patterns (item 2). Filed 2026-10-12.",
