    "title": "00D23056Q8001",
    "text": "Promoted to [One `insert` blocks the service for 1.6 to 3.2 s before its reply and for 1.4 s more after it](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22Z1HJ8001) — filed as one open issue with the three cost centres, the `free()` finding and the proposals as candidates; its refusal mechanism is recorded as [Since measured](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22Z4RF0001) under the spurious \"not running\" issue, its sweep figures under [the per-write re-parse issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZD780001), and its thread-write sample under [the thread-write issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZC858001).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0V83SF8001",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2307NFG001",
