          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D2307NFG001",
    "text": "Promoted to [The tree view lists a block's links newest first](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8001) (item 1) and [`findByExactPath` takes the first node found at a path](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZMTKG001) (item 3); item 2, the order of the printed backlinks, carries no meaning and is recorded in the first of them.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0V83SF8001",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2308XA0001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
