    "title": "00D2308XA0001",
    "text": "Promoted to [`apeironNgnSmokeTest.ts` is referenced by no script, suite or import](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZV0FG001) and [`encodeDoc` and `mintEmbedded` write any key as a predicate](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZWZMR001); the rest of the list is filed as [the cost of one insert](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22Z1HJ8001), [the thread-write gap](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZC858001), [the reversed link display](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8001) and [the order-dependent path lookup](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZMTKG001), and the stale statement is corrected in [its entry of the linking issues](../issues/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00D1BB69AG007).",
