    "title": "00D24HM480001",
    "text": "**The user decides: lazy reverse; write the draft `design/core.md` from the archive and the decisions; old content to history, standing content to design; continue in the artifact** (2026-10-12, user): \"Let's use lazy reverse and write down the draft design, including contents from the archive. The old ones should go to history and the still standing ones to the design. We will continue the design.... much more to be discussed, but the thread is lengthy now and I cannot follow it. We'd better work with the design artifact.\" Orchestrator's reading: (1) decided: a reverse view is built the first time a field is asked in reverse, then kept up to date; (2) the Grapher writes a draft `design/core.md` collecting the standing content of the archived ApeironNgn design (`artifacts/archive/Aperas-apeironngn-design.md`, not ingested, not edited) and the decisions of this session, and records the superseded content (the Terminus-era parts and the reasons for the moves) as milestones in `history/core.md`; (3) from now on the design is discussed on the artifact: the orchestrator relays the user's comments on `design/core.md` as Asks, and answers in chat stay short and point to the nodes; (4) the draft carries rules, not measured figures, no narration of this session, and an Open points section for what is not decided; (5) the Coder fact-checks the draft against the code in a later turn. Decisions to carry, each from its Freeflow entry: the pairs model and its definition ([the pairs check](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D20XX3SG001), [the confirmation](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D21QR118001), [the set fields](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D21TBXT0001)); unordered sets, natural order, reversal in general ([unordered](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D2248STR001), [natural order](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D22KKP7G001)); the order rules A to E ([decisions](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D235EAQR001)); path and tombstones ([tombstone](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D2392JYG001), [stored path](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D23A9S48001), [uses](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D23CR0MG001)); the index ([proposal](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D23JGNSR001), [numbers as rules](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D23T2E50001), [kind sets](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D241MMC0001), [files and kinds](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D244CZXG001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0V83SF8001",
