    "title": "**Issues**",
    "text": "**Issues**: [`design/` has no document for the store, hydration or the service lifecycle](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D0W07DRR000) — the gap this document fills for the store and its mirror; the service lifecycle stays outside it. The rules below that answer an issue: [`findByExactPath` takes the first node found at a path](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZMTKG001) (Lookups by a literal value), [the tree view lists a block's links newest first](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8001) (Ordering), [`encodeDoc` and `mintEmbedded` write any key as a predicate](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZWZMR001) (The data model, Open points), [full-store scans](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D0W02KPG001) (The data model, The index), [two documents under one `@id`](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CHXSZ56R001) (The load and the flush).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
