    "title": "**A reflection of the mirror**",
    "text": "**A reflection of the mirror**: the JSON-LD files under `Apeiron/`, tracked in git, are the source of truth. The engine holds nothing that a fresh load of the mirror would not rebuild. It has no persistence of its own: the shell's persistence builds it from the mirror when the service starts or reloads, and reads it out to the mirror when it flushes, through the engine's [persistence API](#id/BlockNode:00D4MZ7DZG001) (see [The shell, on disk](#id/BlockNode:00D3CHMYQG001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
