    "title": "**Search is not here**",
    "text": "**Search is not here**: free-text and pattern search have no index-servable shortcut in any engine and need a secondary index of their own, which this document does not describe (see [Open points](#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000J)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR006",
