    "title": "**Outside this document**",
    "text": "**Outside this document**: the service lifecycle (start, stop, the timing and the guard of a flush, ownership of the process, recovery, the waits of the client), the mapping of markdown into blocks and back, the addressing grammar ([linking](../design/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CDBYV4T0001)) and the views ([treeview](../design/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW4Y8001)). Each consumes the engine and none changes its rules; the mapping of markdown, the addressing and the views are parts of the shell ([the shell](#id/BlockNode:00D4M7YEZG001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
