    "title": "`TreeNode`, extending `BaseNode`",
    "text": "`TreeNode`, extending `BaseNode`: `title` (one), `text` (optional), `children` (ordered and partitioning reference, to blocks, folders and artifacts mixed: see [Containment](#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR00Z)) and `parent` (optional reference, the reverse of `children`, kept consistent by the engine and never stored as a pair: it is a derived entry of the field order, read from the reverse side of `children`; see [Containment](#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR00Z) and [Persistence](#id/BlockNode:00D4MZ7DZG001)).",
