    "title": "`FolderNode`, extending `TreeNode`",
    "text": "`FolderNode`, extending `TreeNode`: `path` (one) and `projectedHash` (optional: set when the folder is projected, and absent before). In a document of a folder `path` stands before `children`, as in the real mirror (see [Format](#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01Z)). Its `path` is transitional, as an `ArtifactNode`'s is. Its `title` is the name of its directory (the folder of `design/core.md` is titled `design`), the identity that the path is built from (see [The title of an artifact or a folder is its name](#id/BlockNode:00D4RSAZ3G001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR00M",
    "type": "listItem",
