      }
    ],
    "title": "**Forward, the record of each subject**",
    "text": "**Forward, the record of each subject**: the forward side of a node's fields is its record (see [Records follow containment](#id/BlockNode:00D2T5P9Y8001)). The values of field F of subject S are read from the record, and the whole record of S (what a flush or a wrapper needs) is read whole, with no lookup for each field.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR015",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR017",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR017:links:Link:00D3EM33F0000",
