    ],
    "title": "**Sets are unordered**",
    "text": "**Sets are unordered**: the values of a set field and the subjects of a reverse lookup come back in no promised order. The order in which the engine happens to return them is incidental, may differ between implementations, and nothing may rely on it; a reader that needs an order sorts for itself.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR01C",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR01E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR01E:links:Link:00D4N04XWR000",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR01D",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR01E:links:Link:00D4N04XWR000:props:StringProp:00D4N04XX0000",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "161"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Where an order shows**",
    "text": "**Where an order shows**: the items of an ordered field come in the order of its list, as the children of a node do. Every other order is the reader's sort (see [Sets are unordered](#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01D)): in the Aperas schema, the `links` of a block are ordered by `position`, and anything else (props, unfolded ids, backlinks, the views of a profile, any other set) by id. Wherever equal keys occur (props with the same key) the tie is broken by id. The listing of the unfolded ids of a view is ordered by id.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR01C",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR01F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Ids give a stable order**",
    "text": "**Ids give a stable order**: ids compare as strings by plain code point, a total order that depends on no engine and no locale. In practice ids are issued in increasing order in time, but nothing relies on that.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR01C",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR01G",
