    "title": "**A lookup does not depend on first match**",
    "text": "**A lookup does not depend on first match**: a lookup that names one node returns the live node (see [Lookups by a literal value](#id/BlockNode:00D3CHMYQG004)); for a path it is the one primitive that [How a path names one node](#id/BlockNode:00D25686RR001) states. The first or only value of a single-valued field is order-free as long as the cardinality is respected.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR01C",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR01J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "tombstonedAt": "2026-10-14T15:10:20.695Z",
    "title": "**Engines are compared as sets**",
    "text": "**Engines are compared as sets**: two implementations are compared by collections as sets, never list by list.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR01C",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
