    "title": "**An `@id` names one document**",
    "text": "**An `@id` names one document**: no two documents may share one, and the load rejects a repeat (see [A repeated `@id` at load](#id/BlockNode:00D2PC3ZG8001); [the issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CHXSZ56R001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3CHMYQG002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR01Q",
