    "title": "**Ids are stable**",
    "text": "**Ids are stable**: the shell mints the ids (see [Ids](#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01N)), and an operation that leaves content unchanged leaves them unchanged. Blocks keep their ids through reconciliation; a prop keeps its id only if its key and its value both stay; a wikilink `Link` keeps its id while its target stays in the block's text, and a change of positions rewrites its props and not the link.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3CHMYQG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
