    "title": "**Handles and names**",
    "text": "**Handles and names**: a profile's `handle` is unique and a view's `name` is unique among views. The `name` field is shared by profiles and views, so a lookup by name filters the kind. A lookup by `handle` or by `name` is served by a map that the shell adds and keeps, not by the engine (see [Literal fields are properties of the record](#id/BlockNode:00D39DRYB0001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3CHMYQG004",
