    "title": "**Files**",
    "text": "**Files**: the shell keeps a mirror for each graph, one JSON array for each kind, in the directory that the graph's entry in the table of settings names (see [Written by graph and kind](#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01Y)). The graph `tree` holds the tracked kinds, and its `ArtifactNode.jsonld`, `FolderNode.jsonld`, `BlockNode.jsonld` and `Profile.jsonld` are tracked in git under `Apeiron/`. Under `Apeiron/.state/`, which git ignores, are the mirror of the graph `threads.tree` (the `ArtifactNode.jsonld`, `FolderNode.jsonld` and `BlockNode.jsonld` of the thread-scoped nodes), the mirror of the graph `treeviews` (`TreeView.jsonld`) and the captured port views (see [Captured port views](#id/BlockNode:00D2T5Z6J0001)). `Link` and `StringProp` have no file: they are embedded in the document of their owner.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR01W",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
