    "title": "### The engine's interface",
    "text": "The shell constructs the engine with its schema (see [The meta-model](#id/BlockNode:00D4MYZ6Q0000)) and then asks for the following and nothing else. Every read and write names the graph it acts on (see [Several graphs](#id/BlockNode:00D3CHJXK8002)), and every value the shell receives is a plain string, number, boolean or row, never a term.",
