    "title": "**Not offered**",
    "text": "**Not offered**: the engine has no pattern match over an unbound field beyond all the pairs of one subject (read together, or removed with the node) and the two traversals listed under Reads, no match on the object alone, no graph position and no query language. It has no load or dump of its own: the shell loads the mirror and builds the engine's graphs through the [persistence API](#id/BlockNode:00D4MZ7DZG001), and at a flush reads the records out and dumps them (see [The shell, on disk](#id/BlockNode:00D3CHMYQG001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D24N87T0003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
