    "title": "**The order of links without a position**",
    "text": "**The order of links without a position**: the `links` of a block are listed by `position`, then by id, and a link that carries no `position` sorts after those that do (several without one by id), so the two kinds mix in a total order (see [Where an order shows](#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01E)). A link with several positions (a link of two occurrences of its target) is ordered by its smallest, as a number. Whether a link can carry no `position` at all waits for the linking design that is to give the types of links (see [Links are outgoing ports](#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR011)); every wikilink has one today.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR01C",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D24N87T000Q",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D24N87T000Q:links:Link:00D76ARX70000",
