    "title": "**The service lifecycle**",
    "text": "**The service lifecycle**: outside this document. What the design of the repository states of the service is kept in [Packaging — Design](../design/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDY7PGG0001), where the rule for a load that rejects a document is stated: the service refuses to start, a reload refuses to replace the graph, and an explicit start-anyway option lets the user work on the unaffected parts, with a side copy of the raw rejected documents before the first flush overwrites their file ([the rule](../design/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00D76B1ZTR001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D24N87T000J",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D24N87T000X",
