    "title": "**No set of live ids**",
    "text": "**No set of live ids**: the engine keeps no set of live ids beside the collection of each kind (see [Records by kind and by graph](#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR018)), because none of its operations needs one: the sweep walks reachability from the roots, the dump needs every id, and the lookups of live nodes are the shell's maps. The shell's `liveIdsOfKind` filters the tombstoned ids out of the collection of the kind, for the callers of \"all ids of kind K\" that need live nodes only.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D24N87SR00D",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
