    "title": "00D24PZXD8001",
    "text": "The design of the engine is drafted in [Core — Design](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR001), with the user from 2026-10-12 to 2026-10-15, and fact-checked against the code and the mirror on 2026-10-12; the work that remains is listed under its [Open points](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000J), and the service lifecycle stays outside it.",
