    "title": "00D252W7VG003",
    "text": "Counted 2026-10-15 on a clone of the mirror (the tracked files of `Apeiron/` and `Apeiron/.state/`, read with `jq`): of 219 tombstoned nodes (188 in `Apeiron/`, of which one is an `ArtifactNode`, the holder `cli.md`, and 31 in `Apeiron/.state/`), 52 still hold `children`, `links` or `props`; the rule in [Tombstones](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01V) says a removed node is emptied of all three. In `Apeiron/` none holds `children` or `links` (the `children` key is present and empty on all 188) and 40 hold `props`; in `Apeiron/.state/` 12 hold something: `children` on 4, `links` on 7, `props` on 5. The count is of one moment; the mirror gains tombstones with each removal.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D252W7VG002",
