    "title": "Tested by the Coder on a scratch store (`/tmp/cont.mts`)",
    "text": "Tested by the Coder on a scratch store (`/tmp/cont.mts`): children at indexes 0, 1, 2 under one parent; the one at 1 moved to another parent with `insertChild` or `appendChild` (what `aperas insert` with no stdin does); the old parent's others stay at 0 and 2; then `appendChild` on the old parent gave the new child index 2, the same as the last one.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D252Y7WR002",
