      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR002:props:StringProp:00D25397J0001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D2538VKR002",
    "text": "**Symptom**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D2538VKR003",
      "BlockNode:00D2538VKR004"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR003:props:StringProp:00D25397J0002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR003:props:StringProp:00D25397J0003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "None in the data",
    "text": "None in the data: the real mirror has 0 mismatches in either direction between a child's `parent` and the container that lists it, and the live blocks without a `parent` are listed by no container, as expected (42 or 43 of them; the Coder gave both figures).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D2538VKR004",
    "text": "A file with a `parent` that no container lists would load as a child sorted at index 0 (read from the code, not run).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D2538VKR005",
    "text": "**Root cause** (read from the code)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D2538VKR006",
      "BlockNode:00D2538VKR007"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR006:props:StringProp:00D25397J8000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR006:props:StringProp:00D25397J8001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D2538VKR006",
    "text": "`encodeDoc` (`store.ts`) reads `parent` as its own predicate in its generic branch, and writes the containment again through `children`; `serializeDoc` (`dehydrate.ts` lines 70 to 82) writes `parent` from the store's own `parent` quad, not from a container's list.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D2538VKR007",
    "text": "The README of the mirror and the design draft both say `parent` is derived from the container's `children`; that is true as an invariant of the data and false as a description of the code.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D2538VKR008",
    "text": "**Not proven**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D2538VKR009"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR009:props:StringProp:00D25397J8002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR009:props:StringProp:00D25397J8003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D2538VKR009",
    "text": "What a load does with a `parent` that names a container which does not list the child, or a child listed by a container that is not its `parent`; neither was run.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR008",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR00A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D2538VKR00A",
    "text": "**Fix directions**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D2538VKR00B"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR00B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR00B:props:StringProp:00D25397J8004",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR00B:props:StringProp:00D25397J8005",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D2538VKR00B",
    "text": "None decided. Whether `parent` is the lister's fact or a pair of its own is an Open point of the design.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2538VKR00A",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
