    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D253D680001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Ingested artifacts without a `type`: 9 of 57 `ArtifactNode` documents carry none, 7 of them with an `ingestedHash` and a `lastIngestedAt`**",
    "text": "**Ingested artifacts without a `type`: 9 of 57 `ArtifactNode` documents carry none, 7 of them with an `ingestedHash` and a `lastIngestedAt`**:  found 2026-10-12 by the Coder in the fact-check of the draft `design/core.md`. Filed 2026-10-12.",
