    "title": "Counted by the Coder on the real mirror",
    "text": "Counted by the Coder on the real mirror: 48 of 57 artifacts have `type` (`root`), 9 do not. Seven of the 9 have an `ingestedHash` and a `lastIngestedAt`: `history/packaging.md`, `discussion/webapp.md`, `design/webapp.md`, `planning/webapp.md`, `history/webapp.md`, `.threads/grapher.md` and `.threads/coder.md`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D253D680002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D253D680004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D253D680004",
    "text": "The other two of the 9 are the tombstoned `issues/cli.md` and the live `concepts.md` (which has no `ingestedHash` either). The orchestrator's count of 6 and the Coder's of 7 are two sets of this: the 6 are the live artifacts without a `type` in the tracked `ArtifactNode.jsonld` (the 5 above that are not threads, and `concepts.md`), the 7 are the artifacts without a `type` that carry an `ingestedHash`, with the two thread artifacts of `Apeiron/.state/` (re-counted on both files by the grapher on 2026-10-12).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D253D680002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D253D680005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D253D680005",
    "text": "These seven have been through an ingest and have no `type`, which an ingest sets on an artifact (see Root cause).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D253D680002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D253D680006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D253D680006",
    "text": "**Root cause**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D253D680001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D253D680007"
    ]
  },
  {
