    "title": "**Found again 2026-10-12, in the fact-check of the draft `design/core.md`**",
    "text": "**Found again 2026-10-12, in the fact-check of the draft `design/core.md`**:  the Coder counted the scans behind `allIdsOfKind` against the rule of [The index](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR015) (lookups answered from three structures, the whole store traversed only for the check at load).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0W02KPG001",
