      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D253J400003:props:StringProp:00D253JG18003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D253J400003",
    "text": "`allSubjectIds` (`storeAccess.ts` lines 204 to 210) is a scan of every quad, and it is what `allIdsOfKind` calls (`dehydrate.ts` line 39): every call to `allIdsOfKind` pays one whole scan, as the entry above records for its callers.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D253J400002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D253J400004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Callers counted",
    "text": "Callers counted: 8 scans per flush of both mirrors (4 kinds tracked, 1 + 3 of the thread scope), `pruneUnreachableTombstones` (5 calls over the kinds), `tombstoneVacuousContainers` (once per round), `buildLiveSlugPathIndex`, `checkLinkIntegrity`, `kgTrack`, the lists of live artifacts and live folders, and `pruneStaleUnfolds`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D253J400002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D253J400005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D253J400005",
    "text": "`allObjectRefIds`, which lists the ids referenced and never defined, is a full scan too and is called once per load.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D253J400002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D253J400006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D253J400006",
    "text": "Every other production lookup binds the subject, or the field and the value; these two scans are the exceptions to the rule of the design, and the rule is a goal of the new engine and not a description of today.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D253J400002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D253J400007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D253J400007",
    "text": "**Not proven**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D253J400001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D253J400008",
      "BlockNode:00D3F6ZYWG001"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D253J400008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D253J400008:props:StringProp:00D253JG1G000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D253J400008:props:StringProp:00D253JG1G001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D253J400008",
    "text": "The cost of the extra scans is the one measured above; the Coder did not measure the effect of the set of ids per kind that the design describes.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D253J400007",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
