  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2593220001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**`ownerOfLink` takes the first node whose `links` names a link, and nothing checks that there is only one**",
    "text": "**`ownerOfLink` takes the first node whose `links` names a link, and nothing checks that there is only one**: found 2026-10-12 by the Coder in the fact-check of the draft `design/core.md`, named there in passing under the first-match lookup; the orchestrator asked for its own entry. Filed 2026-10-12.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CF1WZ4JG002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D2593220002",
      "BlockNode:00D2593220004",
      "BlockNode:00D2593220007",
      "BlockNode:00D2593220009",
      "BlockNode:00D259322000B",
      "BlockNode:00D4RXHVZ8001"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2593220002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2593220002:props:StringProp:00D2593E28000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2593220002:props:StringProp:00D2593E28001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D2593220002",
    "text": "**Symptom**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2593220001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D2593220003"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2593220003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2593220003:props:StringProp:00D2593E2G000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2593220003:props:StringProp:00D2593E2G001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D2593220003",
    "text": "None visible. A `Link` is an embedded node with one owner, and the real mirror holds 2,687 `Link`s, each found by its owner through this lookup. The case of a `Link` listed in the `links` of two nodes was not counted.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2593220002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2593220004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D2593220004",
    "text": "**Root cause** (read from the code)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2593220001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D2593220005",
      "BlockNode:00D2593220006"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2593220005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2593220005:props:StringProp:00D2593E2G002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2593220005:props:StringProp:00D2593E2G003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D2593220005",
    "text": "`ownerOfLink` (`node.ts` lines 1396 to 1398) is `firstSubjectWhere(store, 'links', { ref: linkId })`, the first match of the reverse lookup; its comment calls the result \"the one `TreeNode` a `Link` belongs to\".",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2593220004",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2593220006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Its callers",
    "text": "Its callers: `kgBacklinks.ts` (line 35, the owner shown for each backlink) and `buildRenderTree` in `node.ts` (line 1982, the owner of each unfolded `Link` entry of a view). With two owners the answer would be the one the store lists first, which is the dependence on the engine's order that the design rules out.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2593220004",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2593220007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D2593220007",
    "text": "**Not proven**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2593220001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D2593220008"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2593220008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2593220008:props:StringProp:00D2593E2G004",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2593220008:props:StringProp:00D2593E2G005",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D2593220008",
    "text": "Whether any `Link` has two owners in the mirror or can get them through a write; the Coder named the lookup as first-match and did not look for a second owner.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2593220007",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
