  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2595QAG001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**A repeated `@id` is detected and logged, then the load goes on and merges the quads of every occurrence onto one subject; the design says only that the load names the repeat**",
    "text": "**A repeated `@id` is detected and logged, then the load goes on and merges the quads of every occurrence onto one subject; the design says only that the load names the repeat**: found 2026-10-12 by the Coder in the fact-check of the draft `design/core.md`, among the findings the orchestrator asked to file. Filed 2026-10-12.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CF1WZ4JG00J",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
