      }
    ],
    "title": "None in the data",
    "text": "None in the data: the real mirror has 0 repeated ids among 16,614 documents.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2595QAG002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Once it happened",
    "text": "Once it happened: two `Profile` documents under one `@id` were merged, and one of them vanished at the next write (the resolved entry linked below). The service now logs a warning at start and at reload that names the ids and says at most one document per id survives the next write-back; no command replies with it.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2595QAG002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D2595QAR001",
    "text": "**Root cause** (read from the code)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2595QAG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D2595QAR002",
      "BlockNode:00D2595QAR003",
      "BlockNode:00D2595QAR004"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR002:props:StringProp:00D2596398000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR002:props:StringProp:00D2596398001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D2595QAR002",
    "text": "`encodeDoc` (`store.ts` lines 70 to 75) pushes an id seen before onto `duplicateIds` and then goes on to add every field of the document as quads, so the quads of every occurrence land on one subject. `rehydrateStore` returns the ids, sorted and without repeats (line 147). The doc comment of the result says the repeat is surfaced and never resolved, because picking a winner would be a quieter way to lose the same data.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Readers of `duplicateIds`",
    "text": "Readers of `duplicateIds`: `service.ts` (lines 162 to 167 and 390 to 394), which logs the warning and nothing more.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D2595QAR004",
    "text": "The design (`An @id names one document`) says only that the load names a repeated id to its caller and the service logs it; it does not say whether the load should go on.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D2595QAR005",
    "text": "**Not proven**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2595QAG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D2595QAR006",
      "BlockNode:00D2595QAR007"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR006:props:StringProp:00D2596398002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR006:props:StringProp:00D2596398003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D2595QAR006",
    "text": "What the engine holds for a field that is single-valued by shape when two occurrences give it two values; the Coder did not run it.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D2595QAR007",
    "text": "Whether a refusal to load, or a load that goes on and tells the client, is the better rule; the design lists no Open point for it.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D2595QAR008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D2595QAR008",
    "text": "**Fix directions**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D2595QAG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D2595QAR009"
    ]
  },
  {
