    "title": "00D2598018001",
    "text": "Promoted to [the `danglingRefs` entry](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D258W098001), [the thread-scope test entry](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2590B2R001), [the `ownerOfLink` entry](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2593220001) and [the repeated-`@id` entry](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2595QAG001) (the four findings of point (2) above, filed in `design-core-draft` Turn 3).",
