    "title": "00D2PCQ6B8001",
    "text": "Promoted to [Writes](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR019) (an added pair that is present changes nothing), [Reverse, for each field, built on first use](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR017) (a bucket is a set for removal and membership), [Containment](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR00Z) (`children` is derived), [Links are embedded edges](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR011) (the multiplicity is of subjects), [Where a node's parent comes from](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2562RC8001) (decided, and moved from the Open points to the data model) and [Containment in the file](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T0000), and to [the issue on a stopped service and a busy one](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2PCFDBR001).",
