    "title": "00D2PVZBT8000",
    "text": "Promoted to [Layout](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01B) (a record for each subject, for modularity; the Open point on the layout is closed) and [A file whose `parent` and `children` disagree](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2PV8GC0001) (the pending Open point). The graphs and partitions of the reading above were not promoted: that is a design of its own, kept out of `design/core.md` on the user's correction of 2026-10-13.",
