    "title": "00D2T7HTXR001",
    "text": "Promoted to [Captured port views](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2T5Z6J0001) and [Files](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01X) (kept under `.state/`), to the Open point [The name of a captured port view](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2T6X3CG001), and to the marks \"(proposal, not agreed)\" in [Status](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR005), [For each kind, a set of ids](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR018), [Writes](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR019), [A path names one live node](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01R), [Tombstones](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01V), [A repeated `@id` at load](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2PC3ZG8001) and [A file whose `parent` and `children` disagree](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2PV8GC0001).",
