    "title": "**The mismatch, analysed** (2026-10-14)",
    "text": "**The mismatch, analysed** (2026-10-14): the cost measured on the Oxigraph store has three causes. Only the first belongs to RDF; the second multiplies it; the third is in the code, and no engine removes it. The rule drawn from it is [Why a node-based engine](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D39EJSZ8001) in the design.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D21FP4ZG009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
