    "title": "00D39EY5B8001",
    "text": "`dehydrate.ts` sorts the values of a set field (line 58) and the documents of each file (lines 106, 130 and 138) with `stableId(a).localeCompare(stableId(b))`. The order `localeCompare` gives depends on the locale and the collation data of the runtime, so the byte-for-byte round trip could depend on the machine that flushes.",
