    "title": "00D3CP80R8001",
    "text": "Promoted as the third batch into [Core — Design](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR001), restructured around [The boundary](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CJFB7G001) into [The engine, in memory](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CHJXK0001) and [The caller, on disk](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CHMYQG001); the settled port notion went to [Ports, the two ends of a pair](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CJCK10001), and each origin above carries its own note.",
