    ],
    "title": "00D3DT2RG8001",
    "text": "**Settled by the user: remove the block about `key` from the design** (2026-10-14, user, on [the key getter](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D3DMW2J8001)): \"That block about `key` had its own role when it unified the 3 IDs, but has no clear role in the new design. So let's remove it.\" For the next batch: `BlockNode:00D24N87SR012` (\"The key is derived\") is removed from `design/core.md`; the rename question of `key` against `StringProp.key` falls away with it.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0V83SF8001",
