        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D3EZWV70001:links:Link:00D3EZX880000:props:StringProp:00D3EZX880001",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "165"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D3EZWV70001",
    "text": "**The user asks for the details of the belonging review and the Grapher's six questions** (2026-10-14, user). The orchestrator gave the 23 statements of the review ([the Turn 9 Report](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D3EQKVJ8001)) with a default for each, and flagged four where the review's suggestion goes against a decision the user made: the Status note of the fact-check with its issue links (settled), the rationale's links to the evidence (settled with the placement), the rewording of where a node's parent comes from, which the user asked to state today's extraction of the index (settled), and the flush as a dump with partitioning later (settled as the order of work); for those four the default is to keep them. The six questions were given with the orchestrator's proposals and reasons.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0V83SF8001",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3F2R95G001",
