    "text": "**Behaviour it gave without being asked**: it refused an id that was not a valid IRI, and it rewrote a non-canonical integer into its canonical form. Whether the engine keeps either is an Open point of [the design](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000S).",
