    "title": "00D3F6RJCG003",
    "text": "In `Apeiron/ArtifactNode.jsonld` (read 2026-10-14), 7 of the 54 live `ArtifactNode` documents carry no `parent`: `concepts.md` and six `README.md` nodes (`README.md`, `design/README.md`, `discussion/README.md`, `issues/README.md`, `planning/README.md` and `history/README.md`). The fact-check of 2026-10-12 counted the same seven. The six `README.md` nodes are strays, filed as [Six live `ArtifactNode`s for `README.md` files](#id/BlockNode:00D3WTZG9G001): a `README.md` file is the organic part of its folder, which holds its content among its own children, and needs no parent of its own. `concepts.md`, at the root, is the one live artifact without a parent.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3F6RJCG002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3F6RJCG004",
