    "title": "No fix in the migration. Decided 2026-10-16 (the user)",
    "text": "No fix in the migration. Decided 2026-10-16 (the user): the migration of the mirror leaves `concepts.md` as it stands, with no `parent`, beside the 42 blocks of [42 live `BlockNode`s have no `parent` and no container lists them](#id/BlockNode:00D3YS41VR001) ([Batch 9](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YSA5T8002)), so that it tests how the new engine handles it, the case of [garbage collection never collects an unreachable block that was never tombstoned](#id/BlockNode:00D1A2AY68001). Nothing uses `concepts.md` now and it could be removed, but it is kept for that test. The stored `path` stays for now, so `concepts.md` keeps its path until the batch that removes it ([Batch 16](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4RNDQVG001), whose holes are stated under [Deriving the path](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D25698B0001)); once the path is derived, `concepts.md` is the case that [a path that cannot be derived](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4R9VPGR001) is refused for, and it is kept as the test of that refusal.",
