    "title": "00D3F6ZYWG001",
    "text": "Which callers of \"all ids of kind K\" drop the tombstoned ids afterwards: the draft design stated that most of them do, a few want the tombstoned ones, and the write of the mirror takes all; no list of the callers by what they keep is recorded. It decides whether [a set of live ids](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000X) is worth keeping beside the collection of each kind.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D253J400007",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
