    "title": "00D3F741JR001",
    "text": "Whether the render's choice of the one canonical place of a node reached through several unfolded links follows the order of the unfolded ids, which the mirror lists only by id; if it does, the rendered tree depends on that order. Raised 2026-10-12 with the user's decisions on the order, not checked since; the design keeps it as [The canonical-render order check](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000Q).",
