    "title": "Decided",
    "text": "Decided: the `predicate` leaves every `Link`, and manual links are dropped, since they were never used and the mirror holds none. The mirror loses the `predicate` in its one-time migration ([Batch 9, step 6](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3Y3DMTR001)). The code of the caller loses the six sites that tell a wikilink from a manual link (`artifacts.ts:606`, `node.ts:1067`, `node.ts:343-345` and `:369`, `kgLink.ts:56`, `kgUnfold.ts:113,144` with `node.ts:1936,1940`, and the render JSON that `web/src/render.ts:42` and `FolderDiv.tsx:534` read), the verbs `aperas link` and `aperas unlink`, and the predicate in the text of `tree` and `unfold`, in [Batch 11, step 9](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YG50AR001). The tests that write or filter on a predicate are `ingest/chain.test.ts:134,148,159`, `gc/collection.test.ts:63` and `store/views.test.ts`.",
