    "title": "Promoted as the sixth batch into [Core — Design](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR001)",
    "text": "Promoted as the sixth batch into [Core — Design](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR001): [The artifact is its own root document](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR010) (the abstract is the frontmatter `description`), [Links are embedded edges](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR011) with [the fields of `Link`](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR00T) and [its format in the mirror](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR025) (no predicate), [Ports](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2T5VG08001), [Writes](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR019), [Layout](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01B) and the Open point [How a path names one node](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D25686RR001); into the history as [No edge class beyond `Link`](../history/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR014) and [A path names one live node](../history/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01R); into the issues as [Every `Link` carries a `predicate`](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3WNBPPG001); and the Symptom of [the ingested artifacts without a `type`](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D253D680001) reworded and Turn 9's go note moved back beside its origin.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0V83SF8001",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3WNXHQG001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
