    ],
    "title": "00D3WR0N3R001",
    "text": "**Settled by the user: an artifact with no `description` simply has no basis for detecting a rename; that is a gap in its content, not in the system** (2026-10-15, user, on [the `text` decision](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D3WNXHQG001)): \"Then it simply lacks a basis to detect rename. That's a miss of the content, not of the system.\" For the issue on an artifact's `text`: the `text` of an artifact or folder comes from its frontmatter `description` and is what the rename check compares; without a `description` no rename is detected, by design, and the remedy is to write one.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D0V83SF8001",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
