    "title": "00D3WTZG9G003",
    "text": "In `Apeiron/ArtifactNode.jsonld` (read 2026-10-15), six live `ArtifactNode`s have the paths `README.md`, `design/README.md`, `discussion/README.md`, `issues/README.md`, `planning/README.md` and `history/README.md`. None of them has a `parent`, none is listed in the `children` of any `FolderNode`, and each has one child block.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3WTZG9G002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3WTZG9R000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D3WTZG9R000",
    "text": "The README content of a folder is already the folder's own: each of the six folders (the root folder `.`, `design`, `discussion`, `issues`, `planning` and `history`) holds one `BlockNode` among its children with its README's content, beside its artifacts and subfolders. The child block of each of the six `ArtifactNode`s has the same text as the block its folder holds, and neither has children, so the six duplicate what the folders hold.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3WTZG9G002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3WTZG9R001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D3WTZG9R001",
    "text": "Their `lastTrackedAt` and `lastIngestedAt` fall on 2026-09-22. How they were made is not traced. Counted on the mirror files as last flushed, not on the store in memory.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3WTZG9G002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
