    "title": "Decided 2026-10-15",
    "text": "Decided 2026-10-15: the six artifacts and their six paragraphs are deleted outright from the mirror in the one-time migration ([Batch 9, step 6](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3Y3DMTR001)), and not given a parent. A tombstone would only wait for the engine to run to be wiped, with the same net result. A `track` or `ingest` run after the deletion must not register them again; the dry run of the migration on a clone checks that.",
