    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**The stored `text` of an artifact or a folder is a copy of a descendant's text, kept only as a rename fingerprint, where it should come from the frontmatter `description`**",
    "text": "**The stored `text` of an artifact or a folder is a copy of a descendant's text, kept only as a rename fingerprint, where it should come from the frontmatter `description`**: found 2026-10-15 by the user, reading `design/core.md`, who called the fingerprint \"a legacy left over, not intended design\"; counted the same day by the Grapher. Filed 2026-10-15.",
