        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D3WV3CZ8003",
    "text": "None decided. Whatever the fix, an artifact or a folder without a `description` has no basis for detecting a rename, by design: the user called it \"a miss of the content, not of the system\", and its remedy is to write a `description`.",
