    "title": "2026-10-15, two statements left [Core — Design](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR001)",
    "text": "2026-10-15, two statements left [Core — Design](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR001): [No edge class beyond `Link`](#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR014) and [A path names one live node](#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01R), kept above under the first draft with their words as they stood.",
