    "title": "**The edge class**",
    "text": "**The edge class**: the user removed the predicate of a `Link` as a legacy of RDF triples, so a link has a `target` and no predicate, and the types of links are to be given by a linking design of their own, through containment, with the metadata of a link in the content of the block that holds it. The retraction of edges into links leaves no edge class for the design to rule out.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3WV5V48001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3WV5V48003",
