    "title": "**From RDF triples to a node-based engine**",
    "text": "**From RDF triples to a node-based engine**: the Oxigraph store held every property as a statement of its own; the design keeps the properties of a node on its record and makes only the relations between nodes pairs, because commands read whole nodes and the vocabulary is closed (see [Why a node-based engine](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D39EJSZ8001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3X4321G001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
