        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Pairs and ports**",
    "text": "**Pairs and ports**: a field is a fixed relation and a pair is one link of it, held on its subject's forward side and on its value's reverse side; a pair joins an outgoing port of its subject to an incoming port of its object (see [Ports, the two ends of a pair](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CJCK10001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3X4321G001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
