    "title": "00D3X5YXWR001",
    "text": "**Verification — the last turn of the design drafting (`design-core-draft` Turn 13, Report `BlockNode:00D3X5J7JG00C`)** (2026-10-15, orchestrator): the eight items are applied: the two rewordings (`00D24N87T000R`; the issue `00D3F6RJCG001` now covers only `concepts.md`, and the stray-README issue's Related entry updated to match); the \"Promoted to\" note for the `key` removal; the issue `00D0W07DRR000` resolved and moved under Resolved, the service lifecycle staying an Open point; the Status of the design; the history milestone `00D3X4321G001` and its Current Status; the pointer `00D3X4DNWG001` from `discussion/core.md` to this session's Freeflow heading; eight tasks closed with a dated \"Done\" line and what remains (four per thread); no write refused (a fourth data point for the retry rule), nothing removed, `aperas check-links` clean, tracked changes staged. Left, as the Grapher reports: two Related entries in `issues/core.md` (`00D0X1SZ40012`, `00D0X1HTFR00S`) still say `design/` has no document for the store; small, for a later turn. The Grapher's note that projecting `.threads/coder.md` overwrote a file changed on disk concerns a git-ignored projection, regenerated from the graph, so nothing of the graph was lost. The design drafting is closed.",
