    "title": "**The archive layout in `Aperas.dev/monorepo/.archive/`**",
    "text": "**The archive layout in `Aperas.dev/monorepo/.archive/`**: the existing TerminusDB-era archive moves from `.archive/src/` to `.archive/tdb/`, keeping its directory structure (`.archive/tdb/src/lib/…`), and a new `.archive/oxigraph/` holds the Oxigraph-based code.",
