    "title": "**A snapshot, done now**",
    "text": "**A snapshot, done now**: the user chose to copy the current Oxigraph-touching sources into `.archive/oxigraph/` now as a frozen reference, keeping their directory structure, while the live code stays in place and is rewritten for the new engine. The moves are done now, not as a step of the plan.",
