    "title": "**Archive step checked, 2026-10-15**",
    "text": "**Archive step checked, 2026-10-15**: in `Aperas.dev/` the staged changes are 24 renames (`.archive/src/` → `.archive/tdb/src/`) and 40 added files under `.archive/oxigraph/`, and nothing outside `.archive/` changed. Every copy is byte-identical to its live source, and `Aperas/` is untouched. `npm run verify` has not run: `Aperas.dev/monorepo/node_modules` does not exist, and the coder installed nothing.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XJ7GTR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
