    "title": "## Archive",
    "text": "The batches of the reconcile-identity bug family, done on the Oxigraph-era engine, with the verification they were held to. They are kept for the record of what was fixed and how; the plan above is for the engine of [Core — Design](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR001).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CF23FB1G001",
    "type": "heading",
