    "title": "**Numbering**",
    "text": "**Numbering**: the batches continue the numbering of [Batch 1](#id/BlockNode:00CGK2C16G001) and [Batch 2](#id/BlockNode:00CGK3AH60001). [Batch 15](#id/BlockNode:00D4NBFKAG001) took the next number and came first in the order, before [Batch 3](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VG001). The twelve are done and kept in the [Archive](#id/BlockNode:00D3XP4XK0001). [Batch 16](#id/BlockNode:00D4RNDQVG001) took the number after Batch 15 and comes last in the order, after [Batch 14](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W0019).",
