    "title": "**Order**",
    "text": "**Order**: work that no open point blocks comes first. A batch that an open point gates builds all it can and names the gated step under **Gated by**; that step waits for the decision, and the batch is done when its other steps are and the gated step is recorded as waiting. [Batch 16](#id/BlockNode:00D4RNDQVG001) comes last: it removes the stored `path`, which every batch before it keeps, and its open points wait for the user. The plan decides none of the [Open points](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000J).",
