    "title": "**The design is the contract, the Oxigraph code is the reference**",
    "text": "**The design is the contract, the Oxigraph code is the reference**: [Core — Design](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR001) states rules the engine must satisfy, not a description of the old code ([Status](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR005)). Where the old code differs from a rule, the rule wins and the difference is one of the filed issues, closed by the batch that names it under **Closes**. Where the design is silent, the reference copy's behaviour is kept and the batch says so.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CF23FB1G002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
