    "title": "**The code map the plan stands on**",
    "text": "**The code map the plan stands on**: the graph holds the map of the store reads of the Oxigraph code, by file and line ([the map](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D1GCR1XR001)), the census of its predicates and the fact-check of the design. The structure of the callers above the store (which of `node.ts`'s 2,241 lines are the engine's, which are ingest, reconcile, render or sweeps, and which exports the commands and the service use) is in [the map of the callers above the store](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YFA80R001). Batch 11 stands on that map; Batches 3 to 10 do not.",
