    "title": "**1. The module and its boundary**",
    "text": "**1. The module and its boundary**: the engine is the directory `monorepo/packages/core/src/apeironNgn/` itself, with no `engine/` inside it, emptied by [Batch 15](#id/BlockNode:00D4NBFKAG001). The files of the directory import only files inside it: no `node:` module and no package at all (the package form `@aperas/core/...` included), so no file system (`node:fs`), no store library (`oxigraph`, `@rdfjs/data-model`), nothing of `../shell/` and no file of `src/` outside the directory (`../*.ts`); a type-only import is refused like any other. A test reads the imports of every file of the directory and fails on any of these, so that [the boundary](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CJFB7G001) is held by a check and not by habit.",
