    "title": "**3. The interface as types**",
    "text": "**3. The interface as types**: the construction with a schema, and [the Reads, Writes, Persistence and Ports](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T0003) as a TypeScript interface of plain strings, numbers, booleans and rows, never a term or a pair ([the index is private](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01A)). Every read and write takes a graph argument, with one default graph until Batch 8 adds the creation and the dropping of graphs. The creation of a node, the creation and the dropping of a graph and the port operations are typed here and built by their own batches. The [Persistence](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4MZ7DZG001) group is typed with the rest: build (one operation: it creates a node with a given id, kind and graph and sets its fields, a reference to a node not yet built being accepted), read out (the record of a node lists `parent` at its place, read from the reverse side of `children`), and the ids referenced and never defined. An id is a plain string in the engine's grammar, `Kind:snowflake` or `owner:field:Kind:snowflake`, which the shell mints and the engine checks ([Ids](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01N)). No operation marks a field partitioning, since the mark is in the schema ([Partitioning fields](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CJDGH8001)). [Not offered](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000H) stays absent: no pattern over an unbound field, no match on the object alone, no graph position, no query language, no load or dump.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**4. The oracle**",
    "text": "**4. The oracle**: a naive implementation of the same interface, constructed with the same schema as the engine, a map of pairs with linear scans, kept for tests under `tests/support/`. Every later batch tests the engine against it with seeded random sequences of operations.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
