    "title": "**Closes**",
    "text": "**Closes**: the first part of [the store is read outside the helpers](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2536E1R001): the engine has one seam, and the rest of it closes in Batches 11 and 12. [Ingested artifacts without a `type`](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D253D680001): the Aperas schema declares the `type` of an `ArtifactNode` optional, as the design states, so such an artifact is a valid document; whether the artifacts that carry none are given one is a question of the data and stays on that issue.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
