    "title": "**4. The master map and the collections**",
    "text": "**4. The master map and the collections**: one map from id to record, and one collection for each graph and kind holding the records themselves, in order of insertion; creating a node adds its record, and deleting it removes it, which waits for `removeNode` in [Batch 5](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR00H) step 3 ([Records by kind and by graph](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR018)). The read \"all ids of a kind\" iterates the collection.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
