      }
    ],
    "title": "**5. The orders**",
    "text": "**5. The orders**: one comparison of ids by plain code point, the only one used to order ids; the links of a block by `position`, any other set by id, and a tie by id ([Ordering](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01C)). A test shuffles the order of insertion and sees the same sorted output.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
