    "title": "**Gated by**",
    "text": "**Gated by**: [Existence](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000K) gates step 6, whether a node exists by being in a registry or by having a pair, and a write to an absent subject (`addPair`, `clearField`, `removeNode`), as one function where the check will sit, throwing `Undecided('Existence')`; [Enforcement](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000M) gates a write outside the shape (an undeclared field, a value of the wrong sort, a second value in a `one` or `optional` field), as one function where the check will sit, throwing `Undecided('Enforcement')`; [An invalid id and a non-canonical integer](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000S) gates whether step 1 rewrites a non-canonical integer, its id half being settled (step 3 refuses an id that fails the grammar); [A set of live ids](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000X) gates whether step 4 keeps a second collection of live ids, so step 4 keeps the one collection the design states; [The order of links without a position](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000P) gates how step 5 sorts a link with no `position` against one with it.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
