    "text": "**Done when**: the model-based test of literal and single-valued fields holds against the oracle; a table test of ids covers a folder or an artifact named after a kind (never taken for an id); the shuffle test holds; steps 1 to 5 pass in `commit`, with the deletion half of step 4 recorded as waiting for `removeNode` in [Batch 5](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR00H), and step 6 recorded as waiting.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR006",
