    "title": "**1. Pairs and the forward side**",
    "text": "**1. Pairs and the forward side**: the values of a reference or embed field are pairs on the subject's record; a write replaces the old values with the new ones; adding a pair already present changes nothing ([Writes](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR019)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR00H",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
