    "title": "**5. Links and backlinks**",
    "text": "**5. Links and backlinks**: a `Link` has a `target` and `props`; the backlinks of a node are the `Link`s whose `target` is the node, each with its owner, read from the owner segment of the `Link`'s id and not by a scan ([Links are outgoing ports](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR011)).",
