    "title": "**2. Partitioning fields**",
    "text": "**2. Partitioning fields**: a field can be marked partitioning in the schema, closed at construction, with no mark set at run time, and the engine ensures the mark: it refuses a write that would give a node a second value on the climbed side or close a cycle ([Partitioning fields](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CJDGH8001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR00V",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
