    "title": "**Closes**",
    "text": "**Closes**: [sibling indexes are not kept dense](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D252Y7WR001) (there is no index); [a child can end with two `parent` pairs](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2532JJR001) (the engine refuses the second container).",
