    ],
    "title": "**3. The sweep**",
    "text": "**3. The sweep**: a mark from every live node of the root kinds that the schema marks, through the fields that it marks for the sweep (in the Aperas schema, every live `ArtifactNode` and `FolderNode`, through `children` and the targets of links), and a sweep of every tombstone left unmarked, so that a dead island of tombstones that point only at each other goes too ([The sweep](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CHJXK8001)). When it runs is the service's.",
