    "title": "**Closes**",
    "text": "**Closes**: [tombstoning does not empty the node at every site](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D252W7VG001) for the nodes the engine tombstones; the tombstones that the mirror already holds (188 in `Apeiron/`, 31 in `Apeiron/.state/`) are a question of the migration of the mirror, which strips them from the tree ([Batch 9, step 6](#id/BlockNode:00D3Y3DMTR001)): 52 of them still hold `children`, `links` or `props` (40 in `Apeiron/`, all `props`; 12 in `Apeiron/.state/`), and 187 of the 188 in `Apeiron/` still carry a `parent` and stand in the `children` of their container.",
