    "title": "**Gated by**",
    "text": "**Gated by**: nothing; step 4 awaited the user's confirmation of `graphOf`, which is not given: it is built and recorded as unconfirmed. [Existence](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000K) and [Enforcement](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000M) reach the batch as before: `exists` and `size` stay `Undecided('Existence')`, and a write that needs the class stays `Undecided('Enforcement')`, recorded as waiting.",
