    "title": "**1. The dump**",
    "text": "**1. The dump**: the files of [The mirror](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01W) and their [format](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01Z): documents sorted by `@id` by code point, indented by two spaces, ending with a newline, fields in the order the schema declares, an unset field or an empty set left out except `children`, embedded entries and the values of a reference set sorted by id, integers in their canonical text. A dump reads the records out through the persistence API, serializes them and rebuilds nothing from pairs ([A flush is a dump](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D39EAKW0001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR01M",
