    "title": "**4. The round trip is exact**",
    "text": "**4. The round trip is exact**: a load followed by a dump returns the files byte for byte, so a flush with nothing changed leaves git clean ([The round trip is exact](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T0001)).",
