  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W0003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Done when**",
    "text": "**Done when**: the round trip is exact on the fixture (in `essential`) and on a copy of the mirror (in `demand`, when the user asks) against the migrated mirror of step 6; that mirror holds no `predicate` on a `Link`, no tombstone with a `parent`, `children`, `links` or `props` or listed in the `children` of a container, none of the six `README.md` artifacts or their paragraphs, no `unfolds` entry whose target is not defined and no artifact that holds a `type`, and `Profile:00CJC4S69R000` (`dinhlx`) holds `kind: human`, `default` being left without a `kind`, and the 42 live blocks and `concepts.md` that have no parent stand as they were, and the dry run of the migration on a clone shows that a `track` and an `ingest` do not register the six again; the fixtures for a repeated `@id` and for a disagreeing `parent` and `children` give the results the design states; `commit` passes; the table of settings, read from `aperas.config.json` with no `graphs` key, gives the three graphs the files and the intervals of today (`tree` in `Apeiron/` every 10 s, `threads.tree` and `treeviews` in `Apeiron/.state/` every 3 s), a `graphs` key changes them, and the mapping made from the table gives the file of each graph and kind; the gated steps are recorded as waiting.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR01M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
