    "title": "**3. The stored path stays**",
    "text": "**3. The stored path stays**: the engine's batches keep the stored `path` of an artifact and a folder, as the Aperas schema declares it, until [Batch 16](#id/BlockNode:00D4RNDQVG001) removes it; the path of a block is built from its nearest artifact's path and the slugs of the titles above it ([The path is derived from the parent chain](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01S)). The map of step 1 is keyed by the stored `path` and, once the path is derived, by the derived one. Built: `pathKeyOf(record)` is the one place that gives the key.",
