    "title": "**Closes**",
    "text": "**Closes**: [`findByExactPath` takes the first node found at a path](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZMTKG001) in part, the primitive built and its reproduction written, the readers of the reference copy moving in [Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C) ([the readers of the old lookups](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D6HTH5ZR001)); and, as far as the maps serve them, the first-match behaviour of [three behaviours of the caller depend on the order of an unordered read](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YFXDC800D) and the four scans for a literal value of [full-store scans](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D0W02KPG001).",
