    "title": "### Batch 11 — done: the layers above, moved onto the engine",
    "text": "The batch is carried out in ten pieces of one coder turn each, in dependency order, which are listed first; the numbered steps after them state what each layer changes, as [the map of the callers above the store](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YFA80R001) found it, and each piece names the steps it carries. The pieces replace the eight groups that the steps first suggested and the cut by file that was weighed against them (see the open points after the steps).",
