      }
    ],
    "title": "**3. Reads**",
    "text": "**3. Reads**: tree, show, backlinks, resolve, unfold, the render tree. The render is about 690 lines of `node.ts` (lines 1325 to 2007), shell logic over `wrap`, `treeChildren`, `links`, `parent` and `backlinks(…, 'target').length`; the gate of this step sits exactly at `node.ts` lines 1975 to 1987 and 1530 to 1569 (the order of `unfolds`). The existence of a node is a prerequisite of the step and not part of the seam: `nodeExists` has 19 production sites (`kgFold`, `kgShow`, `kgUnfold`, `kgZoom`, `resolve.ts`, `resolveCreate.ts`, `artifacts.ts`, `linkIntegrity.ts` and `node.ts`). `findByExactPath` becomes the live primitive of Batch 10 before `resolve.ts` and `kgProject.ts` move. Most of this group has no test group today (see [step 10](#id/BlockNode:00D3Z01YER001)).",
