    ],
    "title": "00D3XQQ2W000H",
    "text": "**5. Ingest, track and project**, with the lookups of Batch 10. `artifacts.ts` (810 lines) and `folders.ts` carry the work; `positionsEqual` (`artifacts.ts:371`) is changed to a comparison that does not depend on the order of an unordered read.",
