    "title": "**Gated by**",
    "text": "**Gated by**: nothing now; the points that gated it were settled on 2026-10-20. [The canonical place in the render](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000Q) settled the choice of the place of a node reached through several unfolded links in step 3; [The order of links without a position](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000P) settled how a block's links are listed when one has no `position`; [No set of live ids](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000X) settled the callers of \"all ids of kind K\" that drop the tombstoned ids afterwards; the [open points of the batch](#id/BlockNode:00D3YG50B0000) are settled; and the rule for a load that rejects a document is kept in [Packaging — Design](../design/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00D76B1ZTR001), which settles step 8 beyond the swap of the store for the engine. What the service does with the list of undefined ids ([`danglingRefs` not read by the service](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D258W098001)) stays outside: [The service lifecycle](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000W) still gates it.",
