    "title": "**Done when**",
    "text": "**Done when**: each group is followed by the test groups of the code it moved, green on the new engine in `commit`; the commands and the service that no test group covers today (`runTree`, `runShow`, `runPath`, `runResolve`, `runProject`, `runTrack`, `runReverseTrack`, `runUnfold`, `runFold`, `runZoom`, `runRemove`, `runProfile*`, `service.ts` and `serviceClient.ts`) have the tests of [step 10](#id/BlockNode:00D3Z01YER001) written before their group moves (`runLinkCandidates` is waived and goes with its verb in step 9); a move of a node after an anchor in its own subtree is refused and the service goes on answering ([the issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D6HAEDCR001)); the differential run of Verification Plan layer 4 shows no difference outside the list of deliberate ones.",
