    "title": "**1. The tests of the frozen files and the made-up predicates**",
    "text": "**1. The tests of the frozen files and the made-up predicates**: piece 6 of Batch 11 moved the fixture (`makeFixtureStore()` in `support/fixture.ts` builds a `newDb()`; the groups `store`, `gc`, `ingest`, `linking`, `links`, `folder` and `corpus` run on it) and rewrote the raw-quad tests of the groups that moved, so they are done when this batch starts. What is left is the tests of the frozen files, which run on an old `Store` made from the dump (`support/oldFixture.ts` and `support/oldCorpus.ts`): `store/storeAccess.test.ts`, `store/roundtrip.test.ts`, `corpus/roundtrip.test.ts`, `support/roundtripChild.ts` and the reproduction blocks of `mirror/load.test.ts` and `mirror/format.test.ts`; they go with the frozen set in step 4, with the two support files. After the flip no test outside them imports `oxigraph` except `shell/oldEngine.test.ts` and `engine/boundary.test.ts`, so a test that writes a made-up predicate on a scratch store, which is rewritten against the shapes, is any that the search for `oxigraph` and for raw terms in the tests finds once the frozen tests are gone.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000S",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000V",
