    "title": "**2. The dev tools**",
    "text": "**2. The dev tools**: piece 6 of Batch 11 deleted `apeironNgnSmokeTest.ts` ([it is referenced by nothing and asks for a dead predicate](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZV0FG001)) and `verifyDanglingUnfolds.ts`, and ported `verifyLinkRefusals.ts` to the engine (it counts records), because they built a raw `Store` and called `wrap`, and `tsc` of `cli` failed otherwise. What is left of the step is the check that no dev tool or script under `monorepo/` imports `oxigraph` or a file of the frozen set, which step 3's search covers.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000S",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000W",
