    "title": "**Gated by**",
    "text": "**Gated by**: [Enforcement](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000M) gates the rewrite of the tests that write made-up predicates ([the stale smoke test](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZV0FG001) is the same family), as far as the decision changes what such a write does.",
