    "title": "**Done when**",
    "text": "**Done when**: `npm run verify` (the `commit` suite, 60 s) passes in `Aperas.dev/`; a search of `monorepo/packages` for `oxigraph` finds nothing outside `.archive/`, so nothing under `src/shell/` imports `oxigraph`; the bundle starts.",
