    "title": "**2. The measurements**, by the criteria of [the production-bound measurement](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D1GCR1Y0002)",
    "text": "**2. The measurements**, by the criteria of [the production-bound measurement](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D1GCR1Y0002): resident memory with `gc()` before every reading, over at least 10 cycles of dump, sweeps and link integrity, and over a loop of reloads; the time to ready at boot against the client's waits ([start](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D0W05P08001), [restart](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D0W044DG001), [boot and shutdown cost](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CVQHCEW8001)), with the target that the new engine's start is ready within `READY_TIMEOUT_MS` (5,000 ms in `serviceClient.ts`), a constant that stays as it is; the time of a dump; the cost of one `insert` before and after its reply ([the cost of a write](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22Z1HJ8001)); the time of the `commit` suite ([a used process](../design/testing.md#id/BlockNode:00D1EG6N6R001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W0010",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
