    "title": "### Batch 14 — ports and captured port views",
    "text": "The ports are the design's answer to a reverse bucket of thousands of subjects. No other batch needs them, since a flat set is the case of an unbounded cap, so they follow the comparison and a second run of its measurements shows what they add.",
