    "title": "**3. A partition hierarchy**",
    "text": "**3. A partition hierarchy**: the check of the mark applies (Batch 6), and the mark names no direction: the climbed side follows from the field's cardinality, forward for a single-valued field (the primary-supertag field of an IS-A use) and on the reverse side for a many-valued one, which is the only side Batch 6 built (`partition` in `engine.ts`); a secondary edge of a many-valued relation is marked as such when written and the partition ignores it ([A partition hierarchy](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2T5XBH0001), [Partitioning fields](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CJDGH8001)).",
