    "title": "**4. Captured port views**",
    "text": "**4. Captured port views**: the engine shows the port tree of a bucket, the shell captures it as a view that keeps only the shape, the boundary node of each port, and the engine answers through it by merging its finer ports or sorting a coarser one ([Captured port views](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2T5Z6J0001), [the interface](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2T6KMXR001)).",
