    "title": "**Checked, 2026-10-15**",
    "text": "**Checked, 2026-10-15**: in `Aperas.dev/monorepo`, `npm ci` installed 203 packages and `npm run verify` (the `commit` suite) passed 61 of 61 in 23 s, under its 60 s budget. The bare `aperas` shim runs `Aperas/monorepo`; `npm run aperas` there runs `Aperas.dev`'s own code, but the service lock, socket, token and port 2736 are per user, so it would share the running `Aperas/` service unless given its own `XDG_RUNTIME_DIR` and `APERAS_HTTP_PORT` (read from `serviceLock.ts`, not run). `package.json` has no `typecheck` script.",
