    "text": "**Where it is built**: the archive layout of `Aperas.dev/monorepo/.archive/` is done, with `.archive/tdb/` and a frozen `.archive/oxigraph/` ([the layout](#id/BlockNode:00D3XJ7GTR003), [checked](#id/BlockNode:00D3XMGTY8001)), and `Aperas.dev/monorepo` runs: its dependencies are installed and `npm run verify` (the `commit` suite) passes ([checked](#id/BlockNode:00D3XSF9JR001)).",
