    "title": "`index.ts` (3 re-export lines) is imported by nothing",
    "text": "`index.ts` (3 re-export lines) is imported by nothing: every consumer imports `@aperas/core/apeironNgn/<module>`. `apeironNgnSmokeTest.ts` (139 lines, uses `backlinks(…, '__parent')`, a field that no longer exists), `compareMigration.ts` (124 lines, a TerminusDB comparison) and `index.ts` are referenced by no script, suite or file.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3YFA80R002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3YFA810000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D3YFA810000",
    "text": "**Commands** (17 `kg*.ts` files; 26 exported `runX(store: Store, …)` entry points; each imports `type { Store }` from `oxigraph`): `wrap` 41 (14 files), `resolveDeepPath` 21 (13), `backlinks` 12 (2: `kgBacklinks.ts`, `kgProfile.ts`), `resolveBlockLinks` 11 (`kgInsert.ts`, `kgUpdate.ts`), `displayLabel` 9 (5), `nodeKindFromId` 8 (6), `nodeExists` 5 (`kgFold.ts:19`, `kgShow.ts:26`, `kgUnfold.ts:106,131`, `kgZoom.ts:28`), `allIdsOfKind` 5 (`kgProfile.ts:65,111`, `kgTrack.ts:82,92,104`), `assertLinksAcceptable` 4, `resolveTreeView` 4, `collectOldWikilinksByBlock` 3, `findEnclosingArtifactId` 3, `deriveAbstractFromLiveChildren` 3, `trackAllArtifacts` 3, `buildRenderTree` 3, `findProfileByHandle` 3, `tombstoneLiveSubtree` 2 (`kgRemove.ts:42`), `applyTombstone` 1 (`kgUpdate.ts:332`), `serializeDoc` 2 (`kgShow.ts`), and one or two each of `ingestAllArtifacts`, `ingestArtifacts`, `findLiveArtifactByPath`, `trackArtifact`, `retryDanglingRefs`, `ingestFolderTree`, `findByExactPath` (`kgProject.ts:46`), `ownerOfLink`, `removeProfile`, `createTreeView`, `removeTreeViewByName`, `findTreeViewByName`, `hasHolderDescendant`, `rejectSlugPathCollisions`, `resolveDeepPathDetail`. No command calls a `storeAccess` helper or touches an Oxigraph object; they reach the store only through `wrap` and these functions.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3YFA80R002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
