    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3YFA810003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Web** (`packages/web`)",
    "text": "**Web** (`packages/web`): no import of core or of the engine. It meets the code only through JSON: `tree` with `format: 'render-tree'` (`apiRoutes.ts:49`, mirrored by hand in `web/src/render.ts:2-8`), `backlinks` (`render.ts:73`), `show`, `unfold`/`fold`/`zoom`, `profileListView`, `update`. The one field of that JSON that the engine change can touch is a link's `predicate` (`render.ts:42`, `FolderDiv.tsx:534`). `web/devApiServer.ts` imports only `serviceClient` and `apiRoutes`, both engine-free.",
