    "title": "**Graph position**",
    "text": "**Graph position**: none in production. Every `store.match` passes `null` as the fourth argument (`storeAccess.ts:91`, `vocab.ts:69`) and `quad(s, p, o)` has no graph (`storeAccess.ts:243`). The only read of a graph is `q.graph.value` in `tests/support/roundtripChild.ts:15`.",
