    "title": "**`has`**",
    "text": "**`has`**: one use, `tests/store/storeAccess.test.ts:170`. **Oxigraph `load`/`dump`**: no use anywhere (the only `.load(` is `aperas.ts:98`, a dynamic import of a command); the code's own load and dump are `rehydrateStore` (`store.ts:120-148`, through `addQuad`) and `dehydrateToJsonLd`/`dehydrateStateToJsonLd` (`dehydrate.ts:100-143`). **`size`**: `store.ts:147` (`quadCount`), the service log lines at `service.ts:163,387`, and the tests above.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3YFA81000J",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3YFA81000N",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
