    ],
    "title": "00D3YFA81000R",
    "text": "**Order of ids of a kind** (`allSubjectIds`, first seen, `storeAccess.ts:199-206`, behind `allIdsOfKind`): the report order of `kgTrack.ts:82-110` (`neverProjected`, `changed`, `staleOnDisk`), of `kgProfile.ts:65,111` (profile and view lists), of `checkLinkIntegrity` (`linkIntegrity.ts:112`, so the `check-links` output and the `linkWarning` text of the service), and `buildLiveSlugPathIndex` (`node.ts:957-965`, \"first writer wins per name\": it decides which block the collision error names). Of the 21 production calls of `allIdsOfKind`, 13 drop the tombstoned ids afterwards ([a set of live ids](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000X)): `artifacts.ts:197-198` (4 callers), `folders.ts:20-21` (3), `node.ts:959,2172,2218`, `linkIntegrity.ts:112`, `kgTrack.ts:82,92`; 2 want only the dead (`node.ts:2180`, `kgTrack.ts:104`); 6 want all (`dehydrate.ts` ×3, `kgProfile.ts` ×2, `node.ts:2065`).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3YFA81000J",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
