    "title": "00D3YFXDC8003",
    "text": "No test file calls `runTree`, `runShow`, `runPath`, `runResolve`, `runProject`, `runTrack`, `runReverseTrack`, `runUnfold`, `runFold`, `runZoom`, `runRemove`, `runProfile*` or `runLinkCandidates`, and none imports `service.ts` or `serviceClient.ts`. The `run*` functions that a test calls are `runInsert` (3 files), `runUpdate` (5), `runRetype` (7), `runBacklinks` (5), `runAddBlockLink` (5), `runRemoveBlockLink` (3) and `runIngest` (1).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3YFXDC8002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3YFXDC8004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D3YFXDC8004",
    "text": "Rendering is covered only by `store/views.test.ts:46-48` (`renderTree` with a view) and `links/refusals.test.ts`; projection only by `folder/folders.test.ts:53,60` and `linking/anchors.test.ts:75-100`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3YFXDC8002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3YFXDC8005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D3YFXDC8005",
    "text": "So the reads of Batch 11's step 3 (most of it) and its step 8, the service, have no test group; with no test written before the move, the differential run of Verification Plan layer 4 is their only check.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3YFXDC8002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
