    "title": "Decided 2026-10-15 (the user)",
    "text": "Decided 2026-10-15 (the user): the missing tests are added as explicit steps of Batch 11 ([step 10](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3Z01YER001)) and not only as a clause of its Done when, one per group whose commands the survey found untested, each written before its group moves and run against the working engine, and named in [Layer 1](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQW6AG001) of the Verification Plan. They are written at the batch or batches that require them, not before: here, Batch 11, each before its group moves and none ahead of the batch. A proposal, not agreed: [which of them can be waived](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3Z01YER006) because the differential script already covers the command.",
