    "title": "00D3YFXDC800F",
    "text": "`positionsEqual` (`artifacts.ts:371-373`, used at `artifacts.ts:611`) compares the `position` list of a reused `Link`, read in match order, with the fresh ascending list, element by element. If the order differs, the `Link`'s `props` are rewritten and the `position` `StringProp`s change id without a change in content.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3YFXDC800E",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
