            "value": "334"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D3YFXDC800G",
    "text": "`buildRenderTree` collects `unfolds` in match order (`node.ts:1975-1987`) and `discoverCone` lets the first escaping link in that order claim the target (`node.ts:1530-1569`, the test `if (!zs.canonical.has(targetId))` at lines 1538 and 1560), so the place of a node reached through two unfolded links is the order's choice, which is [the canonical-render order check](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000Q) of the design.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3YFXDC800E",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
