    ],
    "title": "00D3YFXDC800H",
    "text": "`findByExactPath` (`tree.ts:20-21`) takes the first subject with the path, tombstoned or live, as in [the live-or-tombstoned issue](#id/BlockNode:00D22ZMTKG001). Its callers are `resolve.ts:69`, `resolveCreate.ts:98`, `kgProject.ts:46`, `linkIntegrity.ts:323` and 12 test and tool sites. The artifact side already filters (`findLiveByKindAndPath`, `artifacts.ts:188-191`); `kgProject.ts:46` and `linkIntegrity.ts:323` do not. The Coder did not reproduce a wrong pick.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3YFXDC800E",
