    "title": "Promoted to",
    "text": "Promoted to: the start timeout, as [a since-observed entry](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YH0QGR001) of [the start issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D0W05P08001); the `ingest` prompt, as [a since-observed entry](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YH1Y88000) of [the ingest-prompt issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CNX1T4XG001); the transient refusal, as [a since-observed entry](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YH8H08001) of [the spurious \"not running\" issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CVMPABY8001).",
