    "title": "**The survey of the callers**",
    "text": "**The survey of the callers**: the code above the engine is smaller at the store than the plan assumed (three production files use Oxigraph values, 30 more import only its `Store` type, and three tests and tools build a `Store`); its weight is in `node.ts` (about 690 lines of render, 610 of ingest and project, 350 of engine access). Five findings change a step: the manual `Link` predicate, tombstones that stay in `children`, the order of set fields, the tests that do not exist for groups 3 and 8, and the mirror the differential run can start from.",
