    "title": "00D3YS41VR003",
    "text": "In the files of `Apeiron/BlockNode.jsonld` (a clone, read 2026-10-15 with `jq`), 42 live `BlockNode`s have no `parent` key. No `FolderNode`, `ArtifactNode` or `BlockNode` lists any of them in its `children`, so none is reachable by containment from a live root.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3YS41VR002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3YS41VR004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D3YS41VR004",
    "text": "They are 8 headings, 29 list items and 5 paragraphs. Eight of them (six headings and the `**Work**` and `**Report**` list items) have children of their own, 3 to 7 each, and those children's `parent` points back at them; the other 34 have none. They include `## Workspace Split` (`BlockNode:00CDGTX55R001`), `## Dashboard` (`BlockNode:00CE1HNTYR001`), `## Dev environment setup` (`BlockNode:00CVJH53Q8001`), the skill-delta entries `v2.2` to `v2.11` (`BlockNode:00CR8VN7BG001` to `BlockNode:00CR8VR6ZR001`) and a thread's `**Work**` and `**Report**` (`BlockNode:00CR9S6080001`, `BlockNode:00CR9S6088000`).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3YS41VR002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3YS41VR005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D3YS41VR005",
    "text": "No `Link` targets any of the 42, no `TreeView` unfolds or roots at one, and no node other than the children of the eight refers to them. In the rest of the mirror, `parent` and `children` agree (0 disagreements, 0 repeated ids, 0 nodes in two containers).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3YS41VR002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3YS41VR006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D3YS41VR006",
    "text": "The full list is the live `BlockNode`s of `Apeiron/BlockNode.jsonld` without a `parent` key.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3YS41VR002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
