    "title": "Checked 2026-10-15 on a clone of the mirror (`Apeiron/`, `Apeiron/.state/`)",
    "text": "Checked 2026-10-15 on a clone of the mirror (`Apeiron/`, `Apeiron/.state/`): `ArtifactNode:00CR5AEJ88000` (`concepts.md`) is live and has no `parent`, and no `FolderNode` lists it in its `children`. The live nodes without a `parent` are 7 `ArtifactNode`s (this one and the six `README.md` artifacts), the root folder `FolderNode:00CDBYV47G000` and 42 `BlockNode`s that no container lists; the blocks are filed in [42 live `BlockNode`s have no `parent` and no container lists them](#id/BlockNode:00D3YS41VR001). What the migration of the mirror does with `concepts.md` is part of [an open point of Batch 9](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YSA5T8001).",
