    ],
    "title": "00D3YV43Q0003",
    "text": "[A field the shapes declare as `one`](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR00Y) is present on every document of its class, and 20 documents of the mirror (`Apeiron/`) lack one or more of them. All 16 `FolderNode`s lack `projectedHash`. Two of the 55 `ArtifactNode`s lack `fileHash`, `ingestedHash`, `lastIngestedAt`, `lastTrackedAt` and `projectedHash`: `ArtifactNode:00CF1TZQV8000` (`issues/cli.md`, a tombstoned holder) and `ArtifactNode:00CR5AEJ88000` (`concepts.md`, live and never tracked); the other 53 have all five. Two of the 9 `Profile`s lack `kind` (`default`, which holds only its `handle`, and `dinhlx`) and one lacks `name` (`default`).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3YV43Q0002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3YV43Q0004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D3YV43Q0004",
    "text": "`type` of an `ArtifactNode` is optional in the shapes, and 7 of the 55 have none; that is not a gap.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3YV43Q0002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3YV43Q0005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
