  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3Z1PHRR001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**When `APERAS_APEIRON_ROOT`, `APERAS_ARTIFACTS_ROOT` and `APERAS_GRAPH_NAME` are unset, a service of another checkout binds whatever `Aperas.dev/AperasKG` points at, which is the real graph**",
    "text": "**When `APERAS_APEIRON_ROOT`, `APERAS_ARTIFACTS_ROOT` and `APERAS_GRAPH_NAME` are unset, a service of another checkout binds whatever `Aperas.dev/AperasKG` points at, which is the real graph**: found 2026-10-15 in the isolated service trial of `Aperas.dev`'s `aperas`. Filed 2026-10-15.",
