        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D3Z1PHRR007:props:StringProp:00D3Z1Q020001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D3Z1PHRR007",
    "text": "(a) Drop the symlink, so that the unconfigured case finds no graph. A cloned mirror is then reached by the three variables, or by running `tsx packages/cli/src/aperas.ts` from the clone's directory, whose own `aperas.config.json` the walk finds.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3Z1PHRR006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3Z1PHRR008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D3Z1PHRR008",
    "text": "(b) Refuse to start without an explicit root.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3Z1PHRR006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D3Z1PHRR009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D3Z1PHRR009",
    "text": "(c) Keep the symlink and warn.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3Z1PHRR006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
