        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D417WKA8002",
    "text": "What the new engine's load does with a `children` entry whose id has no document: a ghost, an error or nothing. The Coder did not read it. The design says the load returns the ids that are referenced and never defined, and what the caller does with that list belongs to the service lifecycle ([the load computes `danglingRefs` and the service never reads it](#id/BlockNode:00D258W098001)). The differential run of [Batch 13, step 3](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W0013) carries a fixture for it.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D417WKA8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
