    "title": "**Whether `default` has a `name`**",
    "text": "**Whether `default` has a `name`**: settled (2026-10-16). `Profile:00CA03JXD8000` (`default`), the auto-generated fallback for everyone, lacks a `name` as it lacks a `kind` ([documents of the mirror lack fields that the design declares `one`](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YV43Q0001)). The decision on the profiles gives `dinhlx` its `kind: human` and leaves `default` without a `kind`, and `kind` is optional in the `Profile` shape; [`Profile.name` is optional too](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR00W), so `default` is a valid document without a `name`. The migrated mirror of step 6 holds `default` as it stands.",
