    "text": "**The cause of the one hang seen was the ghost folder**: the hang on a document, and the folder printed as `null`, came from [the ghost folder](#id/BlockNode:00D417WK80001), which the removal sweep of every `ingest` listed; with its filter in place the sweep no longer proposes it.",
