        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D457M2F8002:props:StringProp:00D457MGTR001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D457M2F8002",
    "text": "The trial's reading that the service burns CPU while idle does not stand: over four 60 s windows it used 0%, counted in ticks, which do not depend on the clock speed. The service has no timer that works while idle: of its three timers the 10 s flush and the 3 s flush return at once when nothing is dirty, and the third is the exit after 30 idle minutes.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D457M2F8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D457M2F8003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D457M2F8003:links:Link:00D457MGV0000",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00D457HDWG001",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D457M2F8003:links:Link:00D457MGV0000:props:StringProp:00D457MGV0001",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "164"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D457M2F8003",
    "text": "A write on the live service takes a few seconds at normal speed. What is still not measured: one write at full speed with its calibration beside it, by the rule of [Layer 7](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D457HDWG001) of the Verification Plan.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D457M2F8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
