    "text": "Promoted to [the ghost folder](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D417WK80001) and [the `ingest` prompt](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CNX1T4XG001), both resolved; to [the cost of a write](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D457M2F8001) and [the start wait](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D457N7XR001), which carry the clamp; to [the busy service that looks stopped](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D457SD1R001); and to [the rule that every timing carries its calibration](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D457HDWG001).",
