    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**The user's decision**",
    "text": "**The user's decision**: both: a grapher records the result in the plan, and the script moves into `Aperas.dev/monorepo` (a `scripts/` folder), so it outlives `~/scratch`.",
