    "text": "[One live artifact, `concepts.md`, has no `parent`](#id/BlockNode:00D3F6RJCG001) and [42 live `BlockNode`s have no `parent` and no container lists them](#id/BlockNode:00D3YS41VR001), the parentless documents of the census, which the migration of the mirror leaves as they stand ([settled in Batch 9](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YSA5T8002)); [the confirmation prompt of a corpus-wide `ingest`](#id/BlockNode:00CNX1T4XG001), the other prompt that proposes to remove nodes whose file is not on disk.",
