  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D4JZ5K00001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Fix the small defects of the migration scripts, 2026-10-16**",
    "text": "**Fix the small defects of the migration scripts, 2026-10-16**: the user said to fix them: `verify-migration.py` exits 0 even when it lists unexpected differences (it must exit non-zero), `migrate-mirror.py` raises `IndexError` when `--rules` is the last argument with no value (a usage error is wanted), the docstring of `load` in `migrate-mirror.py` says \"relative file name\" while the keys are absolute paths, and `verify-migration.py` has two bits of dead code (`if bw[i] != bw[i]: pass` and `len(kinds[c]) < 5 or True`). The scripts are in `Aperas.dev/monorepo/scripts/`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XJ7GTR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
