    "title": "**Start of implementation: Batches 3 onward, 2026-10-16**",
    "text": "**Start of implementation: Batches 3 onward, 2026-10-16**: the user said \"Let's start implementing the new core design\" and, asked which scope, chose \"Batches 3 onward\" over Batch 3 only or a survey only. The work follows the plan's [Order](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQM4X0002): ungated batches first, and a batch that an open point gates builds all it can and records the gated step as waiting. Batch 3 is ungated ([Gated by: nothing](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR004)). Each batch is its own task through the loop, with Step 7 verification before the next.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XJ7GTR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D4KSHCD8001",
