            "value": "51"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Batch 3 questions, 2026-10-16**",
    "text": "**Batch 3 questions, 2026-10-16**: asked the three [questions of the survey](../discussion/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4KKBTD8001), the user answered two: Batch 3 types a graph argument on reads and writes, with one default graph until Batch 8 adds creation and dropping; and Batch 3 types the creation, mark, graph and port operations that the design's interface list lacks, each later batch building its own (the design's interface list then needs a follow-up edit, not yet made). On the third, the location, the user chose to discuss: they asked what the current separation is between `src/apeironNgn` and `src`, and said that in general the engine should be `src/apeironNgn` itself, not a subdirectory `engine/` of it. The location is not settled: the separation is to be mapped first.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XJ7GTR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D4M417RG000",
