    "title": "Recorded in `design/core.md`",
    "text": "Recorded in `design/core.md`: [The boundary](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CJFB7G001) gains a sentence that the code follows the boundary in its folders, `monorepo/packages/core/src/apeironNgn/` the engine in memory and `monorepo/packages/core/src/shell/` the caller on disk, with the engine's directory importing nothing of the shell; [The shell](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4M7YEZG001), a new first item of The caller, on disk, states the same from the caller's side. Stale after the edit and left as it is, as asked: [Batch 3 step 1](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VG002) still proposes a directory `engine/` inside `src/apeironNgn/`.",
