    "title": "Build",
    "text": "Build: one operation that creates a node with a given id, kind and graph and sets its fields; a reference to a node not yet built is accepted. A `parent` that a build supplies is an assertion by the shell and never a stored pair: the parent of a node is read from the `children` that hold it.",
