    "title": "**E**",
    "text": "**E**: `storeAccess.ts`, its 13 helpers replaced by the interface of Batches 4 to 6 at [Batch 11 step 1](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000D); `shape.ts`, replaced by the shapes of [Batch 3 step 2](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VG003); in `vocab.ts`, the IRI and literal codec (`nodeIri`, `predIri`, `fieldFromPredIri`, `idFromNodeIri`, `encodeLiteral`, `decodeLiteral`, `isLiteralTerm`, `isNamedNodeTerm`, `freeWasm`, `PARENT_PRED`, `SIBLING_INDEX_PRED`), gone with Oxigraph, `nodeExists` (Batch 4 step 6), `ORDERED_CONTAINMENT_FIELD` and `SIBLING_INDEX_FIELD` (Batch 6 step 1) and `PARENT_FIELD` (Batch 6 step 3); in `node.ts`, the engine access behind the seam of Batch 11 step 2: `childrenOf`, `appendOrderedChild` and `insertOrderedChild` (Batch 6 step 1), `clearField`, `mintEmbedded` and `hardDeleteNode` (Batch 5), `removeDanglingUnfolds` (Batch 5 step 3), `backlinks` and `ownerOfLink` (Batch 5 steps 2 and 5) and `pruneUnreachableTombstones` ([Batch 7 step 3](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR017)); `allIdsOfKind` (Batch 4 step 4). The dump and the rehydrate of `dehydrate.ts` and `store.ts` are replaced by [Batch 9](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR01M) steps 1 to 3, whose new code is the shell's persistence and lands in `src/shell/`, as do the maps of [Batch 10](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W0004).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4N298W8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D4N298W8003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**S**",
    "text": "**S**: `threadScope.ts` (Batch 11 step 1; its test moves into persistence at Batch 9 step 2), `artifacts.ts` and `folders.ts` (step 5), `linkIntegrity.ts` (step 6), `resolve.ts`, `resolveCreate.ts` and `tree.ts` (step 3), and `getApeironExportDir`; in `node.ts`, the classes from `ApeironNode` to `TreeView` with `CLASS_BY_KIND`, `classForId`, `wrap` and the accessors (step 2), the render tree (step 3), `applyTombstone`, `tombstoneLiveSubtree`, `rejectSlugPathCollisions` and `findEnclosingArtifactId` (step 4), the ingest and project helpers (step 5), `pruneStaleUnfolds` and `tombstoneVacuousContainers` (step 7), and `findProfileByHandle` and `findTreeViewByName` over the maps of Batch 10 step 1.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4N298W8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D4N298W8004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**D**",
    "text": "**D**: `compareMigration.ts`, which diffs a TerminusDB command against an Ngn script, both gone, and which nothing imports; `index.ts`, which nothing imports.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4N298W8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D4N298W8005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D4N298W8005:links:Link:00D4N29PRR00A",
        "@type": "Link",
        "target": "BlockNode:00D4MJBY98001",
        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00D4N298W8005:links:Link:00D4N29PRR00A:props:StringProp:00D4N29PRR00B",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "419"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Not named by any step, as found**",
    "text": "**Not named by any step, as found**: the profile and view operations (`createTreeView`, `removeTreeViewByName`, `ensureDefaultView`, `resolveTreeView`, `removeProfile`, `TreeView.unfold` and `fold`, with `kgProfile`, `kgFold` and `kgZoom`), `runMigrateFrontmatter`, `lineReader.ts` (used only by `cli`), `compareMigration.ts` and `index.ts` (D but not in Batch 12), and the service directory `cli/src/apeironNgn/`. The [decisions on the survey](#id/BlockNode:00D4MJBY98001) place each of them.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4N298W8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D4N298W8006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**`src/` outside `apeironNgn/`**",
    "text": "**`src/` outside `apeironNgn/`**: its 12 files touch no store and import nothing of `apeironNgn/`: parsing, projection, reconciliation and props, addressing (`nodeRef.ts`), ids (`snowflake.ts`), configuration (`graphConfig.ts`, `identity.ts`) and the walk of the disk (`artifacts.ts`, `folders.ts`); no step of Batch 11 rewires them. The imports run one way: `apeironNgn/` imports `src/` in 7 of its 15 files; the only cycle, `tree.ts` with `node.ts`, is type-only.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4N298W8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D4N298WG000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**The seams**",
    "text": "**The seams**: the edges the new layout has to cut are `node.ts` to `dehydrate.ts`, for `allIdsOfKind`, which pulls persistence and, through `store.ts` and `graphConfig.ts`, `node:fs` into the engine's import closure, and `dehydrate.ts` to `store.ts`, for `getApeironExportDir` only. E code used by S code: inside `node.ts`, `nodeKindFromId` 17 times, `allIdsOfKind` 5, `nodeExists` 3, `subjectsWhere` 3 and `hardDeleteNode` 2; `artifacts.ts` uses `nodeExists` 6 times and `nodeKindFromId` 3, and `linkIntegrity.ts`, `folders.ts`, `resolve.ts`, `resolveCreate.ts`, `tree.ts` and `threadScope.ts` a few each; in `cli`, `service.ts` calls `pruneUnreachableTombstones` 4 times and twelve commands use `nodeKindFromId`, `nodeExists`, `allIdsOfKind` or `backlinks`. The widest seam is `wrap`, used by every S file (20 uses in `artifacts.ts`, 10 in `kgInsert`). 30 files import Oxigraph's `Store` only as a type, and 6 import its values.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4N298W8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D4N298WG001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**The cost of the move**",
    "text": "**The cost of the move**: moving all of `src/apeironNgn/` to `src/shell/` as it is rewrites 128 import statements in 41 `cli` files, 12 specifiers from `@aperas/core/apeironNgn/` to `@aperas/core/shell/`, and nothing else the build reads: not the `exports` map (`\"./*\": \"./src/*.ts\"`), the `tsconfig` files, the suites or `.archive/`; `web` imports no `core` path. In the scratch copy the type checks of `core`, `cli` and `web`, the bundle, `commit` (70 of 70) and `essential` (27 of 27) stayed green. `graphConfig.ts:124` tests for a directory `apeironNgn` to tell a dev checkout, with no effect, since both branches compute the same root.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4N298W8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D4N298WG002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Recorded in `design/core.md`**",
    "text": "**Recorded in `design/core.md`**: items (1) to (5) of the batch, in one pass; item (6), the plan, is left for a turn of its own.",
