    "title": "**(1) The generic engine**",
    "text": "**(1) The generic engine**: a new [meta-model](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4MYZ6Q0000) heads the data model: the engine names no class or field, and the shell passes it a schema at construction, closed for the engine's life, written in the meta-model (kinds and inheritance, storage kinds, cardinalities, reference and embed fields with the names of their reverse sides, ordered and partitioning fields, containment). [One schema, handed in at construction](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR008) replaces \"One schema, the class\". [Fields per class](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR00M) moved, keeping its id, under a new heading [The Aperas schema](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4MZ15AR001) in the shell's part. Restated as roles of the schema, each with the Aperas name kept as an example in brackets: [Closed vocabulary](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR00E), [Cardinalities](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR00G), [Ports, the two ends of a pair](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CJCK10001), [Containment](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR00Z), [Where a node's parent comes from](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2562RC8001), [Records by kind and by graph](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR018), [Embedded nodes have ids and are removed outright](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR013), [Captured port views](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2T5Z6J0001), [A removed node leaves its container](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000R), [Where an order shows](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01E) and the read of an ordered field in the interface.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4N298WG002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
