    "title": "**Left as they were, since the design gives no role for them**",
    "text": "**Left as they were, since the design gives no role for them**: the `unfolds` entries removed with a node (in Embedded nodes), the field `tombstonedAt` and the subtree that a removed artifact tombstones ([Tombstones](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01V)), the roots of [the sweep](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CHJXK8001), the mark of a partitioning field set by the shell at run time ([A partition hierarchy](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2T5XBH0001)), and three blocks with no rule of the engine in them: [The artifact is its own root document](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR010), [Links are outgoing ports](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR011) and [Ids are stable](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01Q). Each is a question to the user.",
