    "title": "**(4) Ids**",
    "text": "**(4) Ids**: [Ids](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01N) makes the grammar the engine's and the minting the shell's, the engine checking the grammar and the uniqueness of each id and keeping the bare id with no IRI or term encoding; `aperas://id/` and the id is the canonical address, owned by the shell's addressing, citing [node-ID addressing](../design/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CDBYV4T800B). `design/linking.md` needed no edit: it gives `aperas://id/<ID>` as node-ID addressing in its in-app context and never calls it the engine's.",
