    "title": "**The roles it assigns**",
    "text": "**The roles it assigns**: containment to `children`, ordered and partitioning, whose reverse side is named `parent` (see [Containment](#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR00Z)); the tombstone marker to `tombstonedAt` (see [Tombstones](#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01V)); the drop of a value with its target to `unfolds` (see [Embedded nodes have ids and are removed outright](#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR013)); and, for [the sweep](#id/BlockNode:00D3CHJXK8001), the root kinds `ArtifactNode` and `FolderNode` and the fields `children`, `links` and the `target` of a `Link`.",
