    "title": "### Batch 15 — done: the current code moved to `src/shell/`",
    "text": "No change of behaviour apart from the removal of the `aperas migrate-frontmatter` verb: the code of `monorepo/packages/core/src/apeironNgn/`, the Oxigraph engine and the code that calls it together, moves as it is to `monorepo/packages/core/src/shell/`, so that the directory is free for the engine of Batch 3 ([the boundary](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CJFB7G001)). It comes first, before Batch 3. The old engine's files move with the rest, with no `legacy/` directory, and are deleted as Batches 11 and 12 replace them.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XP4XK0001",
    "type": "heading",
