    "title": "**1. The move**",
    "text": "**1. The move**: every file of `src/apeironNgn/` moves to `src/shell/`, and the 128 import statements in 41 files of `cli` change their 12 specifiers from `@aperas/core/apeironNgn/` to `@aperas/core/shell/`. Nothing else that the build reads changes: not the `exports` map (`\"./*\": \"./src/*.ts\"`), the `tsconfig` files, the suites or `.archive/`; `web` imports no path of `core`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4NBFKAG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
