      }
    ],
    "title": "**2. The deletions**",
    "text": "**2. The deletions**: `compareMigration.ts`, which compares a TerminusDB command with an Ngn script, both gone, and `index.ts` are deleted, since nothing imports them; `runMigrateFrontmatter`, the one-time migration of `aperas migrate-frontmatter`, is deleted.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4NBFKAG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
