    "text": "**The code differs from the boundary: `src/apeironNgn/` holds the old engine and the code that calls it together, and there is no `src/shell/`**: found 2026-10-16, when [the boundary](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CJFB7G001) was mapped to the folders of `src`, and measured by the Coder's survey of the dependencies of `monorepo/packages/core/src/` in `Aperas.dev` at `4062128`. Filed 2026-10-16.",
