    "title": "00D4NBNCF8003",
    "text": "The design places the engine, in memory, in `monorepo/packages/core/src/apeironNgn/` and the shell, on disk, in `monorepo/packages/core/src/shell/`, and the engine's directory imports nothing of the shell, no file system and no store library ([the shell](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4M7YEZG001)). In the code, `src/apeironNgn/` holds the Oxigraph engine and the code that calls it together (the node classes and `wrap`, ingest and projection, the dump and the load, resolve, link integrity and the sweeps), and there is no `src/shell/`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4NBNCF8002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D4NBNCF8004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "The directory's own imports cross the boundary",
    "text": "The directory's own imports cross the boundary: `node.ts` imports `dehydrate.ts` for `allIdsOfKind`, which pulls persistence into the engine's import closure and, through `store.ts` and `graphConfig.ts`, `node:fs`; 30 of its files import Oxigraph's `Store` as a type, and 6 import its values.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4NBNCF8002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
