    "title": "**11. Profiles and views**",
    "text": "**11. Profiles and views**: the profile and view operations (`createTreeView`, `removeTreeViewByName`, `ensureDefaultView`, `resolveTreeView`, `removeProfile`, and the `fold` and `unfold` of `TreeView`, with the commands `kgProfile`, `kgFold` and `kgZoom`) stay in the shell and read and write through the engine, the views being nodes of the graph `treeviews`, with `findProfileByHandle` and `findTreeViewByName` over the maps of [Batch 10 step 1](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W0005). Their tests are those of [step 10](#id/BlockNode:00D3Z01YER001) for `runProfile*`, `runFold` and `runZoom`.",
