    "title": "**The test cases, kept, decided 2026-10-16 (the user)**",
    "text": "**The test cases, kept, decided 2026-10-16 (the user)**: the 42 live blocks of [42 live `BlockNode`s have no `parent` and no container lists them](#id/BlockNode:00D3YS41VR001) and the artifact of [one live artifact, `concepts.md`, has no `parent`](#id/BlockNode:00D3F6RJCG001), none of them reachable by containment, are left as they stand by the migration of the mirror ([Batch 9](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YSA5T8002)), so that they test the resolution of this issue in the new engine. A resolution that collects unreachable nodes would collect all 43, `concepts.md` included; nothing uses `concepts.md` now, and it is kept for the test.",
