    "title": "**The change**",
    "text": "**The change**: `core/src/apeironNgn/` renamed `core/src/shell/` by `git mv`, with the 12 import specifiers of `@aperas/core/apeironNgn/` rewritten in 42 files; `cli/src/apeironNgn/` renamed `cli/src/service/`; `lineReader.ts` moved from `core` to `cli`; `compareMigration.ts` and `index.ts` deleted, since nothing imported them; `graphConfig.ts` tells a dev checkout by `import.meta.url.endsWith('.ts')` in place of a test for a directory named `apeironNgn`, with the same root either way. In all, 83 files: 22 renames, 3 deletions and 58 files edited.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4P4T3NR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
