    "text": "**Recorded in `planning/core.md`, `issues/core.md` and `history/core.md`**: [Batch 15](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4NBFKAG001) is retitled done and moved to the plan's Archive, with [its done record](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4P2C87R001) (the steps as carried out, the Done when checked, the two path changes beyond the steps, and what is left as it is); the [Numbering](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQM4X0001) and the leads of the plan and of the Task Breakdown say it is done. [The code differs from the boundary](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4NBNCF8001) is resolved and moved to Resolved, and the Related line of [the thread-scope issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2590B2R001) says that `threadScope.ts` moved and the issue stays open until Batch 9. The history has [a milestone](../history/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4P4T3NR001) and an updated [Current Status](../history/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D21FP4Z8004). The two path changes beyond the steps (`web/devApiServer.ts` and the process match of `svc_sampler.py`) are recorded in the done record and the milestone and filed as no issue: both follow from the rename, and the sampler of each checkout finds that checkout's service.",
