    "text": "**Recorded in `planning/core.md` and `issues/core.md`**: the open point is [settled in Batch 9](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YSA5T8002) and moved under step 6, whose text, [Gated by](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W0002) and [Layer 3](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQW6AR001) no longer name it as open, and whose [Done when](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W0003) says the 43 stand as they were; the [Open points](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YSA5T8001) of Batch 9 now hold only whether `default` has a `name`. On the issues: [garbage collection never collects an unreachable block that was never tombstoned](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4P4J3KR001) keeps the 43 as its test cases, and the Fix directions of [the 42 blocks](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YS41VR008) and of [`concepts.md`](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3F6RJCG006) record the decision; both issues stay open.",
