    "title": "**The coder's three questions, decided**",
    "text": "**The coder's three questions, decided**: the user agreed with the orchestrator: the coder and orchestrator skills get no move recipe (neither role moves graph nodes), only the v4.7 Status line; the new section of `references/mechanics.md` stays, at v4.7, the skill release it ships with; and the in-place promote (`aperas insert <path>` with no body and no anchor), which reads standard input by the same code path, gets `< /dev/null` wherever a promote recipe appears.",
