    "title": "### aperas — Quick Syntax & Command Reference, the move row",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v4.2 Quick Syntax table](#id/BlockNode:00CV3K19P0004)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4PMGJJR001",
    "type": "heading",
