  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D4PMGJJR00D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D4PMGJJR00D",
    "text": "```bash\naperas unfold <ref> [--view <name>]                          # Peek node or unfold into view\naperas tree --view <name>                                    # Render structured lens of view\ncat turn.md | aperas insert <turn-id> --after <ask> --flush  # Insert Work + Report tree\naperas zoom <id> --view <name> --flush                       # Re-root view onto Ask/Report\necho \"text\" | aperas update <id> --text-only --flush         # Update node (preserves kids)\necho \"- text\" | aperas insert <par> --after <sib> --flush    # Insert list item (needs bullet)\naperas insert <id> --after <sib> --flush < /dev/null         # Move node (a move reads stdin to its end; a harness can leave it open)\naperas check-links [--repair]                                # Sweep / repair link integrity\n```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4PMGJJR00C",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
