    "title": "**v4.7 recorded, and its loose ends**",
    "text": "**v4.7 recorded, and its loose ends**: the grapher recorded the v4.7 delta; the orchestrator checked that `skill_drift.py` exits 0 and `aperas check-links` is clean. On the grapher's three questions the orchestrator decided, as part of the stopgap the user approved and before the user's commit: the coder adds the new section to the Table of Contents of `references/mechanics.md` inside v4.7; the grapher retitles the issue in place now (the skill half is done, the code half stays open) and writes the v4.7 history entry and the Dashboard now, as the finishing turn of this small task.",
