    "title": "**Go for Batch 3 onward, 2026-10-16**",
    "text": "**Go for Batch 3 onward, 2026-10-16**: the user committed the work so far (`AperasKG` `3e802eb` and the v4.7 record, `Aperas/` `e50e1e6`, `Aperas.dev` `b3c8d64` on `js-apeironngn`, rebased on `oxigraph`) and said: start from Batch 3 on and keep going until a blocking issue. Each batch runs through the loop: the grapher surveys it against the reworked design and plan, the coder implements it in `Aperas.dev`, the orchestrator verifies (diff, `npm run verify`), the grapher files the result; the work stops and goes to the user at a decision the Freeflow does not hold, a step an open point gates beyond what the batch records as waiting, or a failure that does not clear.",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D4PTTPXG001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Go for Batch 3 onward, 2026-10-16**",
    "text": "**Go for Batch 3 onward, 2026-10-16**: the user committed the work so far (`AperasKG` `3e802eb` and the v4.7 record, `Aperas/` `e50e1e6`, `Aperas.dev` `b3c8d64` on `js-apeironngn`, rebased on `oxigraph`) and said: start from Batch 3 on and keep going until a blocking issue. Each batch runs through the loop: the grapher surveys it against the reworked design and plan, the coder implements it in `Aperas.dev`, the orchestrator verifies (diff, `npm run verify`), the grapher files the result; the work stops and goes to the user at a decision the Freeflow does not hold, a step an open point gates beyond what the batch records as waiting, or a failure that does not clear.",
