    "@id": "BlockNode:00D4PXQJSR001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Stop rule narrowed, 2026-10-16**",
    "text": "**Stop rule narrowed, 2026-10-16**: the user said that for things the orchestrator can decide, it decides and goes on, and stops only on issues or decisions related to the design. So the questions of the subagents that are not about the design (wording, the ordering of a file, where a helper goes, whether to fix a stale comment, which tool workaround) are answered by the orchestrator in the next Ask and recorded in the Freeflow; a question about the design (a rule of the engine or the shell, the schema, an open point, the plan's scope) goes to the user.",
