    "title": "**The five answers applied, and two follow-ups decided, 2026-10-16**",
    "text": "**The five answers applied, and two follow-ups decided, 2026-10-16**: the grapher applied [the five answers](#id/BlockNode:00D4Q597Z8001) (design 9 nodes, plan 3 steps updated and 3 lines inserted; `check-links` clean). The orchestrator decided its two follow-ups as consequences of the answers: with `Profile.name` optional, the Batch 9 open point on `default`'s `name` is closed and the issue's matching sentence updated; and because the reverse of `children` is built in Batch 6, Batch 6 gets one line saying the read-out lists `parent` from there (until then a read-out omits it). The coder starts Batch 3 from the grapher's brief ([Turn 6](#id/BlockNode:00D4PZETT0001) and the Turn 7 changes), in `Aperas.dev`.",
