    "title": "**Done, 2026-10-16**",
    "text": "**Done, 2026-10-16**: in `Aperas.dev/monorepo` on branch `js-apeironngn`, staged and not committed. Step 1: `packages/cli/src/tests/engine/boundary.test.ts` (in `essential`) reads every file of `core/src/apeironNgn/` with the TypeScript parser and keeps only the relative imports that stay inside the directory, as [the boundary](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CJFB7G001) says. Step 2: `core/src/apeironNgn/schema.ts` (the types and `closeSchema`), `core/src/shell/aperasSchema.ts` (`APERAS_SCHEMA`) and `cli/src/tests/support/engineSchema.ts` (`TEST_SCHEMA`), with the tests `schema.test.ts` (40 refused variants) and `aperasSchema.test.ts` (the field order equal to [Format](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01Z), the cardinalities, the optional fields, the five roles, `parent` the reverse name of `children`). Step 3: `core/src/apeironNgn/interface.ts` and `engine.ts`, the 29 operations typed and all throwing `NotBuiltError` with the name of their batch. Step 4: `cli/src/tests/support/oracle.ts` with `tests/engine/oracle.test.ts` (25 cases, in `commit`). Step 5: the group `tests/engine/` and its entries in `essential.suite.mjs` and `commit.suite.mjs`.",
