    "title": "**Closed, in part**",
    "text": "**Closed, in part**: the first part of [the store is read outside the helpers](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2536E1R001) (the engine has one seam, held by the boundary test) and the `type` shape part of [artifacts without a `type`](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D253D680001) (the Aperas schema declares the `type` of an `ArtifactNode` optional). The rest of each stays open on its issue.",
