    "title": "**The sweep has no operation**",
    "text": "**The sweep has no operation**: [the interface](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T0003) lists no sweep among its Writes, while [Batch 7 step 3](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR017) builds one and the schema holds its roots and followed fields. None is typed and the oracle has none. Open: whether it is an operation of the engine that the interface gains in Batch 7, and the design's list with it, or the service's to compose from reads. Built (2026-10-17): the sweep is an operation of the engine. [Batch 7](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR014) typed `sweep(graph): Id[]` in the interface and built it in the engine and the oracle, and the design's list of the interface's writes has it.",
