    "title": "2026-10-16, [Batch 3](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VG001) in `Aperas.dev`",
    "text": "2026-10-16, [Batch 3](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VG001) in `Aperas.dev`: the engine's module, its meta-model and its interface, with no behaviour yet, staged on branch `js-apeironngn` and not committed. It closes the first part of [the store is read outside the helpers](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2536E1R001) and the `type` shape part of [artifacts without a `type`](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D253D680001); the rest of each stays open.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D21FP4Z8005",
    "type": "listItem",
