    "title": "**The change**",
    "text": "**The change**: in `core/src/apeironNgn/`, the types and the closing check of the schema (`schema.ts`), the interface of 29 operations as types (`interface.ts`) and `createEngine` (`engine.ts`), which closes the schema it is given and whose every other operation throws `NotBuiltError` with the name of the batch that builds it; in `core/src/shell/`, the Aperas schema written in the meta-model (`aperasSchema.ts`). In `cli/src/tests/`, the group `engine` (`boundary`, `schema`, `aperasSchema` and `oracle`), the test schema `engineSchema.ts` and the naive oracle `oracle.ts` in `support/`, named in the `essential` and `commit` suites.",
