    "title": "**Since (2026-10-16), the first part closed, the rest not resolved**",
    "text": "**Since (2026-10-16), the first part closed, the rest not resolved**: [Batch 3](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VG001) gave the new engine one seam: `core/src/apeironNgn/` imports only files of its own directory, held by `boundary.test.ts` in the `essential` suite, so the engine reads and writes nothing outside its own interface. This closes the first part, for the new engine. The old engine under `core/src/shell/`, with its direct reads of the store (`nodeExists`, the size, the dev tools and tests), is unchanged and closes in [Batches 11 and 12](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C), which move the layers above and delete it. This entry stays open until then.",
