    "title": "**Batch 4: the grapher's four questions, decided 2026-10-16** (the [brief](#id/BlockNode:00D4QPBD08008))",
    "text": "**Batch 4: the grapher's four questions, decided 2026-10-16** (the [brief](#id/BlockNode:00D4QPBD08008)): by the [narrowed stop rule](#id/BlockNode:00D4PXQJSR001) the orchestrator decided, as none is about the design: (1) Enforcement and a write to an absent subject (`addPair`, `clearField`, `removeNode`) are added to Batch 4's Gated by, since the Batch 3 oracle already throws `Undecided('Enforcement')` and `Undecided('Existence')` there: one function where the check will sit, throwing `Undecided`, the plan's pattern for Batch 5; (2) Batch 4 builds literal fields only, and a reference, embed, ordered or derived field throws `NotBuiltError` naming Batch 5 or 6; (3) `removeNode` stays Batch 5's, as the plan has it (Batch 5 step 3), so the deletion half of Batch 4 step 4 waits; (4) `createNode` checks the schema-free grammar of the id and refuses a kind not in the schema or not matching the id's kind, and accepts an embedded-shaped id whether or not its owner exists.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XJ7GTR001",
    "type": "listItem",
