    "text": "**Recorded as waiting**: step 6, `exists` and `size`, throw `Undecided('Existence')`, not `NotBuiltError`, and `WAITING_ON` in `engine.ts` says so, while `BUILT_BY` still names Batch 4 for them; the deletion half of step 4 waits with `removeNode` in [Batch 5](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR00H) step 3, as decided; [Enforcement](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000M) is one function, `inShape`, and an absent subject for a write ([Existence](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000K)) is one function, `existence`, each throwing `Undecided` as the oracle does; a pair in which exactly one key is absent, in `compareByKey`, throws `Undecided('The order of links without a position')`. The id-like string at load stays [Batch 9](#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR01M)'s. `build` still throws `NotBuiltError` naming Batch 5; `record` and `idsOfKind` are the engine side of the read-out of Persistence.",
