    "text": "**Closed, in part**: four issues, each with a dated \"Since\" entry and none moved to Resolved. [The kind of an id and an id-like string](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2534RSG001): the reading of the kind of an id (`isId`, `kindOfId`) is closed; the id-like string at load closes in Batch 9. [The scans that list the ids of a kind](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D0W02KPG001): the collections behind `idsOfKind` are built; the measurement is Batch 13. [`dehydrate`'s `localeCompare`](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D39EY5B0001): the comparison `compareIds` is built; the dump closes it in Batch 9. [The order of a block's links](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8001): the engine's side (`compareByKey`) is built; the display closes in Batch 11.",
