    "title": "**Since (2026-10-16), the engine's side of the order built, the display not resolved**",
    "text": "**Since (2026-10-16), the engine's side of the order built, the display not resolved**: [Batch 4](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR006) built `compareByKey(key)` (`core/src/apeironNgn/order.ts`), which orders by a key and breaks a tie by id, so that the links of a block sort by `position`. A pair in which exactly one key is absent throws `Undecided('The order of links without a position')`, pending the open point on [the order of links without a position](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000P). The tree view of the old engine still lists the links newest first; the display closes in [Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C). This entry stays open until then.",
