    "title": "**A path that cannot be derived**",
    "text": "**A path that cannot be derived**: the shell refuses to give the path of a node whose parent chain does not reach the root folder. Ingest and project throw \"path undeterminable: no parent\" when they are asked for it, and the load warns once, listing every such node. `concepts.md`, the one artifact at the root with no parent, is such a case, and it is kept as a test of the refusal (see [Deriving the path](#id/BlockNode:00D25698B0001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3CHMYQG004",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D4R9WX7R001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
