    "title": "Remove a pair, `removePair(graph, subject, field, value)`",
    "text": "Remove a pair, `removePair(graph, subject, field, value)`: it removes the pair and, on an embed field, the embedded node the pair names, recursively (see [Embedded nodes have ids and are removed outright](#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR013)). A write of an embed field that keeps some of its values is `removePair` for the values it drops and `addPair` for the new ones.",
