    "title": "**Batch 5: the grapher's three questions, decided 2026-10-16** (the [brief](#id/BlockNode:00D4RGBDGG005))",
    "text": "**Batch 5: the grapher's three questions, decided 2026-10-16** (the [brief](#id/BlockNode:00D4RGBDGG005)): by the [narrowed stop rule](#id/BlockNode:00D4PXQJSR001) the orchestrator decided, as none is about the design: (1) the reverse side of a node with no record is held in a holder keyed by id; (2) `addPair` accepts any string as the value of a reference field and, for an embed field, an id whose owner, field and kind match; (3) `removeNode` on an embedded node keeps the behaviour of the oracle. Existence, which every write of the batch reaches, joins Batch 5's Gated by as it did Batch 4's (one function where the check will sit, throwing `Undecided`); the grapher records it when filing.",
