    "title": "### Batch 16 — the path derived",
    "text": "The engine's batches keep the stored `path` of an artifact and a folder, and this batch removes it, last in the order, after the engine is in place. The design keeps the derived path as the target and states the stored `path` as transitional ([Deriving the path](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D25698B0001)). The batch is recorded here with the count of the readers of the stored `path`; the five holes of the removal are its open points, undecided, and the batch is not built until the user decides on them.",
