    "title": "**The Done when, checked**",
    "text": "**The Done when, checked**: the Coder's run: `tsc` of `core` and `cli` clean, group `engine` 376 of 376, `essential` 51 of 51, `commit` 446 of 446 in 24.4 s. The orchestrator's run: `commit` 446 of 446 in 24 s, `--suite essential` 51 of 51 in 3.2 s (budget 5 s), `--group engine` 376 of 376; the files of the engine's directory import only files of their own directory. The Coder saw `essential` take 5.5 to 7.1 s and warn, in files this batch does not touch, under a load of 5 to 7.5; it took 3.7 s when the load fell, and the batch adds no file to it.",
