    "title": "**Closed, in part**",
    "text": "**Closed, in part**: two issues, each with a dated \"Since\" entry and none moved to Resolved. [`ownerOfLink` takes the first node whose `links` names a link](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2593220001): the owner of a link or an embedded node is read from its id in the engine; the shell's use of it is Batch 11. [The scans that list the ids of a kind](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D0W02KPG001): the reverse reads (`subjectsOf`, `firstSubjectOf`, `countSubjectsOf`) are built over sets; the measurement is Batch 13. [Enforcement](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000M) keeps [`encodeDoc` and `mintEmbedded` write any key as a predicate](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZWZMR001) open.",
