    "title": "2026-10-16, [Batch 5](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR00H) in `Aperas.dev`",
    "text": "2026-10-16, [Batch 5](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR00H) in `Aperas.dev`: the reference and embed fields of the engine, with the reverse side built on first use, the removal of a node and the build of Persistence, staged on branch `js-apeironngn` and not committed. It closes in part two issues, each of which stays open for its rest: [`ownerOfLink` takes the first node whose `links` names a link](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2593220001) and [the scans that list the ids of a kind](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D0W02KPG001).",
