    "title": "**Since (2026-10-16), the reverse reads built, the measurement not done**",
    "text": "**Since (2026-10-16), the reverse reads built, the measurement not done**: [Batch 5](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR00H) built in the new engine the reverse of a field, built on first use and held as a set on the record of each object, with `subjectsOf`, `firstSubjectOf` and `countSubjectsOf` reading it with no scan of the store (`core/src/apeironNgn/engine.ts`, `records.ts`); the model-based test `relations.model` holds it equal to the inverse of the forward side after every operation. That the scans no longer cost what the issue measures is shown in [Batch 13](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W0010), which compares the engine with the `free()` version on the real mirror; the old engine under `core/src/shell/` is unchanged. This entry stays open until then.",
