    "title": "**Batch 5 filed, the grapher's two questions, 2026-10-16**",
    "text": "**Batch 5 filed, the grapher's two questions, 2026-10-16**: the grapher filed Batch 5 ([the Report](#id/BlockNode:00D4RTZKK8001) is the check). Decided by the orchestrator: (1) the case of a node that has incoming pairs and no record, which Existence decides nothing about yet, is added to the Existence open point as a case, undecided, so that the design holds it (the grapher had put it in the Dashboard and the Done record only); (2) the two reproductions of Batch 5's Done when exist in the engine's tests (`removal.test.ts`: the dangling-`unfolds` case, in a test named for it at line 42, and the embedded removal), as the orchestrator found by reading the tests, and the grapher's Done record says so.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XJ7GTR001",
    "type": "listItem",
