  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D4RZG16R001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**The two reproductions of the Done when**",
    "text": "**The two reproductions of the Done when**: the dangling-`unfolds` reproduction and the embedded-removal reproduction are in the engine's `removal.test.ts` (`cli/src/tests/engine/`): the first as the test of `removeNode` named for the dangling-`unfolds` case (a node removed is dropped from the field dropped with its target and the other values stay), the second as the test of the embedded nodes named for the oracle's case (an embedded node removed with its pair takes its own embedded nodes and its pairs with it, and its sibling stays). Both pass on the engine in `commit`.",
