    "title": "**Closed, in whole**",
    "text": "**Closed, in whole**: [sibling indexes are not kept dense](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D252Y7WR001) (the engine keeps no index: the place is read from the host's list) and [a child can end with two `parent` pairs](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2532JJR001) (the engine refuses the second container and derives `parent` from the reverse of `children`), each moved to Resolved with a dated entry. The reference copy under `core/src/shell/` keeps both behaviours until [Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C) moves the shell onto the engine and [Batch 12](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000S) deletes it.",
