    "title": "2026-10-16, [Batch 6](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR00V) in `Aperas.dev`",
    "text": "2026-10-16, [Batch 6](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR00V) in `Aperas.dev`: the ordered fields of the engine, the partitioning mark, containment with the parent derived from the reverse of `children`, and the tree of the records, staged on branch `js-apeironngn` and not committed. It resolves two issues: [sibling indexes are not kept dense](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D252Y7WR001) and [a child can end with two `parent` pairs](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2532JJR001).",
