    "title": "**The change**",
    "text": "**The change**: in `core/src/apeironNgn/`, `engine.ts` gaining `items`, `placeOf`, `insertItem`, `moveItem` and `removeItem` for an ordered field, the refusal of a partitioning field (a second subject on the climbed side, a cycle), the read of a derived entry (`up`) from the reverse of `children`, and the placing of each record in the tree; `records.ts` gaining the tree (`under`, `beneath`, the roots of each graph). In `cli/src/tests/engine/`, the tests `ordered`, `partitioning`, `containment` and `containment.model`, named in the `commit` suite and none in `essential`; the tests that named Batch 6 were rewritten to what is built.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4SM9PD0001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
