    "title": "**The model-based test**",
    "text": "**The model-based test**: `containment.model` runs 20 seeds of 250 operations and holds the engine equal to the oracle after every operation, with the checks independent of the oracle: a single container for each node, no cycle, `up` equal to the host whose list holds the node, the place equal to the index, and the tree equal to a scan of the lists and the embed fields.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4SM9PD0001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
