    "text": "**The two reproductions**: each was run on the reference copy of the shell and failed there (`P children = A@0 D@2 C@2`; two `parent` pairs on the child), and each is now a test of `containment.test.ts` that passes on the engine. The reference copy keeps both behaviours until it is deleted.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4SM9PD0001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
