    "title": "**`insertItem` into an ordered embed field accepts any string, so one embedded node could be listed by two owners**",
    "text": "**`insertItem` into an ordered embed field accepts any string, so one embedded node could be listed by two owners**: found 2026-10-16 by the Coder in the work of [Batch 6](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR00V) and read from the code by the grapher; neither tested nor changed. Filed 2026-10-16.",
