    "title": "00D4SRT8KR00A",
    "text": "Two, none chosen. (a) `insertItem` passes the host to the shape check, so the rule for the value of an embed field applies to the splice as it does to `addPair`; it waits on [Enforcement](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000M) for the `Undecided` half. (b) The schema check refuses an ordered embed field for as long as no schema needs one; the design does not say whether embedded nodes can be ordered.",
