    "title": "No batch of [the plan](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF23FB1G003) closes it yet. Decided 2026-10-16",
    "text": "No batch of [the plan](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF23FB1G003) closes it yet. Decided 2026-10-16: it is closed by a later batch or by the schema check, whichever comes first, and the first schema that declares an ordered embed field must close it before it does. It does not gate [Batch 7](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR014). Closed 2026-10-17 by the follow-up of [Batch 8](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR01D), which passed the host to the shape check of `insertItem` (fix direction (a)); see the Resolved entry.",
