    "title": "00D4SRT8KR00E",
    "text": "[Gaps seen, not decided](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4SKPNR8008) in the done record of Batch 6; [Embedded nodes have ids and are removed outright](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR013) and [Enforcement](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000M) in the design; [a node both embedded and listed](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR00Z), the open point of the same corner, settled on 2026-10-17 in the design where the link points.",
