    ],
    "title": "**The oracle and the engine read the buckets of a reverse side across graphs, so a rule that names a graph cannot be told from one that does not until a second graph exists**",
    "text": "**The oracle and the engine read the buckets of a reverse side across graphs, so a rule that names a graph cannot be told from one that does not until a second graph exists**: found 2026-10-16 by the Coder in the work of [Batch 6](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR00V) and read from the code by the grapher; neither tested nor changed. Filed 2026-10-16.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CF1WZ4JG00J",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D4SRWNPR002",
      "BlockNode:00D4SRWNQ0001",
