      }
    ],
    "title": "00D4SRWNQ0004",
    "text": "None chosen. [Batch 8](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR01D) builds the graphs and has to decide, for each of the reads and rules above, whether it is filtered to the named graph or not, and make the oracle and the engine say the same, with a test that has a subject in each of two graphs.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D4SRWNQ0003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
