    "text": "Promoted to [`insertItem` into an ordered embed field accepts any string](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4SRT8KR001) and [the buckets of a reverse side are read across graphs](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4SRWNPR001), filed 2026-10-16, each pointing at the done record of Batch 6.",
