    "title": "**The engine lets a plain write set or clear the tombstone marker and write to a tombstone, so a tombstone can be listed again, given references again, or made live with no operation that says so**",
    "text": "**The engine lets a plain write set or clear the tombstone marker and write to a tombstone, so a tombstone can be listed again, given references again, or made live with no operation that says so**: found 2026-10-16 by the grapher in the survey of [Batch 7](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR014), decided to go on by the orchestrator the same day (the generic writes stay allowed for now), built and tested by the Coder, and confirmed in the Coder's work of 2026-10-17. Filed 2026-10-17.",
