    "title": "00D4T7JDAR006",
    "text": "A tombstone is a record with the marker set and nothing more: the marker is an ordinary literal field of the kinds that declare it, and the generic reads and writes do not look at it. [Enforcement](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000M) is the open point that would decide what a write may do with the marker or on a tombstone.",
