    "title": "00D4T7JDAR00A",
    "text": "Listed, none chosen. (a) Enforcement refuses a generic write of the marker and every write to a node whose marker is set, except the engine's own operations and `build`; this settles what a tombstone may hold and needs the open point decided. (b) A revive operation is the one way back, and (a) refuses the rest; this closes [the missing revive operation](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CN1PT1B0001) with it. (c) The writes stay open, and the sweep is what collects a tombstone that is written to and left unreached.",
