    "title": "00D4T7JDAR00E",
    "text": "[Batch 7, done](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR014); [Tombstones](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01V) and [Enforcement](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000M) in the design; [no revive operation exists](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CN1PT1B0001), the same gap seen in the shell.",
