    "title": "**Recorded as waiting**",
    "text": "**Recorded as waiting**: [Existence](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000K): `exists` and `size` still throw `Undecided('Existence')`; a tombstone of a node with no record is `Undecided('Existence')` even with incoming pairs, with no bucket moved; the bucket of a swept tombstone waits in the map of the reverse of nodes with no record and no read counts it as existence. [Enforcement](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000M): the generic write of the marker, and a write to a tombstone, are not refused (decided to go on, 2026-10-16), and it is filed as [an issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4T7JDAR001).",
