    "title": "**Since (2026-10-17), in the new engine**",
    "text": "**Since (2026-10-17), in the new engine**: the engine of [Batch 7](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR014) has no revive operation either, and a plain write that clears the marker makes a tombstone live again without one; that corner is filed as [the writes to a tombstone](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4T7JDAR001). The grace window of this issue is the service's, since the engine's `sweep` runs only when the service calls it.",
