    "title": "2026-10-17, [Batch 7](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR014) in `Aperas.dev`",
    "text": "2026-10-17, [Batch 7](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR014) in `Aperas.dev`: the tombstone, the tombstone of a subtree, embedded nodes removed with their owner, and the sweep of the engine, staged on branch `js-apeironngn` and not committed. It closes in part [tombstoning does not empty the node at every site](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D252W7VG001), for the nodes the engine tombstones.",
