    "title": "00D4TA1KV0001",
    "text": "Promoted to [a plain write sets or clears the tombstone marker and writes to a tombstone](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4T7JDAR001), filed 2026-10-17 with the filing of [Batch 7](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR014), which is done.",
