    "title": "00D5B1Q9W8001",
    "text": "Promoted (2026-10-17) to [Graphs in memory](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CHJXK8003), [Addressing](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D5AYBPWR001), the interface's [Reads](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D5AYTCJR001), [Partitioning fields](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CJDGH8001), [A partition hierarchy](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2T5XBH0001) and [Containment](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR00Z) in the design (the two open points on a node both embedded and listed and on the order of the checks are removed as settled), and to [Batch 8](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR01D), [Batch 9](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR01M) and [Batch 14](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W0019) in the plan.",
