    "title": "**Recorded as waiting**",
    "text": "**Recorded as waiting**: [Existence](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000K) (`exists` and `size` still `Undecided('Existence')`); [Enforcement](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000M) (the writes that need the class); `danglingRefs` (Batch 9) and the five port operations (Batch 14) are still `NotBuiltError`, which `schema.test.ts` still asserts together with the rule that every operation of the interface has its batch, now including `graphOf`; `graphOf` waits for the user's confirmation.",
