    "title": "2026-10-17, [Batch 8](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR01D) in `Aperas.dev`",
    "text": "2026-10-17, [Batch 8](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR01D) in `Aperas.dev`: the graph name grammar, the registry of graphs, `createGraph` and `dropGraph`, the reads of a node's relations filtered to the graph they name, `graphOf` and the refusal of an embedded id in a containment field, staged on branch `js-apeironngn` and not committed. It resolves [the buckets of a reverse side are read across graphs](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4SRWNPR001), and its follow-up resolves [`insertItem` into an ordered embed field accepts any string](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4SRT8KR001).",
