    "title": "**The change**",
    "text": "**The change**: in `core/src/apeironNgn/`, `graphName.ts` (new: the grammar, RFC 1123 hostname rules in lowercase with the name `id` refused), `engine.ts` gaining `createGraph`, `dropGraph` (refused while a pair from another graph points into the graph), `graphOf` and `subjectsIn` behind the three reverse reads, `notOwned` in `addPair`, `build`, `insertItem` and `moveItem`; `records.ts` gaining the registry's `addGraph`, `removeGraph`, `recordsIn` and `hasSeveralGraphs`; `interface.ts` gaining `graphOf`. In `cli/src/tests/`, the oracle gaining the name grammar, `graphOf` and `notOwned`, and in `engine/` the tests `graphs`, `graphReads`, `embeddedId` and `graphs.model`, named in the `commit` suite and none in `essential`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D5BE5218001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D5BE5218003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**The first cross-graph run**",
    "text": "**The first cross-graph run**: with a subject in each of two graphs, only `subjectsOf` visibly differed between the oracle and the engine (`firstSubjectOf` and `countSubjectsOf` read the same unfiltered bucket); the derived entry, the tree, the second-container and cycle rule, the entries dropped with their target, the removal of a tombstone from its containers and the mark and sweep already agreed. The cases are the reproduction of the issue.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D5BE5218001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D5BE5218004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**The model-based test**",
    "text": "**The model-based test**: `graphs.model` runs 20 seeds of 250 operations over four graph names, with creation and dropping of graphs, and holds the engine equal to the oracle, with checks that do not rest on the oracle: an id is in one graph, a refused drop changes nothing, a dropped graph leaves no record or bucket, and the reverse of each field equals a scan of the forward sides.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D5BE5218001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D5BE5218005",
