    "title": "00D5BEXM70001",
    "text": "Promoted (2026-10-17) to [Records by kind and by graph](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR018), where a record carries its `graph` in memory and `graphOf` reads the field, and the mirror has no `graph` field and gives a document's graph by file containment, and to [Written by graph and kind](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01Y), where the load gives each record the graph of the file it reads and the dump writes each record to the file of its graph and kind.",
