    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D6HAEDCR001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**A move of a node after an anchor inside its own subtree is not refused by the working engine, and the next walk of the parent chain loops the service**",
    "text": "**A move of a node after an anchor inside its own subtree is not refused by the working engine, and the next walk of the parent chain loops the service**: found 2026-10-19 by the orchestrator in the check of the Coder's Turn 13 (Batch 9, step 2) and agreed to be filed. Filed 2026-10-19. It has frozen the service twice, from 2026-10-17 to 2026-10-19 and on 2026-10-20: the first time a pipe replaced by `< /dev/null` turned an insert into a move, the second time a wrong node id given to a move.",
