    "title": "00D6HAEDCR00F",
    "text": "[A move waits on standard input when it is an open pipe](#id/BlockNode:00D2PVVMWG001), the other fault of the same command; [a stopped service and a busy one give the same refusal](#id/BlockNode:00D2PCFDBR001), which a looping service also gives.",
