    ],
    "title": "**The skills give `< /dev/null` as the recipe of a move and do not say it belongs to a move only, so it was put on an `insert` that had a body to pipe**",
    "text": "**The skills give `< /dev/null` as the recipe of a move and do not say it belongs to a move only, so it was put on an `insert` that had a body to pipe**: found 2026-10-19 by the orchestrator in the check of the Coder's Turn 13 and agreed to be filed. Filed 2026-10-19.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CEA5KW4G00A",
