        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D6HAJNRR003",
    "text": "A Coder ran `aperas insert` with `</dev/null` where a pipe of markdown was meant. The redirect replaced the body with an empty one, and an `insert` with an empty body is a move, so the command moved a heading into its own subtree and left the working service in a loop ([a move into its own subtree is not refused](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D6HAEDCR001)).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D6HAJNRR002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D6HAJNS0000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D6HAJNS0000",
    "text": "**Root cause**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D6HAJNRR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D6HAJNS0001"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D6HAJNS0001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D6HAJNS0001:props:StringProp:00D6HAK9Y8006",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D6HAJNS0001:props:StringProp:00D6HAK9Y8007",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D6HAJNS0001",
    "text": "From v4.7 the move recipes of `skills/aperas/SKILL.md` and `skills/aperas-grapher/SKILL.md` and the section \"Moving a Node (`insert` with No Body)\" of `skills/aperas/references/mechanics.md` end in `< /dev/null` and say why (a move reads standard input to its end, and a harness can leave it open). None of them says the other half: `< /dev/null` is for a move only, and on an `insert` that has a body or a pipe it replaces the body and turns the create into a move. The `aperas-coder` and `aperas-orchestrator` skills carry no move recipe, by the decision on the stopgap, and so no such line.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D6HAJNS0000",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D6HAJNS0002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D6HAJNS0002",
    "text": "**Not proven**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D6HAJNRR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D6HAJNS0003"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D6HAJNS0003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D6HAJNS0003:props:StringProp:00D6HAK9YG000",
