      }
    ],
    "title": "00D6HAJNS0005",
    "text": "Proposed 2026-10-19 by the orchestrator, not yet decided as a skill release: the skills and `references/mechanics.md` say that `< /dev/null` is for a move only, never for an `insert` with a body or a pipe. The code fix of the move's signal, an explicit move that never reads standard input, would remove the need for the redirect and the risk with it ([the move waits on standard input](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2PVVMWG001)).",
