    "title": "**Recorded as waiting**",
    "text": "**Recorded as waiting**: the build errors that [Enforcement](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000M) gates go through one reporting function (`problemOf`), so the decision of the gate swaps in there; the list of undefined ids is returned and not read, the reading being [the service lifecycle](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000W)'s; [Existence](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000K) reaches the batch lightly, `danglingRefs` being the ids referenced and never defined. The Coder's Report names no case for [an id-like string at load](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D256098G001), for a non-canonical integer in a file or for the file of captured port views ([the name of a captured port view](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2T6X3CG001), Batch 14), and these stay waiting as the Gated by states.",
