    "title": "**The real mirror is not migrated**",
    "text": "**The real mirror is not migrated**: the migration of step 6 is applied at the cutover only, after a flush and with the service stopped, because the working engine in `Aperas/` cannot read the migrated mirror, and the new load cannot read an unmigrated one (a `predicate` on a `Link` is a key outside the shape). The scripts ran on scratch clones, the corpus test reads a copy, and nothing in the batch writes the live `AperasKG/Apeiron/`.",
