    "title": "**Stale places, corrected**",
    "text": "**Stale places, corrected**: steps 2 and 3, the engine side of Persistence and Closes of this batch; the Numbering and the Task Breakdown text; [Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C) step 8 and its Closes; and in the design, [Addressing](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D5AYBPWR001) and [Graphs in memory](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CHJXK8003) for the confirmed warning.",
