    "title": "Promoted (2026-10-19) to [Addressing](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D5AYBPWR001) and [Graphs in memory](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CHJXK8003) (decision 1",
    "text": "Promoted (2026-10-19) to [Addressing](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D5AYBPWR001) and [Graphs in memory](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3CHJXK8003) (decision 1: the warning is for a table entry keyed `tree`, the entry used, and a fourth graph named `tree` is not a case), to [step 8 of Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000M) (decision 2: the service calls only `loadMirror`; `createMirrorGraphs` is for a start with no load and for tests), and to [step 2 of Batch 9](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2VR01P); decision 3 changes nothing, a config has always needed `graph`. The two defects are filed: [a move of a node after an anchor inside its own subtree is not refused by the working engine, and it loops the service](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D6HAEDCR001), closed by Batch 11, and [the skills give `< /dev/null` as the recipe of a move and do not say it belongs to a move only](../issues/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00D6HAJNRR001).",
