    "title": "### aperas — Quick Syntax & Command Reference, the move row",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v4.7 Quick Syntax table](#id/BlockNode:00D4PMGJJR00B)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D6HJWKQG001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D6HJWKQG00B"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D6HJWKQG00B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D6HJWKQG00B",
    "text": "| Operation | Command Pattern | Key Rule / Note |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Peek / View** | `aperas unfold <ref> [--view <n>]` / `tree` | Peek node or render structured view lens |\n| **Inspect State** | `aperas show <ref> [--text]` / `backlinks` | Exact stored text, full record, or dependents |\n| **Insert Turn** | `cat turn.md \\| aperas insert <id> --after <a>`| Pipes markdown AST subtree after anchor child |\n| **Zoom View** | `aperas zoom <id> --view <name> --flush` | Re-roots view onto current Ask or Report |\n| **Update Node** | `echo \"text\" \\| aperas update <id> [--text-only]`| `--text-only` preserves kids; bare tombstones |\n| **Insert / Reposition**| `aperas insert <par> [--after <sib>]` | Bullet `- ` inserts; no body and `< /dev/null` moves node; never `< /dev/null` on an insert with a body or pipe (it replaces the pipe, so the CLI takes it for a move) |\n| **Sweep / Service** | `aperas check-links` / `service restart` | Sweeps internal links; restarts daemon |",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D6HJWKQG00A",
    "type": "table",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D6HJWKQG00C",
