    "title": "**Recorded as waiting**",
    "text": "**Recorded as waiting**: nothing is gated now. [A set of live ids](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000X) reached the batch lightly (the pass over `idsOfKind` drops the tombstoned ids itself); [Existence](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000K) reached it as before (`exists` and `size` stay `Undecided('Existence')` and the pass reads `record`, which answers nothing for an id with no record); [Enforcement](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000M) gates only what a write the engine will not take does to the maps, and the maps are updated after the engine accepted a write; [Deriving the path](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D25698B0001) gates Batch 16 and not this batch.",
