    "title": "**Stale places, corrected**",
    "text": "**Stale places, corrected**: [Batch 10 step 2 and its Gated by](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W0006) and [the open point on order differences](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YG50B0003) (the `findByExactPath` clause), when the path rule was written ([How a path names one node, settled](../discussion/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D6HPV2W8000)).",
