    "text": "**Since (2026-10-20), the four scans for a literal value served by the maps, the measurement not done**: [Batch 10](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W0004) built in `core/src/shell/lookups.ts` the three maps that answer a profile by its `handle`, a view by its `name` and an artifact or a folder by its stored `path` without a scan of the store, each filled by one pass of `rebuild` over `idsOfKind` and kept by one update function for each write that changes it; the corpus test loads the migrated copy of the mirror and rebuilds the maps in 2 ms. Nothing calls the maps yet, so the scans of the old readers stay until [Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C) moves them; that the scans no longer cost what the issue measures is shown in [Batch 13](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W0010), which compares the engine with the `free()` version on the real mirror. This entry stays open until then.",
