    "title": "Filing finished (2026-10-20)",
    "text": "Filing finished (2026-10-20): the items this note lists as not done are filed. The \"Since (2026-10-20)\" entries are on [`findByExactPath` takes the first node found at a path](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZMTKG001), [three behaviours of the caller depend on the order of an unordered read](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YFXDC800D) and [full-store scans](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D0W02KPG001), all three still open (the plan's Closes says \"in part\" for the first); the Batch 10 milestone and the Current Status sentence are in the history; the Dashboard's In flight and Planning entry, the plan's Numbering and the Task Breakdown text are brought to Batch 10 done; the \"Promoted\" lines are under [Batch 9 filed, Batch 10 surveyed](#id/BlockNode:00D6HH05Q8001) and [Batch 10 checked](#id/BlockNode:00D6HRZD8G001). Not filed: the survey of Batch 11 and the split of `commit`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D6J4S2X0001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D7554QBG001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Project the touched documents, 2026-10-20**",
    "text": "**Project the touched documents, 2026-10-20**: after the Batch 10 filing the user noticed that only `Apeiron/BlockNode.jsonld` changed in `AperasKG`: the Markdown projections under `artifacts/` were not regenerated by the last grapher turns (the graph is the source and the `.md` files are its shadows, but they are tracked and read by the user). The grapher projects the documents touched since the user's commit (`design/core.md`, `planning/core.md`, `history/core.md`, `issues/core.md`, `discussion/core.md`, `discussion/aperas-skill.md`, `history/aperas-skill.md`, `issues/aperas-skill.md`) so that the user's amended commit holds them; and, as a rule of the filing turns from here on, a filing turn ends by projecting the documents it touched.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XJ7GTR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D7572BT0001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Go for the survey of Batch 11, 2026-10-20**",
    "text": "**Go for the survey of Batch 11, 2026-10-20**: the user amended the `AperasKG` commit with the projected Markdown and said to continue: the grapher surveys Batch 11 (the layers above the engine moved onto it; 12 steps), proposes how to split it into pieces of one coder turn each, in dependency order, each with its gate, Done when and the tests written before its group moves, and proposes a split of the `commit` suite; what the design must settle goes to the user as questions. The projection of the touched documents ends each filing turn from here on.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XJ7GTR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
