    "title": "**Piece 1: manual links removed**",
    "text": "**Piece 1: manual links removed**: ([step 9](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YG50AR001)). On the old code, green throughout. Replaces: `artifacts.ts:606` to `:612` (`resolveBlockLinks` keeps the non-wikilink links of a block and regenerates the wikilink ones: it regenerates all), `node.ts:1067` (`collectOldWikilinksByBlock`), `node.ts:343` to `:369` (`addLink`, `mintWikilink` and its `predicate`), `node.ts:1206` (`declare predicate`), the render item and JSON `predicate` (`node.ts:1643`, `:1834` to `:1901`) and the text `[Link]  <predicate> → <target>` of `node.ts:1936`/`:1940` and `kgUnfold.ts:113,144`, `shape.ts:109`, `astParser.ts` `WIKILINK_PREDICATE`, `web/src/render.ts:42` and `FolderDiv.tsx:534`. Deletes: `kgLink.ts`, `kgUnlink.ts`, their entries `aperas.ts:37` and `:38`, the three `case` arms `service.ts:603` to `:616` and the import at `:88`, the three request types `serviceProtocol.ts:98` to `:100`. Batch 12 deletes nothing of this. Tests: no new group; the cases that use a manual link are rewritten or removed (`ingest/chain.test.ts:115`, `gc/collection.test.ts:61` to `:64`, `support/linkedDemo.ts:53`, `store/views.test.ts`, and the file list at `prompt/removalPrompt.test.ts:64`, which names `kgLink.ts`). Done when: a grep of `core/src`, `cli/src` and `web/src` for `predicate` finds no use of the field of a `Link`; `aperas` has no verb `link` or `unlink`; `tree` and `unfold` print a link without a predicate (an entry of the deliberate differences); `tsc --noEmit` of `core`, `cli` and `web` is clean; `essential` and `commit` pass within their budgets; the old load still takes the unmigrated mirror (it encodes any key, so the `demand` corpus files still load; the coder runs `--group corpus` once to see). Gated by: nothing. Closes: [every `Link` carries a `predicate`](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3WNBPPG001) in the shell's code.",
