    "title": "**Piece 8: ingest, track and project**",
    "text": "**Piece 8: ingest, track and project**: (step 5; the readers of the old lookups in `artifacts.ts` and `folders.ts`). Replaces: `findLiveByKindAndPath` and `findLiveArtifactByPath` (`artifacts.ts:188`, `:194`; callers `:67`, `:216`, `:317`, `:710`, `:763`, `kgIngest.ts:48`) by `liveAtPath` with the kind as a filter; the folder ingest's local maps by path (`folders.ts` 41 to 114, `existingByPath`, `folderIdByPath`, `artifactIdByPath`, and those in `artifacts.ts`) by the one map, with the write layer telling it after each accepted write (decided at the Batch 10 check); `positionsEqual` (`artifacts.ts:371`) by a comparison of sorted lists; the ghost filter `allLiveIdsOfKind` (`artifacts.ts:203`, `folders.ts:27`: `path !== undefined`) by a test that a node has a record and a title, since a ghost has a `parent` and no document; the graph of each node an ingest creates by `graphOfNewNode`. Deletes: the two `find` functions of `artifacts.ts` and the local maps. Tests: the files of piece 3 (`track.test.ts`, `project.test.ts`, the second-ingest case) and `ingest/chain.test.ts` unchanged; new `commands/ingest.test.ts` (a tracked artifact and a folder ingested in the same run found by the one map; a file renamed on disk; an ingest that reuses a path after a removal; a ghost folder is not an artifact; a thread artifact lands in `threads.tree`). Done when: those pass; the two `find` functions and the local maps are gone; the mutations survive none (`positionsEqual` unsorted, a map not told after a write); `tsc`, `essential`, `commit`. Gated by: the open point on order differences (for `positionsEqual`, settled), [No set of live ids](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000X). Closes: the second of the three behaviours in [the order issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YFXDC800D).",
