  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**The tests that must exist before each group moves (Layer 1), by group**",
    "text": "**The tests that must exist before each group moves (Layer 1), by group**: reads (`runTree`, `runShow`, `runUnfold`, `runPath`, `runResolve`, `runFold`, `runZoom`, `runProfile*`) in piece 2; writes (`runRemove`, the placement and move of `runInsert`, `runUpdate`, `runRetype`) and ingest, track and project (`runTrack`, `runReverseTrack`, `runProject`, `runIngest`) in piece 3; the service (`service.ts`, `serviceClient.ts`) in piece 4; `runLinkCandidates` is gone with its verb in piece 1. All of them come before piece 6, and not before the later piece that changes their group, because piece 6 moves every group at once and the tests run against the working code only if they exist first. This changes the plan's \"before its group moves\" only in that \"its group\" is the flip for all of them; the plan's text does not need an edit.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D76BQ2N000A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**The steps of the survey**",
