    "title": "**Done, 2026-10-20**",
    "text": "**Done, 2026-10-20**: in `Aperas.dev/monorepo` on branch `js-apeironngn`, staged and not committed. A `Link` is a wikilink in the code, the web and the tests and has no `predicate`; the verbs `aperas link` and `aperas unlink` are gone. The piece changed the old code in `core/src/shell/`, `cli/src` and `web/src`, and added no group and no file.",
