    ],
    "title": "**The Done when, checked**",
    "text": "**The Done when, checked**: the Coder's runs, from `monorepo/` with `env -u LD_LIBRARY_PATH`: `tsc --noEmit` clean for `core`, `cli` and `web`; `--group` runs `gc` 2 of 2, `ingest` 8 of 8, `links` 3 of 3, `linking` 10 of 10, `store` 17 of 17, `prompt` 5 of 5; `essential` 52 of 52 in 3.1 s; `commit` 904 of 904 in 37.5 s (load average 1.4 to 2.4 on 4 cores). `aperas link` answers \"Unknown command 'link'\" and `help` lists neither verb; a grep of the checkout (without `dist`, `node_modules`, `.archive`) for `kgLink`, `kgUnlink`, `aperas (un)link`, `kg:(un)link`, `WIKILINK_PREDICATE`, `runAddBlockLink` and `addLink` finds nothing; a grep for `predicate` in `core/src`, `cli/src` and `web/src` finds only RDF predicate terms (`q.predicate`, `PRED`, `storeAccess.ts`, `vocab.ts`) and two test lines that are not a use of the field (`aperasSchema.test.ts` asserts it is absent, `mirror/load.test.ts` feeds an unknown key on purpose). After the corpus case was made exact (below): `--group corpus` 18 of 18 in 64.7 s, `essential` 52 of 52 in 3.4 s, `commit` 904 of 904 in 39.5 s. The orchestrator ran the suites: `commit` 904 of 904 in 40 s, `essential` 52 of 52 in 3.2 s.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D76JZXJ8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D76JZXJ8003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**What was built**",
    "text": "**What was built**: `shell/artifacts.ts` `resolveBlockLinks` writes `.links` from the wikilink ids alone and no longer keeps the links that are not wikilinks; `shell/node.ts` loses `BaseNode.addLink`, the `predicate` of `mintWikilink`, the `Link.predicate` declaration and `RenderLinkItem.predicate` with the `predicate` of the five `buildLinkItem` returns, and `toText` prints `[Link]  → <target>` (no target: `[Link]  <no target>`); `shell/shape.ts` `LINK_SHAPE` loses `predicate`, which is what makes `dehydrate` stop writing the field; `astParser.ts` loses `WIKILINK_PREDICATE`; `kgLink.ts` (with `runLinkCandidates`, `runAddBlockLink`, `runRemoveBlockLink`) and `kgUnlink.ts` are removed with their entries in `aperas.ts`, the import and the three `case` arms of `service/service.ts` and the three request types of `serviceProtocol.ts`; `kgUnfold.ts` prints `→ <target>`; `web/src/render.ts` loses `predicate` and `FolderDiv.tsx` prints `link — no target`. The text of a `Link` line in `tree` and `unfold` is the entry for the list of deliberate differences (Batch 13): the predicate is gone, the arrow kept (`[Link]  <predicate> → <target>` before, `[Link]  → <target>` now).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D76JZXJ8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D76JZXJ8004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Beyond the brief's list, all forced by the removal**",
    "text": "**Beyond the brief's list, all forced by the removal**: `links/backlinks.test.ts` and `linking/anchors.test.ts` used `addLink` and `WIKILINK_PREDICATE`; `gc/collection.test.ts` mints a wikilink in its place and its case 11 is renamed \"dropping the only link to a tombstone lets the next pass collect it\"; `support/linkedDemo.ts` loses its `manualLink` option; `prompt/removalPrompt.test.ts` names only `kgProject.ts`; `store/views.test.ts` case 8 gains one assertion that a link line is `<linkId>  [Link]  → <victimId>`; comments that named the removed operations are reworded in `serviceProtocol.ts`, `lineReader.ts`, `artifacts.ts`, `node.ts`, `shape.ts` and `reconcile.ts`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D76JZXJ8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D76JZXJ8005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**The Coder's choices**",
