    "text": "**`runPath` of a `Link` id throws \"toPath is not a function\" and does not refuse with the message the code means**: found 2026-10-20 by the Coder in the tests of [piece 2 of Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0000) (`commands/resolve.test.ts`), and filed as a defect of the old code by the grapher at the orchestrator's decision. Filed 2026-10-20.",
