    "title": "00D76KJ728003",
    "text": "`runPath(store, <id of a Link>)` (`aperas path <link id>`) ends with a `TypeError`, `wrap(...).toPath is not a function`, in place of the refusal that `kgPath.ts` writes for this case, `'<id>' has no walkable parent chain — a Link (no structural parent), or a BlockNode ingested before the 'parent' field existed (needs re-ingestion).` The message the code means is unreachable for a `Link`, the case it names first.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D76KJ728002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D76KJ728004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
