    "text": "**Root cause**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D76KJ728001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00D76KJ728005"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D76KJ728005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D76KJ728005:props:StringProp:00D76KJRD8000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00D76KJ728005:props:StringProp:00D76KJRD8001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D76KJ728005",
    "text": "`runPath` (`kgPath.ts:12` to `:20`) resolves the argument to an id, wraps it and calls `toPath()` after a cast `as unknown as TreeNode`, which hides the type. `toPath` is declared on `TreeNode` (`node.ts:421`), and `Link` extends `ApeironInstance` (`node.ts:1195`), not `TreeNode`, so a `Link` has no such method and the `null` test that holds the message is never reached. Read in the source and shown by the test, not traced through the service.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D76KJ728004",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D76KJ728006",
