        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00D76KJ728007",
    "text": "Whether the other classes that do not extend `TreeNode` (`Profile`, `TreeView`, `StringProp`) end the same way when named by a full id; the test covers a `Link` only.",
