    "title": "**Done, 2026-10-20**",
    "text": "**Done, 2026-10-20**: in `Aperas.dev/monorepo` on branch `js-apeironngn`, staged and not committed. The group `commands/` on the old code, with three files and a shared corpus: `commands/render.test.ts` (21 cases), `commands/resolve.test.ts` (19) and `commands/views.test.ts` (19), 59 in all, and `support/commandsCorpus.ts`; `commit.suite.mjs` names the three files (+3 lines) and `essential.suite.mjs` names `commands/render.test.ts` (+1 line). No source file is edited, and `runLinkCandidates` stays waived. The files touch the store only through `fx.store`, `wrap` and the `runX` functions (plus `findByExactPath`, `generateNodeId` and `resolveTreeView`); a grep of the new files for `oxigraph`, `storeAccess`, `vocab` and `.match(` finds nothing.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0000",
