    "text": "**Quirks of the old commands that the tests of piece 3 do not pin, for pieces 7 to 9 to decide which the new engine pins**: found 2026-10-20 by the Coder in the tests of [piece 3 of Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0001) (Turn 18) and filed by the grapher at the orchestrator's decision, as one issue. Filed 2026-10-20.",
