    "title": "00D7710E5800C",
    "text": "None decided. The pieces that move these commands decide, each for what it moves, which behaviour the new engine pins, which it changes and which it refuses: [piece 7](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0005) (the reads and the resolution), [piece 8](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0006) (ingest, track and project: the deep-path wikilink, `staleOnDisk`) and [piece 9](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0007) (writes and tombstones: `runUpdate`, `runRemove`, `runInsert`). A behaviour the new engine pins gets a test at that piece; one it changes is recorded as a deliberate difference.",
