    "title": "**Done, 2026-10-20**",
    "text": "**Done, 2026-10-20**: in `Aperas.dev/monorepo` on branch `js-apeironngn`, staged and not committed. The group `commands/` on the old code gains four files and one case: `commands/remove.test.ts` (14 cases), `insert.test.ts` (33), `track.test.ts` (18) and `project.test.ts` (14), 79 in all; case `5g` of `ingest/chain.test.ts`; and the reproduction `commands/moveIntoOwnSubtree.repro.ts`, which no suite names. No source file is edited. The files touch the store only through `fx.store`, `wrap` and the `runX` functions; a grep of the new files for `oxigraph`, `storeAccess`, `vocab` and `.match(` finds nothing.",
