    "title": "**Done, 2026-10-20**",
    "text": "**Done, 2026-10-20**: in `Aperas.dev/monorepo` on branch `js-apeironngn`, staged and not committed. A new group `service/` on the old boot, with two files, `lifecycle.test.ts` (21 cases, 2.4 s in file) and `ops.test.ts` (29 cases, 1.5 s in file): 50 cases in about 3.0 s in the runner, and a shared harness, `support/serviceHarness.ts` (186 lines). No source file is edited. Both files stay in `commit` (each is under the 4 s in-file line, so neither goes to `tools`).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0002",
