    "title": "**The diff**",
    "text": "**The diff**: `core/src/shell/db.ts`, `core/src/shell/writeLayer.ts`, `tests/shell/db.test.ts` and `tests/shell/writeLayer.model.test.ts` (new); `suites/commit.suite.mjs` and `suites/models.suite.mjs` (+1 line each).",
