    "title": "00D79K9158001",
    "text": "Promoted (2026-10-20) to [the done record of piece 5](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D79JRVH8001), [the entry of piece 6](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D79JW9AR001) (it removes `Lookups.subtreeTombstoned`), [the Dashboard's In flight](#id/BlockNode:00D3Y41ARR002), [the issue of the folder scan that skips dot-names](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D79JHQ40001) and the figures of [the tiers](../design/testing.md#id/BlockNode:00D1D5F648000) (`commit` 56 files, 975 cases, 18.1 s; `demand` 71 files; `models` 8 files; sixteen groups).",
