  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D7T3QAV8001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Done, 2026-10-21**",
    "text": "**Done, 2026-10-21**: in `Aperas.dev/monorepo` on branch `js-apeironngn`, staged and not committed (65 files, 1,142 insertions, 1,102 deletions, nothing unstaged). The shell, the cli and the service run on the engine through the `Db` and the write layer: the service boots, reloads and flushes on it, the six frozen files have no diff, and the real mirror and the checkout `Aperas/` were only read. The Coder was cut off by the session limit and finished after the reset.",
