    "text": "**The extra tests**: `shell/oldEngine.test.ts` (above); `commands/containers.test.ts` (3 cases: the removal rule on a list, on a textless wrapper and on a chain; the boot rule) and `service/refusal.test.ts` (2 cases: the boot refuses and leaves no lock; a reload, plain and with `--discard`, refuses and the memory is kept), both named in `commit`. The test services ran with a runtime directory, a port and roots of their own, asserted before the start; `pgrep` for `aperas-test-` found nothing left after each run.",
