    "text": "**Closes**: [a move of a node after an anchor inside its own subtree](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D6HAEDCR001) (refused by the no-cycle rule, with the service answering), and the shell's side of [the store is read outside the helpers](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D2536E1R001); the first-match reader of [`findByExactPath`](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZMTKG001) is on the maps, and the issue stays open until the callers move (piece 7). Each has its dated entry.",
