    "text": "**Set by piece 6, 2026-10-21**: the flip leaves `findLiveByKindAndPath` and its callers to this piece. It made `trackArtifact`, the holders of `resolveCreate.ts` and the folder tree create their nodes with `createNode` and a path or an `under`, so the graph of each node an ingest creates is already the one `graphOfNewNode` gives. A removed artifact is pruned at the next sweep ([Layer 4](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQW6AR002), Difference 2), so the case of an ingest that reuses a path after a removal makes a new artifact with new ids, which is decided to be so, and `track --reverse` forgets a removed artifact once it is pruned.",
