    "text": "**Set by piece 6, 2026-10-21**: the part of this entry that the Ask of piece 6 pulled in is done: `applyTombstone` and `tombstoneLiveSubtree` on the engine's `tombstone` and `tombstoneSubtree`, the tombstone leaving its container, `tombstoneEmptiedContainers` at the end of `kgRemove` (a removal tombstones the container it empties, in the same write), and the boot rule `tombstoneVacuousContainers` as \"a `list`, or a textless `listItem`, with no child\". The tests whose expectations changed with the decision are `commands/render.test.ts` (2), `commands/remove.test.ts` (3) and `service/ops.test.ts` (2), and `commands/containers.test.ts` (3 cases) is new ([Layer 4](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQW6AR002), Differences 1 to 3). What else this entry lists stands as written, for the Coder's survey of the piece to read against the code.",
