    "text": "**Since (2026-10-21), the shell's direct reads gone, the frozen set not yet**: [Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C) piece 6, the flip, moved the shell, the cli and the service onto the `Db` and the write layer in `Aperas.dev` (staged, not committed): the existence and listing reads go through `nodeExists`, `allIdsOfKind` and `liveIdsOfKind`, and the dev tools that built a raw `Store` are deleted (`apeironNgnSmokeTest.ts`, `verifyDanglingUnfolds.ts`) or ported (`verifyLinkRefusals.ts`). A search of `monorepo/packages` for `oxigraph` on 2026-10-21 finds it outside `.archive/` only in the six frozen files, the frozen files' own tests and support files, the two guards (`shell/oldEngine.test.ts`, which fails if any other module imports `oxigraph` or a frozen file, and `engine/boundary.test.ts`), `core/package.json`, `cli/build.mjs`, and a comment in `web/src/render.ts`. What is left, the frozen set with its tests and the dependency, is [Batch 12](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000S). The reference copy in `Aperas/` is unchanged. This entry stays open until then.",
