    "title": "**Since (2026-10-21), the file deleted in `Aperas.dev`**",
    "text": "**Since (2026-10-21), the file deleted in `Aperas.dev`**: [Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C) piece 6, the flip, deleted `apeironNgnSmokeTest.ts` in `Aperas.dev` (staged, not committed), which is the fix this issue asks for, and with it `verifyDanglingUnfolds.ts`; it ported `verifyLinkRefusals.ts` to the engine. The reference copy in `Aperas/` keeps the file. The plan closes this issue with [Batch 12](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000S), so it stays open until then.",
