    "title": "**The canonical place of a node reached through a nested cone is the first link met in the depth-first visit, not necessarily the one of the lowest id: the rule of the design is exact within one cone and was never specified for the nested case**",
    "text": "**The canonical place of a node reached through a nested cone is the first link met in the depth-first visit, not necessarily the one of the lowest id: the rule of the design is exact within one cone and was never specified for the nested case**: found 2026-10-21 by the Coder in piece 7 of [Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C), read from the code and not pinned by a test; filed 2026-10-21, as decided by the orchestrator at the check of the piece (left as built, for the user to decide later). The rule the design states is [The canonical place in the render](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000Q): the place is the first in code-point order of the unfolded ids.",
