    ],
    "title": "00D7TSC16G005",
    "text": "The design sentence does not say whether the first is taken over the links of one cone or over every link the render reaches. The code (`discoverCone` in `node.ts`, fed by `buildRenderTree` with the `unfolds` sorted by id) visits depth first: a link that wins opens its own cone at once, and the claims made inside it come before the later links of the cone it sits in. The rule is read from the code, not traced through a run on the nested case.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D7TSC16G004",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
