    "title": "00D7TSC16G00D",
    "text": "[The tree view lists a block's links newest first](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8001) and [three behaviours of the caller depend on the order of an unordered read](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YFXDC800D), where the order of the canonical place was first found.",
