  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00D7TSHVMG001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Done, 2026-10-21**",
    "text": "**Done, 2026-10-21**: in `Aperas.dev/monorepo` on branch `js-apeironngn`, staged and not committed (27 files, 466 insertions, 103 deletions, nothing unstaged; the tree was clean at `074670f` at the start). No `findByExactPath` remains in `packages`; the callers read `maps.liveAtPath`; the order rules of the four design answers are in the shell and pinned by tests that build the nodes in the opposite order of their ids; the six frozen files have no diff, and the real mirror and the checkout `Aperas/` were only read.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
