    "title": "**Closes**",
    "text": "**Closes**: [the tree view lists a block's links newest first](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8001), [`runPath` of a `Link` id throws](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D76KJ728001) and [`findByExactPath` takes the first node found at a path](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZMTKG001) (each resolved on the new engine, with its dated entry, and moved to Resolved; the working service and `Aperas/` run the old code until the cutover); [three behaviours of the caller depend on the order of an unordered read](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YFXDC800D) gains a dated entry (the canonical place and the first-match behaviour built; `positionsEqual` waits for piece 8) and stays open.",
