    "@id": "BlockNode:00D7TSHVMR00A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Findings of the Coder along the way**",
    "text": "**Findings of the Coder along the way**: the working service answered \"No ApeironNgn service running\" once, at the first `aperas show` of the turn while its process was alive (busy); the Coder waited 5 s and every call after answered. A leftover `sed -i` line on `/dev/null` in a combined command failed with \"not a regular file\" and changed nothing. Two mutation patterns did not match at the first try; one was applied by index in an inline script.",
