    "title": "**The deliberate differences of the order rules (piece 7 of [Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C)), 2026-10-21**",
    "text": "**The deliberate differences of the order rules (piece 7 of [Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C)), 2026-10-21**: seven, each with its reason; a test that changed shows under its difference, and every other test of the moved groups passes with its text unchanged. They come from the four design answers (the listings sorted in the shell, the links of a block by `position`, the canonical place, no set of live ids) and from the rule that a refusal names its cause.",
