    "title": "**Difference 1, the links of a block come by `position`, then id, a link with none last**",
    "text": "**Difference 1, the links of a block come by `position`, then id, a link with none last**: `tree`, `unfold` (the peek and inside an expanded link), the web's `render-tree` and the `check-links` discrepancies list a block's links by the smallest of their `position` values as a number (`'9'` before `'10'`), the tie by id, a link with no `position` after those that have one; the reference copy lists them newest first, the store's match order ([the newest-first issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8001)). Reason: [The order of links without a position](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000P); the smallest position is the Coder's choice for a link of two occurrences of its target. Tests adapted: `commands/render.test.ts` (the links under an unfolded block, the peek), `commands/order.test.ts` (new).",
