    ],
    "title": "**Difference 3, the listings are sorted by id**",
    "text": "**Difference 3, the listings are sorted by id**: the profiles, the views of a profile, a profile's preferences, all views, the unfolded ids of a view, `backlinks`, `track --reverse` and the discrepancies and dangling links of `check-links`; the reference copy listed them in the store's order. Reason: [Where an order shows](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01E) (a set is the reader's sort), so the layer-4 output compare is exact. Tests adapted: `commands/views.test.ts`, `commands/track.test.ts`, `service/ops.test.ts` (backlinks `[alpha, gamma]`, `trackReverse` in the order beta, dup, alpha, gamma), `commands/order.test.ts` (new, built in the opposite order of the ids).",
