    "title": "**Difference 4, `compareByKey` places an id with no key last and no longer throws on a mixed pair**",
    "text": "**Difference 4, `compareByKey` places an id with no key last and no longer throws on a mixed pair**: `Undecided` and `MIXED_KEYS_POINT` are gone from `order.ts`. Reason: the user's answer on [the order of links without a position](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000P). Test adapted: `engine/order.test.ts` (the `Undecided` case is the placement case).",
