    "title": "**Difference 5, `runPath` of a node that has no path is refused with a message of its own**",
    "text": "**Difference 5, `runPath` of a node that has no path is refused with a message of its own**: `'<id>' is a <Kind>, which has no path: only a tracked artifact, folder or block does.`, in place of the `TypeError` \"toPath is not a function\"; the `null` case keeps its own message, which no longer mentions a `Link`. Reason: [`runPath` of a `Link` id throws](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D76KJ728001). Test adapted: `commands/resolve.test.ts` (the message, and not a `TypeError`).",
