    "title": "**Difference 7, `aperas show` prints a block's links in id order**",
    "text": "**Difference 7, `aperas show` prints a block's links in id order**: the stored form, as the mirror file (`mirrorDump.documentOf` sorts every set by id), not by position; `show` is a record, not a rendering, and the Brief named `tree`, `unfold` and the web only. Decided by the orchestrator on the Coder's question.",
