    "title": "**Resolved (2026-10-21)**",
    "text": "**Resolved (2026-10-21)**: [Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C) piece 7, in `Aperas.dev` (staged, not committed), moved the callers onto `maps.liveAtPath` (`resolve.ts`, `resolveCreate.ts`, `kgProject.ts`, `linkIntegrity.ts` and 8 test and support files) and deleted `findByExactPath`, its import in `tree.ts` and three comments; a search of `packages` finds it nowhere. A path held by a tombstoned and a live node returns the live node under both orders, held by `commands/resolve.test.ts` as a regular test; `tsc` of `core`, `cli` and `web` is clean and `commit` 1018 of 1018. The reference copy in `Aperas/`, which the working service runs until the cutover, keeps the first-match reader and its callers.",
