    "title": "00D7TVNYX0001",
    "text": "Promoted (2026-10-21) to [the done record of piece 7](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D7TSHVMG001), [the seven deliberate differences](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D7TSPH88001) in Layer 4 of the Verification Plan, and the dated entries of the issues: [the newest-first issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZK7C8001), [`runPath` of a `Link` id](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D76KJ728001) and [the first node found at a path](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZMTKG001) resolved (moved to Resolved), [the three behaviours of the order issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YFXDC800D) open for piece 8, and [the canonical place with a nested cone](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D7TSC16G001) filed for the user to decide later. The design points [The order of links without a position](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000P), [The canonical place in the render](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000Q) and [No set of live ids](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87T000X) were already settled in the design on 2026-10-20 and are unchanged.",
