    "title": "**Closes**",
    "text": "**Closes**: [three behaviours of the caller depend on the order of an unordered read](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YFXDC800D) (`positionsEqual` by sorted lists; with piece 7 all three behaviours and the five listings are built on the engine): resolved and moved to Resolved, with the note that the working service and `Aperas/` run the old code until the cutover; [`findByExactPath` takes the first node found at a path](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D22ZMTKG001) gains a dated entry for its sibling lookups of `artifacts.ts`; [the ghost folder](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D417WK80001) gains a dated entry for the filter that replaces `path !== undefined`; the reference-copy notes are kept.",
