    "text": "**Difference 1, a node is live for the ingest when it has a record, a title and no tombstone marker, not when it has a `path`**: the lists of live artifacts and folders (`trackAllArtifacts`, the folder sweep, `getFolderRecord`) come from `liveDocumentIdsOfKind`; the reference copy kept the nodes with `path !== undefined`. Reason: a ghost has a `parent` and no document ([the ghost folder](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D417WK80001)), and with the engine it has no record at all, so it is in no list; a node a write is still building has a record and a path but no title and is also in no list. Tests: `commands/ingest.test.ts` (a ghost is in no list; a node with a record and a path but no title is in no list), `folder/ghost.test.ts` unchanged.",
