    "title": "**Difference 2, `positionsEqual` compares two sorted lists**",
    "text": "**Difference 2, `positionsEqual` compares two sorted lists**: a reused `Link` whose `position` props are stored in another order than the fresh ascending list keeps its prop ids on a later ingest; the reference copy compared the stored list in match order with the fresh one and rewrote the props, which changed their ids without a change in content. Reason: [the order issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YFXDC800D), whose fix direction is a comparison that does not depend on the order of an unordered read ([Sets are unordered](../design/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D24N87SR01D)). Test: `commands/ingest.test.ts` (the position props stored in descending order).",
