    "title": "**Since (2026-10-21), the sibling lookups of the artifacts moved too**",
    "text": "**Since (2026-10-21), the sibling lookups of the artifacts moved too**: [Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C) piece 8, in `Aperas.dev` (staged, not committed), deleted `findLiveByKindAndPath` (`artifacts.ts:188`), the sibling named under Root cause, and `findLiveArtifactByPath`; their 8 callers (`resolveBarePathCode`, `trackArtifact`, `trackArtifactsScoped`, `ingestArtifact`, `ingestAllArtifacts` and `kgIngest.ts:48`) call `maps.liveAtPath(path, { kind })`, and the local maps of the folder ingest and of `trackAllArtifacts` are replaced by the same map; a search of `packages` finds none of the names. `commands/ingest.test.ts` holds the case of a path reused after a removal (a new artifact, the tombstone keeps its path and is not answered); `commit` 1029 of 1029 in 18.3 s. The reference copy in `Aperas/`, which the working service runs until the cutover, keeps both functions and the maps.",
