    "title": "**Decision: bump version to 0.2.6 for release with Unlicense license**",
    "text": "**Decision: bump version to 0.2.6 for release with Unlicense license**: Bumping monorepo and member package versions (`@aperas/cli`, `@aperas/core`, `@aperas/web`) to `0.2.6` (following `0.2.5` npm publication) to package and publish the root `LICENSE` file into `dist/LICENSE` and declare `\"license\": \"Unlicense\"` across all manifests, followed by test verification (`npm run verify`), building the distribution bundle via `npm run build:aperas`, and publishing to npm.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ5ET5Z8005",
