    "text": "**Done, 2026-10-21**: in `Aperas.dev/monorepo` on branch `js-apeironngn`, staged and not committed (six files: `kgRemove.ts` and `core/src/shell/node.ts`, each with a comment fixed and nothing else changed; `tests/commands/remove.test.ts`, `tests/commands/containers.test.ts` and `tests/shell/writeLayer.model.test.ts` changed; the new helper `tests/support/mirrorLists.ts`). Almost all of this piece was done by the flip ([the note above](#id/BlockNode:00D7T4SV0G001)); the Coder read the entry clause by clause against the code, found the rest done, and added the cases of the Done-when that were missing. The real mirror and the checkout `Aperas/` were only read, and no service was started or stopped.",
