    "title": "**What was already done by the flip, and what was added**",
    "text": "**What was already done by the flip, and what was added**: already done and found so by `grep` and reading: (a) `applyTombstone` and `tombstoneLiveSubtree` go through the engine's `tombstone` and `tombstoneSubtree` (`node.ts:792` and `:815`), the copy of `type`, `title` and `text` staying in `applyTombstone`; (b) the tombstone leaves its container, in the engine (`makeTombstone` detaches it from every host in its containment bucket); (c) `toPath()` of a tombstone is null by construction (no `parent`); (d) a removal tombstones the container it empties (`tombstoneEmptiedContainers`, called by `kgRemove.ts`); (e) `tombstoneVacuousContainers` keeps the boot rule only (`isVacuousContainer`); (f) the shell no longer clears `children`, `links` or `props` anywhere; (g) the four commands place children through the shell's `insertChild`, `appendChild` and the `children` setter (`node.ts:92` to `:160`), which call the write layer's `insertItem`, `moveItem` and `removeItem`. Added: the tests below and the helper, and two stale comments (`tombstoneTag` in `node.ts`, the header of `kgRemove.ts`) that still described the old clearing and the kept list entry.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D8006A58001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
