    "@id": "BlockNode:00D8006A58004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**The checks and timings, with the load**",
    "text": "**The checks and timings, with the load**: by the Coder, `tsc --noEmit` of `core`, `cli` and `web` clean; `essential` 74 of 74 in 3.0 s of 5 s; `commit` 1032 of 1032 in 20.0 s of 60 s (was 1029 in 18.3 s; the load average was 1.7 before and 2.8 right after); `models` 186 of 186 in 13.4 s (was 165: the 20 seeds and the totals case); `tools` run, its files all ok; `--group corpus` 17 of 17 in 42.5 s. By the orchestrator: `tsc` clean; `essential` 74 of 74 in 3.3 s; `commit` 1032 of 1032 in 20.6 s; `models` 186 of 186; `tools` 14 of 14; `--group corpus` 17 of 17 (after the Coder fixed four dangling links of its own Report); load 1.5 to 1.8.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00D8006A58001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
