    "@id": "BlockNode:00D8006A58005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00D8006A58005",
    "text": "**The 11 mutations**, applied by a scratch script (`/home/will/scratch/mut9/run.py`, each under `timeout 100` on `--group commands,shell,engine`, files restored, the `git diff` of `apeironNgn/engine.ts` empty): 11 caught, none alive. (1) `kgRemove` without the call that tombstones the emptied container: 21 cases (`containers.test.ts` x3, the model seeds); (2) the rule stops after the first container: 13; (3) a list with one live child counts as vacuous: 15; (4) a `listItem` with text counts as a container: 12; (5) the engine's tombstone stays in its host's list: 90 cases, among them the flush case, the `remove.test.ts` tree cases and the seeds 3001 to 3020; (6) the engine's cascade stops at the top: 50; (7) the shell tombstones one node, not the subtree: 19; (8) `toPath()` of a tombstone is not null: 1 case, the `toPath` case alone; (9) the boot rule runs one pass: 1 case, the boot rule of `containers.test.ts`; (10) `kgRemove` reads the container after the write: 21; (11) the engine re-stamps a tombstone that already is one: 46 (the model seeds 2001 on).",
