    "text": "**A move or a reconcile that empties a list leaves it live until the boot sweep**: the confirmed rule, noted here so that piece 10 and the cutover read it: only `aperas remove` tombstones the container it empties, in the same write; a move out of a list and the reconcile of an `update` do not, and the empty list stays live, listed in its parent, until `tombstoneVacuousContainers` runs at the boot of the service.",
