    "title": "00D80149EG001",
    "text": "Promoted (2026-10-21) to [the done record of piece 9](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D8006A58001) (no deliberate difference in Layer 4), and the dated entries of the issues: [the plain write on a tombstone](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D4T7JDAR001) (the engine accepts an insert of a tombstone) and [a write to a thread node never marks the `.state/` mirror dirty](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CVNZXVR8001) (the `update` handler of the working service; both issues already existed, so the findings are entries and not new issues), and [tombstoning does not empty the node at every site](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D252W7VG001) (the callers' share built).",
