    "title": "**Closes**",
    "text": "**Closes**: [no test calls most commands of the CLI or the service](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YFXDC8001) (steps 3, 4, 5 and 8 all have their tests) and [the load computes `danglingRefs` and the service never reads it](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D258W098001) (the service logs the list), each resolved with a dated entry and moved to Resolved, the working service and `Aperas/` running the old code until the cutover. [A write to a thread node never marks the `.state/` mirror dirty](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CVNZXVR8001) gains a dated entry: closed on the new engine, open on the working service until the cutover, or until the user fixes it there.",
