    "title": "**Difference 6, the dangling ids are logged**",
    "text": "**Difference 6, the dangling ids are logged**: the load's list of ids referenced and never defined is one warning at the start and at each reload, and not a refusal ([the issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D258W098001)); the real mirror has none. Test: `service/lifecycle.test.ts`.",
