    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Done, 2026-10-21**",
    "text": "**Done, 2026-10-21**: in `Aperas.dev/monorepo` on branch `js-apeironngn`: the shell of `Aperas.dev` runs on the engine. The flip (piece 6) is committed by the user as `074670f`; pieces 7 to 10 are staged and not committed. The batch was carried out in ten pieces of one coder turn each, the grapher filing each (the piece entries above hold the Coder's records, the orchestrator's checks and the figures). The working service and the checkout `Aperas/` still run the old code, and the real mirror is not migrated: both wait for the cutover.",
