    "title": "**The Done when, checked**",
    "text": "**The Done when, checked**: (1) each group is followed by the test groups of the code it moved, green on the new engine in `commit`: the last run is `commit` 1049 of 1049 in 19.6 s by the Coder and 21.2 s by the orchestrator (budget 60 s), `essential` 74 of 74 in 2.9 s and 3.2 s (budget 5 s), `models` 187 of 187, `tools` 14 of 14, `--group corpus` 21 of 21, `tsc` clean for `core`, `cli` and `web`. (2) The commands and the service that no test group covered have their tests of [step 10](#id/BlockNode:00D3Z01YER001), written before their group moved: `commands/` for the reads in piece 2 and for the writes, `track` and `project` in piece 3, `service/` in piece 4 (`runLinkCandidates` was waived and went with its verb in piece 1). (3) A move of a node after an anchor in its own subtree is refused and the service goes on answering: piece 6 (`commands/moveIntoOwnSubtree.test.ts`, a regular test in `commit`). (4) The differential run of Verification Plan Layer 4 is not run here: it is [Batch 13's step 3](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W0013),, as piece 10's entry says; the list of the deliberate differences it is to be read against is in Layer 4.",
