    "title": "**The ten pieces and their checks**",
    "text": "**The ten pieces and their checks**: [piece 1](#id/BlockNode:00D76BQ2MR003), the manual links removed (`aperas link` and `aperas unlink` gone, a `Link` has no `predicate` in the code; `commit` 904 of 904 in 39.5 s); [piece 2](#id/BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0000), the tests before the reads, `commands/` (59 cases; 17 of 17 mutations caught; `commit` 963 of 963 in 43 s); [piece 3](#id/BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0001), the tests before the writes, `track` and `project` (79 cases and case `5g`; 22 of 23 mutations caught, the survivor not reachable by a command; `commit` 1043 of 1043 in 49.5 s) and the reproduction of the move into its own subtree; [piece 4](#id/BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0002), the tests before the service, `service/` (50 cases, then 66 after the follow-up of the Coder's Turn 22; every arm of `handle()` reached; 9 of 9 mutations caught; `commit` 938 of 938 in 18.2 s); [piece 5](#id/BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0003), the engine-side handle and the write layer beside the old code (`shell/db.ts`, `writeLayer.ts`; 37 cases in `commit` and 20 seeds in `models`; 23 of 24 mutations caught, the survivor equivalent; `commit` 975 of 975 in 18.1 s); [piece 6](#id/BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0004), the flip (the shell, the cli and the service on the `Db`, the maps and the write layer; 12 of 12 mutations; `commit` 999 of 999 in 19.8 s by the Coder and 25.6 s by the orchestrator); [piece 7](#id/BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0005), reads, link integrity, profiles and views (the callers on `liveAtPath`, the order rules; `commands/order.test.ts` 18 cases; 21 of 21 mutations; `commit` 1018 of 1018 in 17.7 s and 18.9 s); [piece 8](#id/BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0006), ingest, track and project (`commands/ingest.test.ts` 11 cases; 21 of 22 mutations, the 22nd equivalent; `commit` 1029 of 1029 in 18.3 s and 18.6 s); [piece 9](#id/BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0007), writes and tombstones (found almost all done by the flip; a model of 20 seeds over `runRemove`; 11 of 11 mutations; `commit` 1032 of 1032 in 20.0 s and 20.6 s); [piece 10](#id/BlockNode:00D76BQ2N0008), the sweeps and the service lifecycle (23 of 23 mutations; `commit` 1049 of 1049 in 19.6 s and 21.2 s).",
