    "title": "**The split of the suites**",
    "text": "**The split of the suites**: [the `commit` suite split](#id/BlockNode:00D792XEJ8001), the preparation the survey asked for before piece 4: `commit` keeps the fast files, the seven seeded model files go to `models` (budget 30 s) and the runner's own test to `tools` (budget 30 s), and `runner/suites.test.ts` holds each file outside `corpus/` in exactly one of the three; after it `essential` 74 of 74 in 3.6 s, `commit` 888 of 888 in 15.4 s, `models` 145 of 145 in 12.0 s, `tools` 14 of 14 in 14.0 s. At the end of the batch `commit` has 62 files and 1049 cases.",
