    "title": "**The deliberate differences, in sum**",
    "text": "**The deliberate differences, in sum**: the entries of [Layer 4](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQW6AR002) hold twenty-seven: twelve of the flip, seven of the order rules (piece 7), two of ingest, track and project (piece 8) and six of the sweeps and the service lifecycle (piece 10); pieces 2 to 5 and 9 add none, and the removal of `aperas link` and `aperas unlink` (piece 1) is in Layer 4's own list. The main one: a tombstone leaves its list, a removal also tombstones the container it empties, and a removed node is pruned at the next sweep.",
