    "title": "**Resolved (2026-10-21)**",
    "text": "**Resolved (2026-10-21)**: [Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C) piece 10, in `Aperas.dev` (staged, not committed), wrote the last of the tests of [step 10](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3Z01YER001) that were to stand before their group moved, so every group that Batch 11 moved has its tests: the reads in piece 2 (`commands/render.test.ts`, `resolve.test.ts`, `views.test.ts`, 59 cases), the writes, `track` and `project` in piece 3 (79 cases and case `5g` of the ingest chain), the service in piece 4 (`service/`, 50 cases and 66 after the follow-up, every arm of `handle()` reached), and in the pieces after them `commands/order.test.ts` (18), `commands/ingest.test.ts` (11), the model of the removal rule (20 seeds) and, in piece 10, `service/flush.test.ts` (6) and the added cases of `service/lifecycle.test.ts`, `service/refusal.test.ts` and `service/ops.test.ts`; `runLinkCandidates` was waived and went with its verb in piece 1. `commit` 1049 of 1049 in 19.6 s by the Coder and 21.2 s by the orchestrator. The working service and `Aperas/` run the old code until the cutover, and the tests are of `Aperas.dev`.",
