    "title": "2026-10-21, [Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C) in `Aperas.dev`",
    "text": "2026-10-21, [Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3XQQ2W000C) in `Aperas.dev`: the layers above the engine moved onto it, in ten pieces of one coder turn each. The shell of `Aperas.dev` now runs on the engine: the cli commands and the service boot, reload, flush, sweep and stop on it through the handle and the write layer. The flip (piece 6) is committed by the user as `074670f`; pieces 7 to 10 are staged and not committed.",
