    "text": "Promoted (2026-10-21) to [the done record of piece 10](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D80J973R001) and [of Batch 11](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D80JWQKR001) (Batch 11 retitled done and moved to the plan's Archive), with the six deliberate differences of piece 10 in [Layer 4](../planning/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D80JEFKR001); the issues [no test calls most commands of the CLI or the service](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D3YFXDC8001) and [the load computes `danglingRefs` and the service never reads it](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D258W098001) resolved, and a dated entry on [a write to a thread node never marks the `.state/` mirror dirty](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CVNZXVR8001); the flag `--start-anyway` and the side file name into [Packaging — Design](../design/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00D76B1ZTR001); the milestone and the Current Status in [Core — History](../history/core.md#id/BlockNode:00D80M96P8001); the Dashboard's In flight updated.",
